window.MA_DOCS = [{"path":"docs/guide.md","title":"使用指南","group":"指南","content":"# 使用指南\n\nMotion Atlas 是一个面向**按时间线播放的影像视频、交互操作台与展示台**的参考库，关心画面在时间里怎么走：节拍、动势、转场、反馈与收尾。\n\n每一条资料都同时给出三样东西：\n\n1. **拆解**：镜头、信息层、文字、事件、声音分轨描述，附节拍表、能量曲线与动效 Token。\n2. **Prompt**：可直接复用的实现 Prompt（给代码模型）、视频生成 Prompt（给视频模型）与负向约束。\n3. **Demo**：HTML/CSS/JS，案例作品代码放在 `film/`；重放巧思在入口配置来源片段，拆分型保留自己的机制代码；按时间播放的Demo 还能逐帧渲染成视频。\n\n## 收录边界\n\n本库收录以时间线为载体的作品：作品掌握节奏，按时间线播放；即使可以交互，也是在时间线上分支。每个时间驱动的 Demo 都能逐帧渲染成视频。\n\n**收录**\n- 影像视频：片头、宣传片、旅行影像、数据短片等\n- 交互操作台与展示台：带自动驾驶时间轴的终端、档案界面、展会展示\n- 能从案例中单独借用的转场、节奏、文字动效、画面构成、信息层、质感、声音与镜头巧思\n\n**不收录**\n- 网站与网页应用，包括其中的页面动效和微交互。这类设计收录在 Web Atlas。\n\n**判定**\n1. 最终形态是视频，或是带时间轴、按时间线播放的操作台／展示台：收录，即使它运行在浏览器里。\n2. 最终形态是网站或网页应用：不收录。\n3. 仍难判断时，设想把它逐帧导出为视频。核心价值仍在，收录；价值依赖重排、滚动阅读和观看者自己的节奏，不收录。\n4. 同一来源在两种载体上都有价值时，只收录时间线部分，条目本身保持完整。\n5. 主题相同、表现形式不同的作品可以分别出现在两个库里，各自是独立条目，互不引用。\n6. 画幅不是判据：原作即使是固定画幅，复刻时也可以调整或拓展。各判据冲突时，以“谁掌握时间”为准。例如一个固定画幅、但完全由观看者拖拽操作、没有时间线的网页光照演示，不属于本库。\n\n## 站点结构\n\n| 页面 | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| [首页](../index.html) | 概览、载体入口、案例与巧思类型入口 |\n| [案例库](../cases.html) | 2 个完整作品：可按载体筛选；详情页提供首屏刻度条、节拍表、加载进度、声音开关、全屏与 Prompt；固定画幅案例支持横竖切换 |\n| [巧思库](../patterns.html) | 从案例里拆出来的单个技巧：触发、结果、参数、组合关系、减少动态策略 |\n| [素材库](../materials.html) | 视频制作 skill 与工具：工作流、适用边界、作者效果图（未复刻）、原文快照、安装与许可；支持收藏与备份 |\n| [节奏实验室](../lab.html) | 多音色节拍器、A/B 吸附对比、打拍录入、曲线与拍子；导出 CSS 变量、MotionKit 乐谱代码、Prompt 与 WAV |\n| 文档中心 | 本页所在处：指南、案例 Prompt 与巧思 Prompt |\n| [Agent 工作流](../agent.html) | 给编码 Agent 的结构化索引、资料包与 CLI |\n\n## 两种载体\n\n- **影像视频（video）**：最终产物是一段视频。所有元素写在时间轴上，`render(t)` 只依赖时间 `t`，可以拖动刻度、跳到节拍、逐帧导出。代表：地图巡礼。\n- **交互操作台（console）**：用户在界面上做选择、锁定、确认。重点是**输入 → 反馈 → 余波 → 回程**这条链，以及空闲时界面如何“呼吸”。代表：莱茵生命档案终端。\n\n地图巡礼属于影像视频，档案终端属于交互操作台。两者都可以按时间轴播放与导出视频。\n\n## 画幅、声音与加载\n\n地图巡礼与档案终端分别提供横屏 **1920×1080** 和竖屏 **1080×1920** 两套固定构图。舞台整体等比缩放到详情页的黑色容器内；工具栏切换画幅时保持当前时刻，刻度条与播放 / 暂停按钮位于舞台下方。桌面上舞台随视口高度适配，完整显示画面与刻度条。\n\n两者的配乐和事件音都由 MotionKit 的 WebAudio 引擎合成，默认静音，可用详情页声音开关开启；浏览器若显示“待启用”，点击舞台或再次点击声音按钮。乐谱与画面共用时间轴，渲染时加 `--audio` 可输出音轨。必要资源先预加载，详情页显示进度；地图巡礼按镜头计划渐进缓冲瓦片，缓冲不足时保留当前画面并等待。\n\n- **地图巡礼**：60 秒的关西三日路线，从上海飞抵关西机场，再到京都伏见稻荷、鸭川、奈良公园和大阪道顿堀；照片卡片与明信片均为程序绘制的原创场景。\n- **档案终端**：77.6 秒的莱茵生命档案界面，五类各八份记录。上下翻档、左右切列均首尾循环，并记住各列选择；使用方向键或按钮、Enter 读取、Escape 返回。拖动刻度条会恢复预设演示。\n\n档案终端的5个巧思使用自适应布局，不显示横竖画幅切换按钮。声音通过共享运行时控制。\n\n## 怎么用这份资料\n\n### 想做一支视频\n\n1. 在案例库按“影像视频”筛选，挑一个节奏接近的案例，先看**节拍表**和**能量曲线**，确认起伏结构是你要的。\n2. 复制“视频生成 Prompt”，把主题、地点、配色换成你的内容；保留时长、节拍与镜头语言部分。\n3. 如果要用代码出片：用 CLI 导出 Demo，保留仓库相对树；在 `film/` 改文案、颜色与时刻表，时间纯函数作品用 `MotionKit.mountFilm` 接入，入口路径见导出的 `README.md`；启动静态服务后，用 `node scripts/render.mjs <入口URL> --fps 30` 渲染成帧序列（装有 ffmpeg 时自动合成 MP4）。详见 [渲染管线](pipeline.md)。\n\n### 想做一个可操作的界面\n\n1. 在案例库按“交互操作台”筛选，读“交互”一栏：每个输入对应的反馈与时长。\n2. 去巧思库挑骨架（foundation）、支撑（support）与点睛（accent）三类巧思组合，一般 **1 个骨架 + 2–4 个支撑 + 1–2 个点睛** 就够了，更多会互相抢戏。\n3. 把巧思的实现 Prompt 拼进你的需求描述里，或按巧思类型重放来源案例片段、复用自身机制代码。\n\n### 想调手感\n\n去 [节奏实验室](../lab.html)，按四步练习：\n\n1. **感受节拍**：选拍号、BPM、鼓组 / 木块 / 电子 / 机械音色，听重拍、拍与细分，比较三连音和摇摆；可用打拍测速确定速度。\n2. **理解吸附**：载入示例或打拍录入事件，调首拍偏移和量化强度，交替听 A 原始 / B 吸附后；时间线与早晚毫秒数同步显示变化。\n3. **曲线 × 时长 × 拍子**：拖缓动曲线，调时长和错峰，把起步或最后一个元素的落点对到小节重拍，配合线性对照和轨迹观察。\n4. **导出**：复制 CSS 变量、MotionKit 乐谱代码或 Prompt，或将当前循环导出为 WAV。事件按秒保存，改 BPM 不会自动缩放已录事件；需要按新速度生成示例时重新载入。\n\n方法论见 [节奏方法](rhythm.md)。\n\n## 本地运行\n\n需要 Node.js 22 以上，无需安装依赖；截图与渲染需要本机 Edge 或 Chrome，合成 MP4 另需 PATH 上的 ffmpeg。\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/serve.mjs --port 4321\n```\n\n然后打开 `http://localhost:4321/`。直接双击 HTML 也能看大部分页面，但地图 Demo 与刻度条需要通过本地服务器访问。\n\n常用命令：\n\n| 命令 | 作用 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `node scripts/build.mjs` | 同步 kit 副本，生成站点数据、Prompt 文档与 Agent 资料包 |\n| `node scripts/capture.mjs` | 按条目里的 `previewAt` 重新截取预览图 |\n| `node scripts/render.mjs <url或路径>` | 逐帧渲染按时间播放的Demo |\n| `node scripts/atlas.mjs search <关键词>` | 命令行检索；`show`、`export` 见 [Agent 工作流](../agent.html) |\n\n## 目录\n\n```text\nentries/cases/*.json      案例条目（唯一内容源）\nentries/patterns/*.json   巧思条目\nentries/materials/*.json  素材条目\nagent-skills/<id>/        上游 skill 固定提交的原样快照与许可\ndemos/cases/<id>/         案例入口 index.html、作品 film/、素材 assets/、字体 fonts/、声音 audio/、库 vendor/、制作 source/ 与许可索引\ndemos/patterns/<id>/      重放型 index.html + motion-kit.js；拆分型保留机制代码，素材引用案例\ndemos/_template/          case-film/、case-native/、pattern-replay/、pattern/\nkit/motion-kit.js         共享运行时（Demo 内为同步副本）\ndocs/                     指南与使用方法\nprompts/                  由条目生成的 Prompt 文档\nagent/                    由条目生成的 Agent 索引与资料包\ndata/                     由条目生成的站点数据\npreviews/                 Demo 实际截图\nscripts/                  服务器、构建、检查、截图、渲染与 CLI\n```\n\n`prompts/`、`agent/`、`data/` 都是生成物，请改 `entries/` 后运行构建，不要手改。\n"},{"path":"docs/rhythm.md","title":"节奏方法：曲线、时长、错峰、拍子","group":"指南","content":"# 节奏方法：曲线、时长、错峰、拍子\n\n“有动感”“有韵律”听起来是感觉，落到实现里其实是四个数和一张表。本篇把本库所有案例共用的节奏方法写下来，[节奏实验室](../lab.html) 可以直接调这些数。\n\n## 一、四个数\n\n### 1. 缓动曲线：决定“性格”\n\n本库的命名 Token 与 `kit/motion-kit.js` 中 `MotionKit.ease` 一一对应：\n\n| Token | cubic-bezier | 性格 | 典型用途 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `snap` | `0.2, 0.9, 0.1, 1` | 机械吸附：一下冲到位，硬停 | 操作台选中、光标跳格、HUD 读数归位 |\n| `glide` | `0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1` | 平滑滑行 | 镜头推移、面板平移、长距离位移 |\n| `emphasized` | `0.2, 0, 0, 1` | 强调进入：起步干脆、尾部很长 | 标题入场、卡片展开、重要信息出现 |\n| `exit` | `0.4, 0, 1, 1` | 加速离场 | 元素退出、转场遮罩收走 |\n| `anticipate` | `0.36, 0, 0.66, -0.56` | 先回拉再出发 | 蓄力、抽卡前的停顿、冲击前的后撤 |\n\n经验规则：\n\n- **进入用减速（ease-out），离开用加速（ease-in）**。离场时长约为进场的 60–75%。\n- 同一屏幕里的主运动只用一种主曲线，其他曲线为它服务。曲线混用是“没有风格”的最常见原因。\n- 回弹（overshoot / outBack）只用于点睛：奖章落定、印章盖下。用在常驻元素上会显得廉价。\n\n### 2. 时长：决定“重量”\n\n| 档位 | 时长 | 用于 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 瞬时 | 60–120ms | 按下反馈、闪白、命中帧 |\n| 短 | 150–250ms | 选中切换、小面板、字符解码的每一跳 |\n| 中 | 300–500ms | 卡片展开、标题入场、转场遮罩 |\n| 长 | 600–1200ms | 镜头推进、地图飞行、整屏揭示 |\n| 场景 | 2–6s | 一个镜头 / 一个段落的停留 |\n\n尺寸越大、移动距离越远，时长越长；但操作台里**用户触发的反馈不要超过 300ms 才开始响应**，可以先给 80ms 的即时反馈，再接长动画。\n\n### 3. 错峰（stagger）：决定“层次”\n\n一组元素依次出现时的间隔。总时长 = 时长 + 错峰 ×（数量 − 1）。\n\n- 错峰 ≈ 时长的 10–20%：看起来是“一组”，有方向感。\n- 错峰 ≈ 时长的 50% 以上：看起来是“一个接一个”，适合打字、逐字冲击。\n- 元素很多时（> 12 个），不要线性错峰，改用按距离错峰（从焦点向外扩散），或给总时长封顶（例如 600ms 内全部出现）。\n\n### 4. 拍子：决定“律动”\n\n视频与带音乐的界面以 BPM 为时间单位。1 拍 = 60 / BPM 秒；120 BPM 时 1 拍 = 500ms，1 小节（4 拍）= 2 秒。\n\n- 先写**拍号表**，再写秒数：`{ beat: 8, text: 'WE MOVE', style: 'slam', hold: 2 }`。改 BPM 时整支片子自动跟着变。\n- 关键事件（切镜、冲击字、闪白）吸附到拍点；次要事件吸附到半拍或十六分；粒子与呼吸动画不吸附，保持自由。\n- 小节第一拍放最重的事件；第 2、4 拍（军鼓拍）适合闪光、斜条纹；反拍（+0.5 拍）适合小幅回弹。\n- `MotionKit.beats(bpm, offset)` 提供 `at(beat)`、`beatOf(t)`、`pulse(t, decay)`、`quantize(t, div)`。\n\n### 5. 吸附：网格、偏移、强度与摇摆\n\n把事件“吸附”到拍上之前，先决定吸到哪种网格、吸多少：\n\n| 参数 | 含义 | 选法 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 网格（细分） | 每拍切成几格：拍 / 半拍 / 三连音 / 十六分 | 网格要和素材的节奏一致。网格太粗会把**切分**（落在反拍上的事件）拉回正拍，节奏变平；三连音素材用十六分或半拍网格会被吸得不均匀，甚至两下挤到同一点 |\n| 首拍偏移 | 第一个重拍在素材里的位置（毫秒） | 音乐通常不是从第 0 帧开始。偏移错了，所有事件都会整齐地吸错半拍 |\n| 量化强度 | 0–100%：每个事件朝网格点移动的比例 | 100% 完全对齐、最“机械”；50–80% 收紧明显的拖拍，又保留一点人手的松动 |\n| 摇摆（swing） | 把成对格子的后一格推迟，100% = 三连音 shuffle（长短比 2:1） | 只作用于半拍、十六分网格。爵士、嘻哈、Lo-fi 的律动在摇摆里；用直拍网格吸附会把它拉直 |\n\n拍号决定重音的位置：4/4 是“强—弱—次强—弱”，3/4 是“强—弱—弱”；6/8、7/8 按八分音符计拍，分别按 3+3、2+2+3 分组，小节第一拍是重拍，后续每组第一拍是次强拍。重的动作放小节重拍，次要强调放次强拍。\n\n### 6. 在节奏实验室里练\n\n[节奏实验室](../lab.html) 按这个顺序安排，声音和画面都跟随同一个音乐时钟：\n\n1. **感受节拍**：节拍器分小节重拍、拍、细分三级音色与音量，改速度、拍号、细分、摇摆在下一个格子立刻生效；可以打拍测速。\n2. **理解吸附**：一圈 1–4 小节的时间线，A 道是原始事件、B 道是吸附后，箭头标出移动量；“A/B 交替”一圈放原始、一圈放吸附后。示例里有拖拍、切分、三连音、摇摆和真实剪辑点；也可以在打拍板上跟着节拍器敲一圈，录下自己的时刻再吸附，并看到每一下早 / 晚多少毫秒。\n3. **曲线 × 时长 × 拍子**：预览每小节重播一次，可选“落点踩重拍”或“起步踩重拍”，起步有呼啸、落定有提示音；时长与错峰可以一键设为几分之一拍或网格步长。\n4. **导出**：CSS 变量、MotionKit 代码（含节拍器与事件的乐谱）、Prompt 片段，以及用同一套合成音色离线渲染的 WAV。\n\n## 二、能量曲线\n\n每个案例都有一条 0–1 的能量曲线（`energy`），把整支片子按等间隔采样，描述“此刻画面有多激动”。它不是动画参数，而是**设计前的草图**：\n\n- 好的曲线有**起伏**：起—承—转—合，或“慢—快—停—快—停”。一直在高位会疲劳，一直在低位会无聊。\n- 高潮前要有**低谷或停顿**：先把能量压下来再释放。\n- 结尾要**回落**，给观众时间读结果：结算板、尾卡、统计数字。\n\n画法：先用 8–16 个点手画曲线，再给每段配“能量对应的手段”——低能量用留白、慢镜头、单一元素；高能量用密集节拍、色块轮换、震动、多层叠加。\n\n## 三、分层\n\n把画面拆成独立的轨道，每条轨道各自有节奏，叠起来才有层次：\n\n| 轨道 | 内容 | 节奏特征 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| CAM 镜头 | 推拉摇移、缩放脉冲、震动 | 慢、连续；在重拍上加脉冲 |\n| HUD 信息层 | 时间码、坐标、状态、进度 | 常驻、低调；读数变化用 `snap` |\n| TYPE 文字 | 标题、字幕、标签 | 在段落开头出现，跟拍或跟语义 |\n| FX 特效 | 闪白、扫描线、遮罩、粒子 | 短促，压在重拍上 |\n| SFX 声音 | 点击、冲击、环境 | 与 FX 同步；默认关闭，由用户开启 |\n\n原则：**同一时刻最多一条轨道当主角**。镜头在大幅运动时，文字保持静止；文字冲击时，镜头只做小脉冲。\n\n## 四、交互的节奏\n\n操作台的节奏随用户操作展开，但同样可以设计：\n\n1. **输入**：按下瞬间 60–120ms 给形变或亮度反馈。\n2. **反馈**：结果出现，用主曲线，150–300ms。\n3. **余波**：涟漪、读数滚动、关联元素轻微跟随，延迟 40–120ms 出现。\n4. **回程**：状态稳定后进入空闲呼吸（2–4s 周期，幅度 ≤ 2%）。\n\n\n本库的交互 Demo 还有一条**自动驾驶时间轴**：没有用户输入时按预设事件表演示自己；一旦有真实输入就切换到实时时钟；外部 seek 或播放时再回到自动驾驶。这样同一份代码既能被操作，也能被录成视频。\n\n## 五、减少动态\n\n所有 Demo 都遵守 `prefers-reduced-motion`：\n\n- 位移、缩放、旋转、震动 → 改为透明度淡入或直接出现。\n- 闪烁、频闪（> 3 次/秒）→ 去掉。\n- 自动播放的长动画 → 停在一个能读懂的关键帧，保留手动播放。\n- 节拍信息不要只靠运动传达：同时用颜色、文字或计数显示。\n"},{"path":"docs/prompting.md","title":"Prompt 写法","group":"指南","content":"# Prompt 写法\n\n本库每个案例有三段 Prompt：**实现 Prompt**（给代码模型，产出可运行的 HTML/CSS/JS）、**视频生成 Prompt**（给视频模型，英文）、**负向约束**（两者通用）。每个巧思有一段实现 Prompt。本篇说明它们为什么这样写，以及如何改写成你自己的。\n\n## 一、实现 Prompt 的骨架\n\n动态设计的 Prompt 最容易犯的错，是只描述“看起来什么样”，不描述“在时间里怎么走”。本库的实现 Prompt 固定按下面的顺序写：\n\n1. **产物与约束**：做什么、多长、什么技术、能不能 seek。\n   > 做一支 30 秒的节拍动态字幕 MV（HTML/CSS/JS，可 seek），96 BPM、12 小节……\n2. **时间结构**：分段与每段的起止（秒或拍），即节拍表。用 ①②③ 编号，每段一句话说清楚“出现什么、怎么动、停多久、怎么走”。\n3. **视觉系统**：配色（给色值）、字体（给字重与字族方向）、版式网格、质感。\n4. **动效参数**：曲线、时长、错峰、缩放幅度、震动像素数。写数字，不写“流畅”“有冲击力”。\n5. **信息层与交互**：HUD 内容、键盘/指针操作、每个输入的反馈。\n6. **工程约定**：作品代码放 `film/`；时间纯函数作品提供 `renderAt(t)` 与时长、尺寸并调用 `MotionKit.mountFilm`；有自己时钟、状态或交互的作品自己接 MotionKit 并提供 `window.__motion`。\n7. **可访问性与边界**：减少动态时的替代、最小字号、版权边界（不使用原作素材）。\n\n一个好用的检验：**把 Prompt 交给两个不同的模型，产出的时间结构应该几乎一样**，差异只在细节。\n\n## 二、视频生成 Prompt 的骨架\n\n视频模型对镜头语言与运动描述更敏感，对精确数值不敏感。本库的视频 Prompt 用英文，按这个顺序：\n\n1. **格式**：画幅、时长、帧率感、节拍。`1920×1080, 30 seconds at 96 BPM, every change locked to the beat.`\n2. **画面基调**：媒介、配色、质感。`Flat solid color fields cycling between charcoal, signal red, electric blue and off-white.`\n3. **主体与动作**：按时间顺序写镜头，每个镜头一句：主体 + 运动 + 镜头运动。\n4. **转场**：明确写转场方式（hard cut / wipe from left / mask reveal / match cut）。\n5. **文字**：如果画面里有字，写清内容、位置与出现方式；视频模型对文字仍不稳定，关键文字建议后期叠加。\n6. **结尾**：怎么收。\n\n## 三、负向约束\n\n负向约束列出这个风格**最容易跑偏的方向**。约束要具体，避免泛泛写“低质量、模糊”。\n\n## 四、改写成你自己的\n\n保留**结构与数字**，替换**内容与品牌**：\n\n| 保留 | 替换 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 分段数量、每段时长、节拍与 BPM | 主题、地点、角色、文案 |\n| 曲线、时长、错峰、缩放幅度 | 色值（但保持明度关系与对比） |\n| 信息层的层级与位置 | HUD 里的具体字段 |\n| 转场方式与顺序 | 转场遮罩的形状（星形 → 你的标志形状） |\n\n换色时注意保持**明度节奏**：原方案里“深—亮—深—亮”的段落交替，换色后也应该保持，否则节奏感会塌。\n\n## 五、组合巧思\n\n巧思条目有 `composition.role`：\n\n- **骨架（foundation）**：决定主视觉与信息层级，一个作品通常只有一个。例：分屏对比、档案阵列、可 seek 时间轴。\n- **支撑（support）**：负责一个区域的交互或信息。例：角标 HUD、滚动数字、下三分之一字幕条。\n- **点睛（accent）**：短时、局部的强调。例：印章盖下、斜切插入、冲击字。\n\n组合时把各巧思的实现 Prompt 按“骨架 → 支撑 → 点睛”的顺序拼接，并在最前面补一段总述（产物、时长、配色）；检查 `pairsWellWith` 与 `conflicts`，冲突的两个巧思不要放在同一时刻。\n\n## 六、模板\n\n### 实现 Prompt 模板\n\n```text\n做一个 [时长] 秒的 [载体：影像视频 / 交互操作台]（HTML/CSS/JS，零依赖，可 seek）。\n时间结构（[BPM] BPM）：\n① [0–X 秒 / 第 1–4 拍] [出现什么]，[怎么动：曲线 + 时长]，停留 [N] 拍，[怎么离场]。\n② ……\n视觉：底色 [色值]，主色 [色值]，强调色 [色值]；标题 [字族/字重]，HUD [等宽体]；[网格/留白规则]。\n动效：主曲线 cubic-bezier([…])，元素时长 [ms]，错峰 [ms]；重拍缩放脉冲 [%]；冲击震动 [px]。\n信息层：[HUD 字段与位置]。交互：[输入 → 反馈 → 余波]。\n工程：作品代码与样式放 film/，制作过程放 source/。时间纯函数作品提供 renderAt(t)、时长与尺寸，用 MotionKit.mountFilm；有自己时钟、状态或交互的作品自己接 MotionKit 并提供 window.__motion。只重放案例片段的巧思用 MotionKit.replay 引用来源。\n边界：所有文字 ≥ 12px；prefers-reduced-motion 时去掉位移与闪烁；不使用任何第三方作品的素材与名称。\n```\n\n### 视频生成 Prompt 模板\n\n```text\n[Medium/style] video, [W×H], [N] seconds at [BPM] BPM, cuts locked to the beat.\nLook: [palette with names], [texture], [lighting].\nShot 1 (0–Xs): [subject] [action], camera [movement].\nShot 2 …: transition by [wipe/cut/mask], …\nOn-screen text: [content], [position], appears by [method].\nEnding: [how it resolves].\n```\n\n### 负向约束模板\n\n```text\nNo [风格最容易跑偏的方向 1], no [2], no [3]; no off-beat random motion; no third-party logos, characters or copyrighted footage.\n```\n\n## 七、节奏实验室导出的片段\n\n[节奏实验室](../lab.html) 的“Prompt 片段”标签会把拍号、BPM、细分网格、首拍偏移、摇摆、量化强度、吸附后的事件时刻，以及曲线、时长、错峰和声音安排写成可直接粘贴的约束文本，放在实现 Prompt 的“动效”一节即可。先用 A/B 对比或打拍录入确认落点，再导出；CSS、MotionKit 乐谱代码与 WAV 也使用当前参数。\n"},{"path":"docs/methodology.md","title":"条目结构","group":"指南","content":"# 条目结构\n\n案例描述一个完整作品，巧思描述一种“触发 → 效果”的手法。两者都配有参数、Prompt和可运行的Demo。案例作品位于 `film/`，制作过程位于 `source/`；时间纯函数作品用 `MotionKit.mountFilm`，有自己时钟、状态或交互的作品自己接 MotionKit。\n\n## 案例\n\n| 内容 | 字段 | 页面位置与用途 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 名称与简介 | `title`、`subtitle`、`summary` | 列表卡片和详情页开头，说明作品是什么 |\n| 载体与标签 | `carriers`、`tags` | 工具栏筛选与详情标签，区分影像视频和交互操作台 |\n| 设计重点 | `focus` | 概述，说明画面如何组织 |\n| 节拍与能量 | `rhythm.beats`、`energy`、`energySegments`、`energyNote` | 节奏结构与舞台刻度条，定位事件、查看起伏与数值来源 |\n| 视觉与声音 | `composition`、`tokens` | 构成与动效参数，查看颜色、字体、版式、时长和缓动 |\n| 画面分层 | `layers` | 画面分层，理解镜头、信息、文字与声音如何叠加 |\n| 画面细节 | `observations` | 画面细节，按时刻或内容查看具体变化 |\n| 操作与状态 | `interaction` | 交互与状态，了解播放、暂停、定位和手动操作 |\n| Prompt | `prompt`、`videoPrompt`、`negativePrompt` | Prompt标签，可复制实现指令、视频指令与负向约束 |\n| 复用设置 | `migration` | 迁移指南，了解可调整的内容与参数 |\n| 适用范围 | `useCases`、`avoid`、`constraints` | 适用与边界，判断是否适合自己的作品 |\n| 关联巧思 | `patternIds` | 关联巧思，打开各手法的说明和独立Demo |\n\n节拍包含时间`t`、名称`label`与画面说明`note`。点击节拍时间，可在Demo中定位到相应画面。能量曲线使用0–1的数值：`energy`按等间隔采样，铺满作品时长；`energySegments`按`{ t0, t1, from, to, label }`记录各段实际起止秒数与起止能量，段内线性插值，交界可跳变，同时存在时优先显示分段曲线。`energyNote`说明数值来源，在节奏结构中显示。\n\n## 巧思\n\n| 内容 | 字段 | 页面位置与用途 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 名称与简介 | `title`、`summary` | 列表卡片与详情标题，快速认识手法 |\n| 类型与载体 | `types`、`carriers` | 工具栏筛选和详情标签 |\n| 机制、触发与效果 | `mechanism`、`trigger`、`effect` | 机制，说明怎么开始、画面怎么变化 |\n| 动效参数 | `timing` | 参数表，查看时长、缓动、错峰和幅度 |\n| 实现指令 | `prompt` | 可复用Prompt，复制后替换内容与品牌 |\n| 组合 | `composition` | 组合，查看骨架、支撑、点睛职责及搭配关系 |\n| 可访问性 | `accessibility` | 可访问性，了解减少动态与键盘操作 |\n| 所属案例 | `sources[].caseId` | 详情末尾的案例标题链接，打开完整作品 |\n\n巧思的`sources`只存`caseId`。重放型用 `MotionKit.replay` 引用来源案例片段；拆分型保留机制代码，素材引用来源案例。对应案例的`patternIds`包含该巧思，形成双向关联。\n\n## Demo与Prompt\n\n详情页上方是Demo舞台、播放按钮、刻度条和节拍点。拖动定位，或用播放与跳拍查看动作。详情正文列出参数，文档中心则将指令分为“案例Prompt”和“巧思Prompt”。\n\n使用方法见[使用指南](guide.md)，节拍与曲线见[节奏方法](rhythm.md)，指令写法见[Prompt写法](prompting.md)，视频导出见[渲染管线](pipeline.md)。\n"},{"path":"docs/pipeline.md","title":"渲染管线：舞台、时间轴、声音与预加载","group":"指南","content":"# 渲染管线：舞台、时间轴、声音与预加载\n\n本库按时间播放的 Demo 通过 `window.__motion` 提供定位与播放；时间纯函数作品的**画面只取决于时刻 t**，有自己时钟、状态或交互的作品负责重建相应画面。同一份代码可以实时播放、被站点刻度条拖动、被脚本逐帧渲染成视频，结果完全一致。Motion Kit v2 在此基础上提供四件事：\n\n- **固定画幅舞台** `MotionKit.stage()`：横屏 1920×1080、竖屏 1080×1920 两套构图，整体等比缩放（黑边），舞台内部只用像素。\n- **声音引擎** `MotionKit.audio`：零素材的 WebAudio 合成音色库 + 乐谱调度；同一份乐谱可离线渲染成 WAV。\n- **预加载** `MotionKit.preload()`：资源就绪后才宣告 ready，进度可被站点显示。\n- **宿主通信**：站点用 postMessage 切换画幅、开关声音，Demo 回报就绪、画幅、加载进度与声音状态。\n\n地图巡礼、莱茵生命档案终端与地图巡礼的12个巧思使用固定舞台、预加载与乐谱。档案终端的5个巧思使用自适应布局与即时音效。\n\n参考模板：`demos/_template/case-film/`（时间纯函数作品）、`case-native/`（作品自接 MotionKit）、`pattern-replay/`（片段重放）与 `pattern/`（拆分型单文件）。模板预览直接引用 `kit/motion-kit.js`；作为条目时改为加载同目录的 `motion-kit.js`，由构建同步。\n\n## mountFilm 与 replay\n\n画面只取决于时刻 t 的作品，把代码与样式放在 `film/`，由根 `index.html` 加载字体、`motion-kit.js` 与作品入口，再调用 `MotionKit.mountFilm(config)`。它创建舞台、时间轴、控制条与 `window.__motion`，并按 URL 参数启动，返回时间轴。\n\n| 配置 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `film` | `{ renderAt(t) → void｜Promise, duration, width, height, fps }` |\n| `title`、`bpm` | 可选，写入 `__motion` |\n| `root` | 舞台根节点或选择器 |\n| `orients`、`sizes`、`background` | 传给 `MotionKit.stage` |\n| `markers` | `{ t, label }[]`；各案例在 `index.html` 从自己的 cues 换算 |\n| `accent` | 控制条强调色 |\n| `rates` | 播放速率，默认 `[0.5, 0.75, 1, 1.25, 1.5, 2]` |\n| `step` | `'seconds'`（默认）或 `'frames'`；后者按 `film.fps` 逐帧步进 |\n| `start` | `{ t: 0, reduced: <秒> }` |\n| `audio` | 可选 `{ src, mime }`；音轨后台加载，开启声音时等待；以时间轴为时钟，偏差超过 0.08 秒时校正，`?render` 下禁声 |\n\n`renderAt(t)` 的 Promise 负责作品资源就绪；媒体音轨不阻塞 `__motion.ready`。cue 数据结构属于案例；通用接入只接收换算好的 markers。\n\n只重放案例片段的巧思调用 `MotionKit.replay(config)`，由 `segments` 拼接片段并复用来源案例 iframe，返回外层时间轴。每条片段用 `caseId`、`from`、`to` 指定来源与时间范围；`title`、`accent`、`markers`、`fps`、`reduced` 配置外层播放，`overlay` 指定巧思自己的 cue 说明层。来源入口为 `../../cases/<id>/index.html?embed=1&render=1`；外层提供 `__motion`、控制条、URL 定位、声音同步及画幅与加载状态。重放型目录只放 `index.html` 与同步的 `motion-kit.js`；有自身机制的巧思保留机制代码，素材引用来源案例。\n\n有自己时钟、状态或交互的作品在 `film/` 内自己接 MotionKit，使用下面的舞台、时间轴与协议接口；地图巡礼的缓冲和档案终端的仿真、交互由作品控制。\n\n## 一、约定\n\n1. 把画面写成 `render(t)`：给定时刻 `t`（秒），把 DOM / Canvas / SVG 设置成那一刻的样子。**不要**在 render 里读 `Date.now()`、`performance.now()` 或累加状态。\n2. 随机数用 `MotionKit.rng(seed)` 生成，并在 render 内按 `t` 派生（例如 `rng(seed + Math.floor(t * 24))`），保证同一时刻结果一致。\n3. 舞台内部只用舞台像素，不用 `vw / vh / % / clamp()` 或媒体查询改变布局；横竖两套构图写在 `[data-orient=\"landscape\"]` / `[data-orient=\"portrait\"]` 下。\n4. 时间写成“第几拍”，画面与乐谱读同一张节拍表；几何元素（路线、节点、连线、刻度）由同一个坐标函数计算并取整到像素。\n5. 需要异步资源（地图瓦片、字体、图片）时：播放前用 `preload()` 预取；render 仍可以返回 Promise，`seek(t)` 会等待它完成（渲染模式下逐帧等待）。\n\n```js\nconst MK = MotionKit, BT = MK.beats(120), at = (b) => BT.at(b);\nconst stage = MK.stage();                                   // 1. 固定画幅舞台（#stage）\nfunction layout(orient) { /* 按画幅重建几何 */ }\nlayout(stage.orient);\nstage.on('orient', layout);                                 //    切换画幅：先重建几何，kit 再重新 render 当前时刻\nMK.preload([MK.preload.fonts(), MK.preload.image('photo.jpg')]); // 2. 预加载\nconst tl = MK.timeline({\n  duration: at(16),\n  markers: [{ t: 0, label: '开场' }, { t: at(4), label: '落点' }],\n  render(t) {\n    const p = MK.seg(t, at(4), 0.5, MK.ease.emphasized);\n    title.style.transform = `translateY(${(1 - p) * 60}px)`;\n    title.style.opacity = p;\n  },\n});\nMK.audio.attach(tl, [                                       // 3. 乐谱\n  MK.audio.pattern({ bpm: 120, from: at(4), tracks: { kick: 'X...x...', hat: '..x...x.' } }),\n  { t: at(4), voice: 'impact' },\n]);\nMK.expose(tl);                                              // 4. window.__motion（ready 在预加载完成后 resolve）\nMK.controls(tl);                                            // 5. 控制条（?embed / ?render 时不创建）\nMK.start(tl, { t: 0, reduced: at(8) });                     // 6. 按 ?t / 减少动态定位，就绪后自动播放\n```\n\n## 二、舞台 `MotionKit.stage(opts)`\n\n舞台根节点（默认 `[data-stage]`、`#stage` 或 `.stage`）被设为固定像素尺寸，并用 `transform: translate() scale()` 等比缩放到容器（默认整个窗口）居中，四周是黑边。缩放只发生在根节点上，所以根节点的 `clientWidth` 恒为 1920（或 1080）——MapLibre、Canvas 等按 `clientWidth` 测量的库直接按舞台像素工作。\n\n| 选项 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `root` | `[data-stage]` / `#stage` / `.stage` | 舞台根节点或选择器 |\n| `orients` | `['landscape', 'portrait']` | 支持的画幅；只给一个即固定画幅 |\n| `sizes` | `{ landscape: [1920, 1080], portrait: [1080, 1920] }` | 可覆盖，一般不改 |\n| `container` | 窗口 | 缩放容器；给元素时用 ResizeObserver 跟随 |\n| `background` | `#000` | 黑边颜色（CSS 变量 `--mk-letterbox`） |\n| `onOrient` | — | `(orient, {width, height})`，切换画幅时调用（创建时不调用） |\n\n返回的 `stage`：\n\n| 成员 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `orient` / `width` / `height` / `scale` / `portrait` | 当前画幅、舞台尺寸、缩放比例 |\n| `mode` | 画幅来源：`url` / `host` / `user` / `api` / `auto` / `fixed` |\n| `setOrient(o)` | 切换画幅，返回 Promise（重新 render 当前时刻后 resolve）；不支持的画幅返回 false 并回报宿主 |\n| `toggleOrient()` | 横竖互换（控制条按钮用） |\n| `toStage(clientX, clientY)` | 视口坐标 → 舞台像素坐标（交互 Demo 处理指针用） |\n| `fromStage(x, y)` | 舞台像素坐标 → 视口坐标 |\n| `on('orient', fn)` / `on('resize', fn)` | 画幅切换 / 缩放比例变化 |\n| `root` / `orients` / `sizes` | 只读 |\n\n**画幅选择优先级**：URL `?orient=landscape|portrait` → 宿主消息 `motion:orient`（舞台创建前收到的也会生效）→ 都没有时按窗口宽高比自动（只有自动模式会随窗口尺寸变化而切换，带 ±5% 迟滞）。宿主、控制条、`setOrient()` 的运行时切换总会生效并关闭自动模式。\n\n**运行时切换的顺序**：写入舞台尺寸与 `data-orient`（同时挂在 `<html>` 与舞台根上）→ 重新计算缩放 → 调用 `onOrient` 与 `on('orient')`（Demo 在这里重建几何）→ 停止已排程与正在发声的声音 → 向父页面发 `motion:orient` → `tl.seek(tl.time)` 重新 render 当前时刻（播放状态与时刻保持不变）。\n\nCSS 写法（横竖两套构图）：\n\n```css\n.stage { background: #0b0d10; }                       /* 尺寸由 kit 写入，这里不写 */\n.stage > * { position: absolute; }\n[data-orient=\"landscape\"] .title { left: 152px; top: 372px; font-size: 168px; }\n[data-orient=\"portrait\"]  .title { left: 88px;  top: 1350px; font-size: 200px; }\n```\n\n另有 CSS 变量 `--stage-w`、`--stage-h`、`--stage-scale`（挂在 `<html>` 上）。\n\n网站界面文字≥12px。缩放后可在页面中检查实际字号。\n\n**常见注意**：\n\n- 子元素显式写 `visibility: visible` 会盖过父层的 `hidden`；闪烁、显隐优先用 `opacity`。\n- 交互 Demo 的指针坐标一律先过 `stage.toStage()`；不要用 `offsetX`（会受缩放影响）。\n- MapLibre 的鼠标换算本身支持缩放容器；地图画布按舞台像素 × `devicePixelRatio` 渲染，若嫌重可设 `pixelRatio: Math.max(1, devicePixelRatio * stage.scale)` 并在 `stage.on('resize')` 里更新。\n- 渲染模式（`?render`）下视口等于舞台尺寸，`scale` 恰为 1。\n\n## 三、时间轴与 `window.__motion`\n\n`MotionKit.timeline({ duration, render, loop, markers, fps })` 返回控制器；`duration` 可在运行时修改（例如改 BPM 后重算），`loop` 可读写，`setRate(r)` 改变速率。\n\n| 事件 | 回调参数 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `on(fn)` | `(t, playing)` | 每次渲染（播放的每一帧、seek、pause） |\n| `on('play', fn)` / `on('pause', fn)` | `(t)` | 播放 / 暂停（暂停只在原本在播放时触发） |\n| `on('seek', fn)` | `(to, from)` | 跳转（在 render 之前触发；声音调度器据此判断是否打断） |\n| `on('rate', fn)` / `on('loop', fn)` / `on('end', fn)` | | 速率变化 / 循环回绕 / 非循环播放到结尾 |\n\n`MotionKit.expose(tl, meta)` 把时间轴暴露为 `window.__motion`：\n\n| 成员 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `duration` / `markers` / `time` / `playing` / `rate` / `loop` | 同时间轴 |\n| `seek(t)` → Promise、`play()`、`pause()`、`toggle()`、`on()` | 同时间轴 |\n| `ready` | Promise：全部 `preload()` 完成后 resolve（没有预加载时下一轮事件循环即 resolve）。之后 `<html data-motion-ready=\"1\">` 并向父页面发 `motion:ready` |\n| `progress` | 预加载进度 0–1 |\n| `orient` / `orients` / `setOrient(o)` / `stage` | 画幅；**`orients` 为空数组表示自适应Demo**，站点不应显示画幅切换 |\n| `audio` | 离线渲染接口（挂了乐谱时才有，否则为 `null`）：`renderWav({ from, to, sampleRate })` → `{ base64, sampleRate, channels, duration, peakDb, rmsDb, clipped, events }`；`events(from, to)` 列出事件 |\n| `kit` | kit 版本号 |\n| `meta` 里的字段 | 例如 `title`、`bpm`（旧 Demo 还会带 `sound`） |\n\n`MotionKit.start(tl, { t = 0, reduced, autoplay = true })`：按 `?t=` → 减少动态时的 `reduced` → `t` 的顺序定位，预加载完成后重绘一次并自动播放（`?autoplay=0` 与 `?render` 不播放、减少动态不播放）。\n\n## 四、声音 `MotionKit.audio`\n\n### 4.1 链路与音量规范\n\n```\n音色 → 事件增益(gain×校准电平) → 声像(pan) → 总线 music / sfx / ui（bed 属于 music，受侧链闪避）\n     ↘ 混响发送(send) → 高通 220Hz → 卷积混响（程序生成的 2.6s 双声道脉冲响应）→ 返回 ┐\n                                                                          主增益 0.65 → 压缩（-14dB, 3:1）→ 软削波天花板 → 输出\n```\n\n- **峰值上限 -1 dBFS**：最后一级是 WaveShaper 软削波曲线：|x| ≤ 0.6（约 -4.4 dBFS）完全线性，之上用 tanh 软膝趋近 -1 dBFS，超出的输入被钳到曲线端点，所以输出峰值严格低于 -1 dBFS。\n- **默认响度**：模板案例整段 RMS 约 -16 dBFS、短时（400ms）最大约 -10 dBFS、峰值约 -2.6 dBFS；单个音色在力度 1 时峰值大致落在：鼓与冲击 -5 ～ -10 dBFS，界面音 -14 ～ -18 dBFS，铺底与环境底按 RMS 约 -21 ～ -29 dBFS。新乐谱用 `gain`（0–1 为主）做相对平衡，不要靠拉高 `gain` 求响度。\n- `audio.setMix({ master, music, sfx, ui, bed, reverb, trim, sidechain })` 同时作用于实时与离线；默认 `master 0.65, music 0.8, sfx 0.9, ui 0.7, bed 0.7, reverb 0.3`。\n- **侧链闪避**：带 `duck`（0–1）的事件会在触发瞬间压低 bed 总线（pad、drone、air、wind），约 0.3 秒恢复；`kick`、`sub`、`impact`、`stamp`、`thud` 默认带闪避。\n\n### 4.2 开关与状态\n\n- 默认静音。`audio.enable()` / `disable()` / `toggle()`；`enabled` 是用户意图，`state` 是实际状态：`off` 关闭、`on` 正在出声、`blocked` 已开启但被浏览器自动播放策略挡住（等待页面内的一次指针或键盘手势，kit 会自动在那次手势里恢复）。\n- `audio.on('change', (enabled, state) => …)`；状态变化同时向父页面发 `motion:sound`。\n- 页面切到后台：停止调度、淡出并挂起 AudioContext；回到前台后恢复，从当前时刻重新对齐。\n- `audio.meter()` → `{ peak, rms, peakDb, rmsDb }`：输出电平（最近约 43ms），可做电平表；`audio.active`：仍在发声或已排程的声部数。\n- `audio.latency`：主混音链的固定处理延迟，当前为 0.006 秒；不包含设备输出延迟。需要将画面贴合实际听到的声音时，还要结合 AudioContext 的输出时间戳或 `outputLatency`。\n- 渲染模式（`?render`）下 `enable()` 不生效（无头渲染只走离线渲染）。\n\n### 4.3 乐谱与调度\n\n乐谱是一个数组，元素是**事件**或**生成函数**：\n\n```js\nconst SCORE = [\n  { t: 0, voice: 'air', dur: 9.5, vel: 0.6 },                   // 事件：t 秒、音色名、参数\n  { t: 2, voice: 'impact', vel: 0.9, pan: 0, send: 0.4 },\n  MK.audio.pattern({ bpm: 120, from: 2, to: 7,                  // 生成函数 (t0, t1) => events\n    tracks: { kick: 'X...x...X...x.x.', clap: '....X.......X...', hat: '..x...x...x...x.' },\n    voices: { hat: { gain: 0.8 } } }),\n  (t0, t1) => myEvents.filter((e) => e.t >= t0 && e.t < t1),   // 任意生成函数：只返回 [t0, t1) 内的事件\n];\nconst sched = MK.audio.attach(tl, SCORE);   // 一个时间轴挂一份乐谱；sched.set(newScore) 替换（如改 BPM）\n```\n\n事件通用字段（引擎处理）：`t`、`voice`（音色名或自定义函数）、`gain`（事件增益，默认 1）、`pan`（-1–1）、`bus`（`music` / `sfx` / `ui` / `bed`，默认按音色）、`send`（混响发送 0–1，默认按音色）、`duck`（侧链深度）、`seed`（随机种子，默认由音色名与 t 派生，离线结果可复现）。多数音色还接受 `vel`（力度 0–1）与 `note`（MIDI 数字或 `'A4'`、`'C#5'`）/ `f`（Hz）。\n\n`pattern({ bpm, offset, from, to, div = 4, swing, tracks, voices })`：每个字符一步（`div` 步/拍，默认十六分）；`X` 重音、`x` 普通、`o` 弱音、`.` 休止，空格与 `|` 只是分隔；轨道名去掉末尾数字即音色名（`hat2` → `hat`），或在 `voices` 里给 `voice`；`swing` 0–1（1 = 三连音 shuffle）。\n\n**调度行为**（`attach`）：\n\n- 播放时按前瞻窗口（默认 120ms，`attach(tl, score, { lookahead })`）把时间轴时刻映射到 AudioContext 时刻排程，由时间轴每帧与一个40ms定时器共同调度；时间轴掉帧导致偏移超过 80ms 时自动重新对齐。\n- **暂停、跳转（大于 1 帧）、画幅切换、页面转后台**：立即停止本乐谱已排程与正在发声的声部（12–15ms 淡出），连同它们送入的混响尾音一起换新，从新位置继续。暂停后≤60ms输出为数字静音，活跃声部为0。\n- 与当前帧相差不到 1 帧的 seek（例如窗口 resize 时 `seek(tl.time)` 重绘）不打断声音。\n- **持续音接续**：pad、drone、air、wind、riser、reverse、alarm 是“持续型”音色。播放、跳转、暂停后继续、切换画幅、开启声音时，开始于当前时刻之前、此刻仍应发声的持续事件会以 `offset` 从中途接上（快速淡入，扫频与渐强从对应进度继续）；离线渲染从中途开始时同样处理（与整段导出的同一区间RMS相差≤0.1 dB）。\n- 支持 `tl.setRate()` 与 `loop`（循环回绕时继续排程开头的事件）；排程间隔误差0.00ms，按样本精度对齐锚点。\n\n**即时触发**（交互输入）：`audio.play('blip', { note: 'E6', vel: 0.8, pan: -0.3 })` → `{ stop(fade) }`（未开启声音时返回 null）。交互作品的自动驾驶演示仍从乐谱出声；真实输入用 `play()`。\n\n**自定义音色**：`audio.define('myHit', (ctx, out, when, p) => endTime, { bus: 'sfx', send: 0.2, level: 1 })`。在音色里用 `audio.dsp` 的 `osc / noise / gain / filter / perc / drive / panner / fm / noteHz / semis / rng` 创建节点：经 `osc`、`noise` 创建的音源会被引擎登记，暂停时能逐个停止；直接用 `ctx.createOscillator()` 也可以（会被事件增益淡出，但要自己保证会 stop）。\n\n### 4.4 音色库\n\n每个音色是 `(ctx, out, when, params) => 结束时刻` 函数（`audio.voices`），默认总线 / 混响发送 / 校准电平在 `audio.meta`。括号里是默认值。\n\n重拍需要在笔记本扬声器上清晰可辨时，应给低频 `kick` 叠加 `rim`、`click` 等中高频层；节奏实验室的鼓组采用 `kick + rim`。仅用低频峰值判断重音强弱不足以反映小扬声器上的表现。\n\n| 音色 | 总线 | 手段 | 参数 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `kick` 底鼓 | music | 正弦 + 音高包络、噪声点击、饱和 | `note/f`（48Hz 落点）、`punch`（3.6 倍起跳）、`decay`（0.45）、`drive`（0.35）、`click`（0.5）、`vel` |\n| `snare` 军鼓 | music | 两支下滑三角波鼓皮 + 高通噪声响弦 + 峰值 EQ | `note/f`（185）、`decay`（0.2）、`snappy`（0.75）、`bright`（1） |\n| `clap` 拍手 | music | 带通噪声三次重触发 + 尾音 | `decay`（0.22）、`spread`（0.011s）、`tone`（1150Hz） |\n| `hat` / `openhat` 镲 | music | 六支方波金属音（808 比例）+ 高通噪声 | `open`（false）、`decay`（闭 0.055 / 开 0.38）、`tone`（1） |\n| `tom` 通鼓 | music | 正弦下滑 + 带通噪声起音 | `note/f`（110）、`decay`（0.4） |\n| `rim` 边击 | music | 三角 + 方波带通 + 噪声 | `tone`（1） |\n| `sub` 次低频 | music | 808 式滑音正弦 + 轻饱和 | `note/f`（45）、`dur`（0.8）、`release`（0.35）、`glide`（1.6 倍） |\n| `impact` 冲击 | sfx | 下坠次低频 + 棕噪声低通下扫 + 高频爆裂，整体饱和 | `note/f`（62）、`dur`（1.6）、`drive`（0.5）、`crack`（1） |\n| `whoosh` 呼啸 | sfx | 粉噪声双带通扫频 + 起伏包络 + 声像扫过 | `dur`（0.6）、`dir`（`up` / `down`）、`from` / `to`、`q`（2.2）、`peak`（峰值位置 0.7 / 0.3）、`sweep`（0.7） |\n| `riser` 上升音 | sfx | 噪声扫频 + 失谐锯齿上行 + 加速颤音 | `dur`（2）、`from`（250）、`to`（7000）、`tonal`（0.35）、`note/f`（110）、`semis`（12）、`trem`（0.3）、`rateFrom` / `rateTo`（5 / 22Hz） |\n| `reverse` 反向渐强 | sfx | 高通噪声指数渐强后收住，可加和弦层 | `dur`（1.2）、`to`（9000）、`note` / `tonal`（加和弦） |\n| `blip` 提示音 | ui | 正弦上挑 + 轻 FM | `note/f`（1320）、`decay`（0.09）、`bend`（1.26） |\n| `click` 点击 | ui | 高通噪声 + 短正弦 | `note/f`（2400） |\n| `tick` 打字 | ui | 带通噪声颗粒，按种子 ±12% 变调 | `note/f`（3600） |\n| `key` 机械键 | ui | 触发点击 + 键身“咚” + 触底回弹 | `heavy`（0.6） |\n| `confirm` 确认 | ui | 上行 FM 音阶 | `note/f`（C6）、`steps`（`[0, 7]` 半音）、`gap`（0.075） |\n| `error` 错误 | ui | 下行低通方波蜂鸣 + 失真 | `note/f`（311）、`steps`（`[0, -5]`）、`gap`（0.13） |\n| `beep` 蜂鸣 | ui | 平稳短音 | `note/f`（1000）、`dur`（0.12）、`wave`（`sine` / `square` / `triangle`） |\n| `chime` / `bell` 钟铃 | sfx | 左右失谐 FM + 金属泛音 | `note/f`（G6 / C5）、`decay`（1.4 / 3）、`ratio`（3.5 / 1.4）、`index`（1.6 / 3.2）、`bright`、`width`（0.35） |\n| `pluck` 拨弦 | music | 锯齿 + 方波经共振低通快速下落 | `note/f`（440）、`decay`（0.5）、`bright`（1）、`q`（3） |\n| `bass` 贝斯 | music | 双锯齿 + 正弦，共振低通包络，可滑音 | `note/f`（55）、`dur`（0.4）、`cutoff`（520）、`env`（1.6）、`q`（5）、`from` + `glide`（0.06） |\n| `pad` 铺底和弦 | bed | 每音两支失谐锯齿左右展开、低通 + 慢 LFO | `notes`（`[57,60,64,67]`）、`dur`（4）、`attack`（0.8）、`release`（1.6）、`cutoff`（1500）、`lfo`（0.18）、`detune`（8 音分）、`width`（0.6） |\n| `glitch` 故障 | sfx | 随机短颗粒（方波 / 锯齿 / 带通噪声）+ 位深压缩 | `dur`（0.28）、`density`（40/s）、`bits`（4） |\n| `shutter` 快门 | sfx | 开合两次机械咔嗒 + 弹簧余振 | `gap`（0.075） |\n| `stamp` / `thud` 盖章 / 闷响 | sfx | 低频重击 + 低通棕噪声（+ 纸面拍击） | `weight`（1）、`tone`（1）、`slap`（1）/ `decay`（0.35） |\n| `paper` 纸张摩擦 | sfx | 带通噪声 + 颗粒化随机包络 | `dur`（0.45）、`tone`（3200） |\n| `air` / `wind` 环境底 | bed | 左右两路不相关噪声，带通中心随慢 LFO 漂移（wind 带阵风） | `dur`（8）、`fade`（1.5）、`tone`（1800 / 600）、`gust`（wind 0.6） |\n| `sonar` 声呐 | sfx | 正弦脉冲 + 泛音 + 反馈延迟回声 | `note/f`（1250）、`decay`（1.1）、`echo`（0.34s）、`feedback`（0.38） |\n| `alarm` 警报 | sfx | 双音交替方波 + 锯齿，低通 + 失真 | `note/f`（960）、`f2`（0.8 倍）、`rate`（4 次/秒）、`dur`（1.2） |\n| `sparkle` / `shimmer` 闪光 / 微光 | sfx | 五声音阶高音 FM 颗粒随机散布 + 高频空气 | `dur`（0.5 / 1.8）、`count`（9 / 18）、`note/f`（C7 / C6） |\n| `drone` 持续低音 | bed | 失谐锯齿 + 次八度正弦，低通呼吸 | `note/f`（55）、`dur`（6）、`fade`（1.2）、`release`（1.5）、`cutoff`（380）、`lfo`（0.08） |\n| `tone` / `noise` | sfx | 旧 API 的基础音色 | 见 4.6 |\n\n别名：`openhat`（= `hat` + `open`）、`ui-blip`（= `blip`）、`ping`（= `sonar`）、`reverse-swell` / `swell`（= `reverse`）。\n\n### 4.5 离线渲染\n\n`audio.renderOffline(score, duration, { sampleRate = 48000, channels = 2, from = 0, preroll = 2 })` 用 OfflineAudioContext 与**同一套音色、同一条混音链**生成 PCM，返回 `{ data, peakDb, rmsDb, clipped, wav(), base64() }`；`from > 0` 时向前多渲染 `preroll` 秒再裁掉，并接上之前开始的持续音。`audio.encodeWav(channels, sampleRate)` 编码 16-bit PCM WAV。站点或脚本通常通过 `__motion.audio.renderWav()` 调用，它按 `from + audio.latency` 截取，补偿主链路的 6ms 处理延迟，使导出的第 0 个样本对齐画面的 `from`。直接使用 `renderOffline()` 时由调用方处理这项补偿。\n\n### 4.6 旧 API 兼容\n\n`MotionKit.sound()` 返回 `{ enabled, ctx, enable, disable, toggle, tone({f, d, type, g, slide, attack, delay}), noise({d, g, lp, hp, delay}) }`，与 `MotionKit.audio` 共用引擎、声音开关及混音链，所以站点的 `motion:sound` 对自适应Demo 同样有效。旧 Demo 自己做的前瞻排程在暂停或跳转时也会被淡出。新 Demo 请使用乐谱。\n\n`motion:ready.sound` 取乐谱、`expose()` 的声音元数据和 kit 的声音使用标记：创建 `sound()`、调用 `audio.play()` / `audio.attach()`，或给 `controls()` 传入声音对象都会登记。它表示 Demo 使用声音，不表示当前已开启；`__motion.audio` 只表示可离线导出的乐谱接口，不能用于判断旧版音效是否存在。仅在用户操作后才调用 `audio.play()` 的 Demo，应在 `expose(tl, { sound: true })` 中预先声明声音能力。\n\n## 五、预加载 `MotionKit.preload(tasks, { onProgress, timeout = 30000 })`\n\n`tasks` 是数组，元素可以是返回 Promise 的函数、Promise，或 `{ run, weight, label }`。返回 `Promise<结果数组>`；单个任务失败或超时只记 `console.warn`，不阻塞 ready（对应结果为 null）。可以多次调用，全部登记到 `__motion.ready`。\n\n| 工厂 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `preload.image(src)` | 加载并 `decode()` 完成，结果为 `HTMLImageElement`，并存入 `preload.cache` |\n| `preload.font(spec, text)` / `preload.fonts()` | `document.fonts.load()` / `document.fonts.ready` |\n| `preload.fetch(url, as = 'blob')` | 预取任意资源，结果存入 `preload.cache` |\n| `preload.wait(ms)` | 等待（调试进度显示用） |\n\n**地图巡礼的渐进缓冲**：实时播放先扫描全片镜头需求，按瓦片最早 / 最晚出现时刻排计划；下载窗口 45 秒进入 HTTP 缓存，解析窗口 10 秒进入 MapLibre 缓存，另设解析内存预算。快速推拉中能由必需上级覆盖的瓦片列为可选，优先为近期必需瓦片分配带宽。开头 6 秒就绪即开始；前方缓冲不足 0.5 秒时停在当前帧并显示 `BUFFERING MAP`，攒够 4 秒自动继续。切换画幅会重扫计划。渲染模式不走实时缓冲，`seek()` 等待瓦片和地图 idle 后截图。\n\n**进度显示**：独立打开时 kit 在页面顶部显示一条细进度条；嵌入（`?embed`）时不显示，由站点根据 `motion:loading` 显示加载状态。进度同时写在 `<html data-motion-loading=\"0.500|done\">` 并派发 `window` 事件 `motion:loading`（`detail.progress`）。\n\n## 六、宿主通信协议（postMessage）\n\n站点详情页用**同源** iframe 嵌入 Demo。父页面仍可直接操作 `iframe.contentWindow.__motion`（seek / play / pause / on）；以下消息用于画幅、声音与状态同步。Demo 只接受 `event.source === window.parent` 的消息。\n\n父页面 → Demo：\n\n| 消息 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `{ type: 'motion:orient', orient: 'landscape' \\| 'portrait' }` | 切换画幅（舞台创建前收到也有效）；不支持时 Demo 回报实际画幅并带 `rejected` |\n| `{ type: 'motion:sound', on: true \\| false }` | 开关声音 |\n| `{ type: 'motion:query' }` | 请 Demo 重发 `motion:ready`（若已就绪）、`motion:loading`、`motion:sound` |\n| `{ type: 'motion:play' }` / `{ type: 'motion:pause' }` / `{ type: 'motion:seek', t }` | 可选，跨源嵌入时代替直接调用 `__motion` |\n\nDemo → 父页面：\n\n| 消息 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `{ type: 'motion:ready', duration, orients, orient, markers, sound, title, kit }` | 预加载完成后发送一次（`motion:query` 可重发）。`orients: []` 表示旧版自适应 Demo；`sound` 表示有声音（乐谱或旧版音效） |\n| `{ type: 'motion:orient', orient }` | 画幅变化（含自动切换）；请求了不支持的画幅时带 `supported`、`rejected` |\n| `{ type: 'motion:loading', progress }` | 预加载进度 0–1 |\n| `{ type: 'motion:sound', on, state }` | 声音状态变化：`state` 为 `off` / `on` / `blocked` |\n\n**开启声音**：点击声音按钮即可开启。若显示“待启用”，点击舞台或再次点击声音按钮。嵌入页面使用`allow=\"autoplay\"`，通过`motion:sound`接收开关状态。画幅按钮只在Demo支持多种画幅时显示，切换后保持当前时刻。\n\n## 七、URL 参数\n\n| 参数 | 作用 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `?embed` | 站点内嵌：不创建 Demo 自带的控制条与加载条 |\n| `?render` | 逐帧渲染：不自动播放、不开启实时声音；异步 Demo 在 seek 时等待资源 |\n| `?t=12.5` | 打开时定位到 12.5 秒 |\n| `?autoplay=0` | 不自动播放 |\n| `?orient=landscape` / `?orient=portrait` | 固定画幅（也接受 `l` / `p`） |\n| `?sound=1` | 载入后尝试开启声音（仍受自动播放策略约束，见上表） |\n\n## 八、控制条 `MotionKit.controls(tl, { sound, accent, orient = true, rates, step = 'seconds' })`\n\n播放 / 暂停、从头播放、刻度、时间，外加画幅切换（舞台支持两种画幅时出现，SVG 图标显示“将切换到”的画幅）与声音开关（传入 `sound` 或时间轴挂了乐谱时出现；被策略挡住时半透明）。只在独立打开时创建（`?embed` / `?render` 不显示）。键盘：空格播放 / 暂停，←/→ 跳 1 秒，Shift+←/→ 跳到上 / 下一个标记，Home 回到开头；焦点在按钮上时空格与回车交给按钮本身（避免双重切换）。\n\n`rates` 添加速率菜单；`step: 'frames'` 添加前后逐帧按钮，方向键暂停并按 fps 步进。\n\n按钮节点只创建一次，状态变化时切换属性（`data-playing`、`data-sound`、`data-orient`），使一次按下与抬起始终落在同一节点上。站点详情页（`site/shared/library.js`）同样保留稳定的播放按钮节点；舞台、工具栏与刻度条按视口高度布局，加载中允许定位，横竖切换保持当前时刻，全屏时提供浮层控制。\n\n## 九、逐帧渲染成视频\n\n`scripts/render.mjs` 用本机的 Edge 或 Chrome（无头模式，通过 DevTools 协议控制，无需安装依赖）打开 Demo，等 `__motion.ready`，按帧率逐帧 `seek` 并截图：\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/render.mjs demos/cases/map-pilgrimage/index.html --fps 30\nnode scripts/render.mjs demos/_template/case-native/index.html --orient portrait --fps 30 --audio\nnode scripts/render.mjs demos/_template/case-native/index.html --audio-only\n```\n\n| 选项 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `--orient` | landscape | `landscape`（视口 1920×1080）或 `portrait`（1080×1920），DPR 1，并给 URL 加 `?orient=` |\n| `--fps` | 30 | 帧率 |\n| `--w` / `--h` | 随画幅 | 覆盖视口尺寸（一般不用） |\n| `--from` / `--to` | 0 / duration | 渲染区间（秒） |\n| `--out` | `renders/<demo名>`（竖屏加 `-portrait`） | 输出目录：`frame-00001.png` … |\n| `--format` | png | `png` 或 `jpeg` |\n| `--audio` | | 用 `__motion.audio` 离线渲染同一区间的 WAV，写到 `<out>.wav`（48kHz 16-bit 立体声），打印峰值与 RMS |\n| `--audio-only` | | 只导出 WAV |\n| `--sample-rate` | 48000 | WAV 采样率 |\n| `--port` | 4321 | 传入相对路径时，脚本会自动在该端口起本地服务器 |\n| `--no-encode` | | 不调用 ffmpeg |\n\n如果 `ffmpeg` 在 PATH 上，渲染结束后自动合成 `<out>.mp4`（H.264、yuv420p、CRF 18；有 WAV 时 AAC 192k 一起封装）。没有 ffmpeg 时脚本会打印完整的合成命令，例如：\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -y -framerate 30 -i renders/map-pilgrimage/frame-%05d.png -i renders/map-pilgrimage.wav -c:v libx264 -pix_fmt yuv420p -crf 18 -c:a aac -b:a 192k -shortest renders/map-pilgrimage.mp4\n```\n\n旧 Demo（没有挂乐谱）使用 `--audio` 时会提示跳过；挂接乐谱后即可导出声音。\n\n### 性能提示\n\n- 1920×1080、30fps、30 秒约 900 帧，PNG 序列约 1–2GB；用 `--format jpeg` 可显著减小体积。\n- 地图类 Demo 每帧需要等瓦片空闲，渲染较慢；先用 `--fps 12` 预览节奏，再出正式版本。\n- 渲染时页面不会播放，所以“播放中才出现”的效果（例如运动模糊残影）需要在 render(t) 里用 `t` 计算，而不是依赖上一帧。\n\n## 十、预览图与截图\n\n| 脚本 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `node scripts/capture.mjs [--only ids] [--orient both\\|landscape\\|portrait] [--out 目录] [--url 页面 --t 秒]` | 预览图：横屏 1280×720 → `previews/<kind>/<id>.jpg`；Demo 支持竖屏时再出 720×1280 → `previews/<kind>/<id>-portrait.jpg`（时刻用条目的 `previewAtPortrait`，缺省同 `previewAt`）。站点数据里对应 `preview` 与 `previewPortrait` |\n| `node scripts/shot.mjs <url> --orient portrait --t 3 --t 5 --out a.png` | 截图：`--orient` 给 URL 加 `?orient=` 并把视口默认设为舞台尺寸；可用 `--w/--h` 检查缩放与黑边 |\n\n条目设置`\"renderer\": \"gpu\"`时，预览图工具使用GPU并输出WebGL renderer。\n\n`seek` / `play` 可以返回 Promise，供截图和渲染工具等待画面就绪。\n\n## 十一、可交互 Demo 的双时钟\n\n操作台类 Demo（档案终端）既要能被操作，又要能被录制。做法：\n\n- 界面状态由**事件列表**推导：`state = derive(events.filter(e => e.t <= t))`。\n- 自动驾驶：预设一份事件表，时间轴播放时按 `t` 取事件，演示完整流程；声音写在乐谱里。\n- 用户一旦有真实输入，切换到**实时时钟**，把输入作为新事件追加，反馈音用 `audio.play()` 即时触发；指针坐标先过 `stage.toStage()`。外部 `seek` / `play` 时回到自动驾驶。\n\n这样逐帧渲染得到的永远是那份预设演示（声音也能离线导出），而用户在页面上可以随意操作。\n\n## 十二、MotionKit 速查\n\n| 函数 | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `clamp / lerp / invLerp` | 基础插值 |\n| `bezier(x1, y1, x2, y2)` | CSS cubic-bezier 的 JS 实现 |\n| `ease.*` | 常用缓动与命名 Token（snap、glide、emphasized、exit、anticipate） |\n| `seg(t, start, dur, ease)` | 片段进度 0→1 |\n| `env(t, a, b, inDur, outDur)` | 入—停—出包络 |\n| `keyframes(frames, t)` | 多值关键帧插值 |\n| `rng(seed)` | 可复现随机数 |\n| `typeText / scramble / count / pad` | 打字、解码、数字滚动、补零 |\n| `beats(bpm, offset)` | 拍点：`at`、`beatOf`、`pulse`、`quantize` |\n| `mountFilm / replay` | 时间纯函数作品接入 / 案例片段重放 |\n| `timeline / expose / start / controls / params` | 时间轴、协议暴露、启动、控制条、URL 参数 |\n| `stage(opts)` | 固定画幅舞台 |\n| `preload(tasks)` + `preload.image / font / fonts / fetch / wait / cache` | 预加载 |\n| `audio.enable / disable / toggle / state / on / meter / active` | 声音开关与状态 |\n| `audio.attach / pattern / play / stopAll / define / setMix / renderOffline / encodeWav / voices / dsp` | 乐谱、即时触发、自定义音色、混音、离线渲染 |\n| `sound()` | 旧 API（tone / noise），内部走新引擎 |\n| `tween / follow` | 非时间轴场景的补间与临界阻尼跟随 |\n\n完整注释见 `kit/motion-kit.js`。各 Demo 文件夹内的 `motion-kit.js` 是构建时同步的副本，改动请只改 `kit/` 下的源文件，然后运行 `node scripts/build.mjs`。\n"},{"path":"docs/agent.md","title":"Agent 取材说明","group":"指南","content":"# Agent 取材说明\n\n这份文件写给把本库当作参考资料使用的 Agent。修改本仓库的规则见根目录 `AGENTS.md`。\n\n本库收录以时间线为载体的作品：作品掌握节奏，按时间线播放；即使可以交互，也是在时间线上分支。网站与网页应用，包括其中的页面动效和微交互，不在本库范围内。\n\n## 用本库做参考\n\n1. **检索**：读 `agent/catalog.json`（摘要、标签、关联与资料包路径），或运行\n   `node scripts/atlas.mjs search \"<关键词>\" --json`。可用 `--kind cases|patterns|materials`、`--carrier video|console`、`--type <巧思类型>` 缩小范围。\n2. **读取**：打开 `agent/cases/<id>.json` 或 `agent/patterns/<id>.json`。资料包里有完整条目（`entry` / `pattern`）、Prompt 文档（`documents.prompt`）、入口（`entrypoint`）与文件清单（`files[]`，含路径和字节数）。\n3. **素材**：读 `agent/materials.json` 获取素材摘要与资料包路径，再打开 `agent/materials/<id>.json`。素材库收录用于制作视频的 skill 与工具；资料包包含完整条目（`material`）、工作流、文档原文（`documents`）及文件清单。选用前读工作流、适用边界、原文与许可；`agent-skills/<id>/` 是固定提交的原样快照，效果图是作者产出，未复刻。\n4. **组合**：巧思的 `composition.role` 为 `foundation`（骨架，一个作品通常只有一个）、`support`（支撑）、`accent`（点睛，同一时刻不超过两个）。检查 `pairsWellWith` 与 `conflicts`。\n5. **导出**：`node scripts/atlas.mjs export <id> --out <目录>` 保留仓库相对树，入口见导出目录的 `README.md`；巧思连同来源案例导出，并附 `PROMPT.md` 与 `entry.json`。\n6. **出片**：时间驱动的 Demo 暴露 `window.__motion`；`node scripts/render.mjs <入口> --fps 30` 逐帧渲染。\n\n"},{"path":"docs/research/archive-os.md","title":"莱茵生命档案终端：接入说明","group":"研究","content":"# 莱茵生命档案终端：接入说明\n\n本案例复用 [LBEILC / RhineLabUI](https://github.com/LBEILC/RhineLabUI) 提交 `12cc5e4013acb9408f753ff71de6b8492299b7c8` 的源码、模型、字体、音频和档案内容。Motion Atlas 提供固定舞台、时间轴、预加载与统一音频协议；原版视觉、排版、字号、文案、动效参数与交互由上游实现负责。\n\n源码快照及接入边界见 [UPSTREAM.md](../../demos/cases/archive-os/source/rhinelabui/UPSTREAM.md)，许可见 [LICENSES.md](../../demos/cases/archive-os/LICENSES.md)。运行资源保存在 `demos/cases/archive-os/film/app/`。\n\n## 文件职责\n\n| 位置 | 职责 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `demos/cases/archive-os/source/rhinelabui/src/` | 开场、档案场景、解密、模型查看器、布局、画质和声音 |\n| `demos/cases/archive-os/source/rhinelabui/content/archives.json` | 五列各八份、共四十份档案的内容 |\n| `demos/cases/archive-os/source/rhinelabui/film/` | 虚拟时钟、输入时间表和离线音频 |\n| `demos/cases/archive-os/source/rhinelabui/build.mjs` | 构建相对路径 Vite 页面并复用 `film/app/` 中的资源 |\n| `demos/cases/archive-os/` | MotionKit 舞台、同源 iframe、时间轴、预加载、手动模式和完整音轨 |\n\n## 舞台与播放\n\n舞台有横屏 1920×1080 和竖屏 1080×1920 两套画幅；iframe 尺寸与舞台相同。上游按宽高比选择布局，低于 1.05 时使用 portrait。外层通过 `film/app/index.html?film=1&quality=<q>` 加载应用，默认画质为 original；软件 GL 且未显式指定 quality 时使用 performance。\n\n预加载包括字体、两份 GLB、白底首帧与完整音轨，沿用 MotionKit 的进度和 ready 协议。虚拟时钟以 60Hz 推进，输入和动画按同一时钟执行。播放跳过中间 GPU 绘制并保留状态更新；向后定位或手动操作后的定位会重新加载 iframe，从零推进到目标时刻。\n\n暂停时的真实键盘、鼠标或触摸输入切到手动模式。再次播放或定位恢复预设演示。画幅切换重新加载另一尺寸的 iframe，并恢复当前时刻。\n\n## 演示节拍\n\n| 时刻 | 画面 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 0s | 白底开场、逐字输入 |\n| 22s | 档案阵列展开 |\n| 35s | 自动读取第一份档案 |\n| 42.5s | 切换页签 |\n| 49s | 360° 模型查看器 |\n| 54.1s | 拆解 |\n| 58.35s | 重组 |\n| 60.6s | 返回阵列 |\n| 62.6s | 四向循环浏览 |\n| 77.6s | 结束 |\n\n在仓库根目录运行 `npm run build:archive` 更新 `film/app/` 构建产物，运行 `npm run build:site` 打包站点。完整音轨通过同一个 WebAudio 采样声部供播放、暂停、定位和视频导出使用。\n"},{"path":"docs/research/map-pilgrimage.md","title":"地图巡礼 · 游戏过场式旅行影像：逐帧研究","group":"研究","content":"# 地图巡礼 · 游戏过场式旅行影像：逐帧研究\n\n- 参考：【眩晕瘫坐 旅游时拍的素材给Opus5.5剪出来是这样】（哔哩哔哩，<https://b23.tv/eBjaN0O>），画面署名 @DWTornier\n- 素材：用户下载的本地成片，151.21 秒，1920×1080\n- 观察日期：2026-10-14（初次）、2026-10-16（打磨第一轮复看：全片粗扫、9 段转场细扫、21 张全分辨率帧）\n- 方法：浏览器 `<video>` + Canvas 取帧。全片每 2 秒一帧（76 帧）；转场处每 0.25–0.3 秒一帧（片头昼夜与片名、卡片→全屏、全屏动画回忆、夜→昼与章节框线、动画→实景分屏）；关键画面按 1920 宽全分辨率读取 HUD 文字。\n- 证据等级：结构、文字内容、版式与时间点为 **逐帧实测**；具体缓动曲线与毫秒数为本地拟合（标注“约”）。原片使用的工具链未公开，本笔记不做推断。\n\n## 一句话结构\n\n一个稳定的**世界层**（地图）+ 一套持续更新的**信息层**（四角 HUD）+ 有节制的**模式切换**（卡片 / 全屏实拍 / 全屏动画回忆 / 分屏对比）。地图永远是底座，HUD 永远在报时；只有高光才允许离开地图，而离开时 HUD 也跟着走。\n\n## 全片节拍（原片时间）\n\n| 时间 | 段落 | 主要模式 | 备注 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 0:00–0:05 | 冷开场 | 夜间地球 | 首尔、关西标记带英中标签；左下 NOW PLAYING 已出现 |\n| 0:05.2–0:06.1 | 天亮 | 亮度交叉 | 暗 → 灰 → 亮，约 0.9 秒 |\n| 0:06.4–0:08 | 片名 | 文字 | 竖排「聖地巡礼」逐字模糊入场，横线描出，PILGRIMAGE '26 打字 |\n| 0:08–0:20 | DAY 00–01 | 地图 + 卡片 | 航线、机场、照片卡片、计数徽章 ×1→×2 |\n| 0:22.7 | 高光 | 全屏实拍 | HUD 保留；约 1.2 秒后回到地图 |\n| 0:24–0:31 | 作品 1 | 地图 + 主题 | PILGRIMAGE 标签 + 作品名 + 小图标，强调色橙；手写便签卡片 |\n| 0:32–0:38 | 夜 | 夜间地图 | 竖排「京都」，夜景卡片 |\n| 0:38.9–0:41 | DAY 02 + 作品 2 | 地图 + 主题 | DAY 描边 + 02 实心；四角框线（蓝）描出 |\n| 0:41.6 | 高光 | 全屏实拍 | |\n| 0:55.2–0:57.9 | 回忆 | 全屏动画 | 独立框、FLASHBACK 标签、竖排日文字幕逐字、英文字幕打字、颗粒加重 |\n| 0:58–1:10 | 夜/晨 | 全屏实拍段 | 花瓣粒子、竖排地名、倾斜时间戳 |\n| 1:12–1:30 | DAY 04 | 地图 + 托盘 | 角色收集托盘依次点亮，计数 ×11 |\n| 1:32–1:39 | 回忆 | 全屏动画 | 展望台夜景 |\n| 1:39.35–1:41 | 对比 | 分屏 | 动画 → 实景 → 分割线滑到中线 + 盖章 |\n| 1:42.5 | DAY 05 | 地图概览 | 全路线 |\n| 1:44–1:58 | 作品 3 | 地图 + 拼贴 | 红色主题，多张照片叠放微旋转；红色胶囊角色标签 |\n| 2:02 | DAY 06 | 夜间地图 | |\n| 2:08.5 | 意外 | 警示 | 红色 WRONG TRAIN 通栏 + REROUTING 胶囊，错误路线画红打叉 |\n| 2:10–2:18 | 作品 4 | 地图 + 主题 | 紫色主题，纪念章手绘卡片 |\n| 2:20–2:27 | 终点 | 全日本概览 → 东京夜景 | |\n| 2:28–2:31 | 结尾 | 统计 | 数字堆叠 + 「聖地巡礼 — fin.」+ 署名与出处 |\n\n## HUD 规格（0:16.5 全分辨率读数）\n\n- 左上：`DAY 01 / 07`（DAY 粗体、01 为强调色、/ 07 等宽小字），下方 `MON · SEP 28 2026`（等宽、大字距），再下方一条短粗下划线。\n- 顶部：一条贯穿全宽的细线，左段为强调色（随行程推进）。\n- 右上：`34.4320°N 135.2304°E` 与 `ELEV 0 M · Z 10.9`（等宽小字，Z 为地图缩放级别），右侧大号等宽时钟 `11:33` + 角标 `JST`。\n- 右侧：白色胶囊计数徽章（吉祥物头像 + `YUI SPOTTED` + `×2`）。\n- 左下：均衡器图标 + `NOW PLAYING`，曲名粗体 — 艺人常规；其下一行加粗歌词与一行灰色副歌词。\n- 右下：`SEOUL — KANSAI — KYOTO — TOKYO` 步进器，已到达节点实心；最底一行地图署名。\n\n## 转场目录\n\n| 转场 | 原片时间 | 观察 | Demo 实现 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 昼夜翻转 | 0:05.2、0:38.9 | 中途经过灰阶 | 逐图层配色插值（巧思：day-night-flip） |\n| 竖排标题 | 0:06.4、0:16.5、0:21.5 | 逐字模糊 → 清晰，自上而下 | blur-in 500ms / 140ms 错峰（vertical-title-blur） |\n| 卡片 → 全屏 | 0:22.7 | 硬切，HUD 保留 | 600ms 连续展开 + 压暗层（card-expand-fullscreen，标为本地转译） |\n| 章节框线 | 0:40.7 | 四角带方块的细框描出、强调色替换 | dashoffset 描边 + 四角错峰（chapter-frame） |\n| 全屏回忆 | 0:55.2 | 独立框、标签、竖排字幕逐字 | 插画风格 + 字幕模式（vertical-title-blur 字幕变体） |\n| 分屏对比 | 1:39.35 | 经暗场交叉，分割线从左到中 | outQuart 700ms + 盖章 outBack（split-compare-stamp） |\n| 警示改道 | 2:08.5 | 红色通栏 + 黑色胶囊 | clip-path 擦入 + 错误路线打叉（alert-reroute） |\n| 结尾统计 | 2:30.5 | 数字堆叠 + 衬线 fin. | 逐行计数（outro-stat-stack） |\n\n## 节奏分析\n\n- **事件密度**：地图段落平均每 4–6 秒出现一个新事件（新卡片、新地名、计数、便签、歌词换行），观众始终有新信息可看，但同一时刻只有一个主事件。\n- **模式切换**：约每 10–15 秒离开一次地图（全屏实拍/动画/对比），全屏段落持续 1.2–7 秒；回到地图后至少留 1–2 秒“呼吸”。\n- **能量曲线**：开场低 → 片名第一峰 → 旅程中速 → 回忆与对比为最高峰 → 意外事件制造第二个尖峰 → 结尾回落。Demo 的能量曲线按同样形状设计（见条目 `energy`）。\n- **一致性来源**：所有模式共用 HUD、颗粒与强调色系统，所以“切换”像在同一个系统里切视图，而不是不同素材的拼接。\n\n## 画面细节\n\n- 原片就是一段日本旅行（首尔 → 关西机场 → 西宫 / 京都 / 宇治 → 东京），地图 HUD 用 JST；城市近景都有成片的 3D 建筑与铁路细线，这也是 Demo 改用日本路线的依据之一。\n- 章节不只换强调色：一种是屏幕四角框线（带方块角标），另一种是底部斜纹警示胶带 + 整张地图染上章节色；Demo 两种都做了（鸭川用框线、奈良用胶带 + 网点）。\n- 手写便签出现时，地图整体被一层浅色纸面“洗”淡，便签像贴在地图上；Demo 用 `wash` 层复现。\n- 收集托盘在右下角，是一排小缩略图逐个点亮；Demo 改为与步进器同列的车站印章（原创形式，不复制角色收集）。\n- 竖排地名在原片是粗黑体；Demo 改用明朝体（与“巡礼 / 古都”的气质一致，属于本地设计选择）。\n\n## Demo 资源与播放\n\n案例的路线、镜头、节拍、配色和文字集中在 demos/cases/map-pilgrimage/film/config.js。地图使用 MapLibre 与 OpenFreeMap 瓦片；资源预加载和播放进度沿用 MotionKit。渲染模式等待目标画面的瓦片就绪，实时播放使用分段缓冲。\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/archive-os.md","title":"莱茵生命档案终端","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 莱茵生命档案终端\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n制作莱茵生命档案终端：白底开场、五列循环档案阵列、对角解密、360°查看器与结构拆解。使用两份GLB、MiSans字体、三轨配乐、合成音效、逐字短音与四十份档案。固定画幅，60Hz时钟与统一音轨。开场后自动读取档案，再依次演示页签、360°查看器、六组结构拆解、重组、返回阵列与四向循环浏览。横屏1920×1080、竖屏1080×1920，按画幅排版。保留视觉、字号、文案、动效参数、缓动与音量声像。\n\n## 视频生成 Prompt\n\nA Rhine Lab archive terminal with a white opening, Rhine Lab identity, a five-column archive array, diagonal decryption, document tabs, a 360-degree model viewer, frosted and clear glass, a six-part exploded structure and reassembly. Include two GLB models, MiSans type, forty archive texts, three music tracks and sound. Use landscape 1920×1080 or portrait 1080×1920 layouts. Show the opening, archive reading, tabs, model viewer, disassembly, reassembly and four-direction browsing in sequence.\n\n## 负向约束\n\n保持视觉、布局、字号、文案、动效参数、缓动、模型、字体、档案和声音；不要增添外层UI、文字与装饰；不要裁剪或加速开场；保持动作序列。\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **boot-window**：开场以25fps离散播放。\n- **orbit**：临界阻尼速率3.7。\n- **select-lift**：选中抬起的临界阻尼速率4.2。\n- **roll**：滚动时长460ms。\n- **idle**：交互停止2.5s后进入空闲呼吸。\n- **decrypt**：解密时长为(39.56−34.12)/1.5=3.6267s。\n- **quality**：画质分为performance、original、high、ultra。默认original。\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 模型、字体、音频与四十份档案共同组成完整终端。\n- 保持画面布局与排版，网站界面文字≥12px。\n- 名称、标志与档案内容围绕莱茵生命展开。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `档案与外观`：档案内容、模型、字体与外观组成终端画面。\n- `播放序列`：时间表控制输入与声音，支持离线导出。\n- `运行资源`：页面与模型、字体、声音等运行资源。\n- `舞台与控制`：舞台、时间轴、定位、手动操作与完整音轨。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/archive-os/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/archive-os)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/keeling-curve.md","title":"基林曲线 · 莫纳罗亚 CO₂ 数据短片","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 基林曲线 · 莫纳罗亚 CO₂ 数据短片\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n由 Motion Atlas 依据 brief 撰写。用 HTML、Canvas 2D 与 JavaScript 制作 20 秒、1920×1080、30fps 的中文基林曲线数据短片，只提供横屏。读取 NOAA 原始 co2_mm_mlo.txt 的 decimal date 与 average 列，使用 1958-03 至 2025-12 的 814 个官方发布月点；年度比较读取 co2_annmean_mlo.txt，1959 年均 315.98 ppm、2025 年均 427.35 ppm。纸底 #F3F1E9、深墨 #202820、主线 #D85835、上下文线 #A5AAA0，中文 Noto Sans SC、数字 IBM Plex Mono Medium，自托管并保留 OFL。图表区域 x=155–1760、y=445–865，单位和数字相邻，显示「纵轴未从零开始」。①0.000–2.428 秒：标题「地球在「呼吸」。」「但 CO₂ 的底线，逐年抬高。」与 1959 年均；0.500 秒首笔才出现，从 1958 年三月开始线性展开到 1964。②2.428–7.408 秒：同一端点续画到 2025 年十二月，标题「同一条曲线，两种尺度。」「每个点，对应一次月均记录。」；不清空重画。③7.408–10.346 秒：在同一坐标空间连续推近，横纵跨度按对数插值，ease.inOutCubic；全局 1958–2026／308–440 ppm 转到近景 2023–2026／414–434 ppm，文字字号保持。④10.346–12.366 秒：固定近景，2025 月线用 5px 橙线突出、邻年退灰，标题「起伏，是季节。」「北半球植被生长与衰退」；真实五月峰 430.51 ppm、九月谷 424.37 ppm 以 glide 0.300 秒入场，不提前出现。⑤12.366–15.315 秒：沿原坐标空间用同一三次缓动拉远，恢复全局线色。⑥15.315–20.000 秒：落版「长期趋势，持续上升。」「起伏，是季节。」与两端年均值；左年均基线 y=363、下沿 y=410，与纵轴标签、曲线顶部均保持至少 40px。17.300 秒才入场「数据：NOAA GML · 莫纳罗亚观测站 CO₂ 月均值」，下一行「音乐：“Dreams Become Real” Kevin MacLeod（incompetech.com）· CC BY 4.0」，均 24px，glide 0.350 秒、纵移 12px→0，音乐署名更淡。声音默认关闭；开启后播放已完成的最终混音：Dreams Become Real 原曲 7.162–27.162 秒，不变速，片内 0–0.100 秒线性淡入、18.5–20 秒线性淡出，三个 Kenney 音效主要瞬态在 0.500、10.346、17.300 秒。无口播、无合成声部。作品代码置于 film/，入口使用 MotionKit.mountFilm，画面由 render(t) 绘制；提供 window.__motion，seek(t) 等待画面完成；支持 ?embed、?render、?t=秒、逐帧步进、默认静音与减少动态偏好，音轨按时间轴同步。\n\n## 视频生成 Prompt\n\n由 Motion Atlas 依据 brief 撰写。生成一支 20 秒、1920×1080、30fps、横屏中文数据短片。整片使用 #F3F1E9 浅纸底、#202820 深墨中文标题、IBM Plex Mono 等宽数字与一条 #D85835 真实月均折线，灰色细轴线与大面积留白。主体始终是同一份 NOAA 莫纳罗亚 CO₂ 月均序列，1958 年三月至 2025 年十二月；不得用装饰性正弦曲线替代。0.000–2.428 秒出现「地球在「呼吸」。」「但 CO₂ 的底线，逐年抬高。」与「1959 · 年均 CO₂」「315.98 ppm」；0.500 秒首笔落下，再展开早期真实锯齿。2.428–7.408 秒，线条从同一端点继续画到 2025，文字为「同一条曲线，两种尺度。」「每个点，对应一次月均记录。」。7.408–10.346 秒沿同一坐标空间平滑推近 2023–2025，三次对称缓动、两端速度归零，文字保持清晰。10.346–12.366 秒固定近景，仅高亮 2025 年完整月线、邻年退灰；标题「起伏，是季节。」、副标题「北半球植被生长与衰退」，标注五月 430.51 ppm 与九月 424.37 ppm。12.366–15.315 秒连续拉远回到历史全景。15.315–20.000 秒保留全线，落版「长期趋势，持续上升。」「起伏，是季节。」并列「1959 · 年均 CO₂」「315.98 ppm」与「2025 · 年均 CO₂」「427.35 ppm」。17.300 秒入场数据来源和 Kevin MacLeod 的 CC BY 4.0 音乐署名，24px，来源下方署名更淡。全程保留 ppm、年均／月均口径与「纵轴未从零开始」。声音只用获许可的 Dreams Become Real 连续区间 7.162–27.162 秒，100ms 淡入、最后 1.5 秒淡出；Kenney 木质落笔、柔软落点、确认点击各一次，主要瞬态在 0.500／10.346／17.300 秒。无口播，非循环。\n\n## 负向约束\n\n由 Motion Atlas 依据 brief 撰写。不要编造、补造、拟合或平滑掉真实月均锯齿；不要补出 1958 年一二月；不要混入 2026 数据；不要把年均 315.98／427.35 ppm 贴到月均端点，月线首末点为 315.71／427.49 ppm；不要添加源文件没有的增量、百分比或滚动中间数字；不要把莫纳罗亚序列称作全球平均，不要说每个月都上升或每年都在五月达峰；不要省略来源、单位、年均／月均口径与非零纵轴说明；不要提前显示峰谷高亮或来源；不要替换另一条曲线做推近，不要让文字随镜头缩小，不要用弹簧让数据超调或持续晃动；不要深色发光 HUD、渐变、扫描线、粒子、噪点、镜头抖动、全画面反色、默认全体淡入；不要新增竖屏构图；不要口播、合成声部、史诗鼓点、欢快 ukulele、第四个音效或未批准素材；不要省略 CC BY 4.0 完整署名与 Kenney 包内许可。\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **真实月线续画**：0.500 秒首笔；0.500–2.428 秒从 1958-03 展开到 1964；2.428–7.408 秒续画至 2025-12。时间线性，线宽 4px，端点半径 6px。\n- **比例尺推近**：7.408–10.346 秒，共 2.938 秒。横纵跨度按对数插值，ease.inOutCubic；全局 1958–2026／308–440 ppm → 近景 2023–2026／414–434 ppm。\n- **2025 高亮与峰谷**：10.346 秒开始；2025 折线 5px，邻年退灰。峰谷标签 glide 0.300 秒，曲线和数字不超调。事件入场进度包含一个 30fps 帧步长。\n- **比例尺拉远**：12.366–15.315 秒，共 2.949 秒。与推近共用坐标空间和 ease.inOutCubic，回到完整月线。\n- **来源与音乐署名**：17.300 秒开始，glide 0.350 秒；透明度 0→1，纵向位移 12px→0。事件入场进度包含一个 30fps 帧步长；事件前完全不可见。\n- **音乐包络**：原曲 7.162–27.162 秒不变速；片内 0.000–0.100 秒线性振幅淡入，18.500–20.000 秒线性振幅淡出。\n- **三个音效主要瞬态**：0.500／10.346／17.300 秒；按原文件主要瞬态偏移定位，不把文件起点当作落点。\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 成片 20 秒、1920×1080、30fps，只有横屏，不作无缝循环。\n- 制作方式：garden-skills 的 motion-showreel skill，固定提交 2b9a89340b70f632d31c0f1c69fce94a7912423e；原始 skill brief 随 Demo 原样保存。\n- 数据许可：NOAA GML 免费公开数据，发表需相应引用与署名；保留 Xin Lan（NOAA/GML）、Ralph Keeling（Scripps）及早期 C. David Keeling／Scripps 归属，具体要求见 DATA.md。\n- 声音许可：Dreams Become Real，Kevin MacLeod／Incompetech，CC BY 4.0，须保留完整署名并说明截取、淡入淡出与混音；Kenney Impact Sounds 和 UI Audio 为 CC0，包内 License.txt 随音轨保留，见 AUDIO.md。\n- 自托管 Noto Sans SC 与 IBM Plex Mono 附各自 OFL 许可。\n- 814 条月均记录只取 1958-03 至 2025-12；年均比较只用 annual 第 46／112 行。2022 年末至 2023 年中的临时代测记录按 NOAA 官方连续序列保留。\n- 画面保留 ppm、年均／月均口径、非零纵轴说明与来源；不补造 1958 年一二月，不生成无来源的中间数字。\n- 能量值由 Motion Atlas 依据成片的运动量与停留时间估计，不是 skill brief 中给出的数值。六段使用精确时间端点，段内线性，边界可跳变。\n- 实现 Prompt、视频生成 Prompt 与负向约束均由 Motion Atlas 依据 brief 撰写，不冒充原 skill 输出。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `assets/co2_mm_mlo.txt、assets/co2_annmean_mlo.txt 与 film/data.js`：更换数据前核对字段、有效日期、缺测规则与引用要求，同时更新 DATA.md；月均线与年均度量分别读取，不能互换。\n- `film/timeline.js → SHOTS、TIMES、EVENTS、AUDIO`：镜头边界、三个事件与音乐区间共用此表。迁移时保持视觉参考和实际音乐拍点的区别，重新核对瞬态偏移。\n- `film/scene.js → C、plot、full、close 与文字布局`：为新作品调整色彩、绘图区、两种坐标范围和文案；保持同一数据点身份、数值口径、单位与非零纵轴说明。本案例原文件保真保存。\n- `audio/ 与 AUDIO.md`：更换音乐或音效须先取得相应许可，更新完整署名、截取区间、淡入淡出及三个事件的同步说明。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：负责本库时间线、控制条、声音同步和 URL 参数接入，画面继续调用原作品 render(t)。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/keeling-curve/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/keeling-curve)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/map-pilgrimage.md","title":"地图巡礼 · 游戏过场式旅行影像","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 地图巡礼 · 游戏过场式旅行影像\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n用 HTML/CSS/JS 制作一支 60 秒、可逐帧定位的“地图巡礼”影像，固定画幅两套构图：横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920（舞台像素坐标，整体等比缩放）。舞台字号按设计决定，不设下限；网站界面 ≥ 12px。内容：关西三日（上海 → 关西机场 → 京都伏见稻荷 → 鸭川 → 奈良公园 → 道顿堀），只用真实地名。①世界层：MapLibre GL + OpenFreeMap positron，隐藏全部文字标注，z14 起 3D 建筑，加 AWS Terrain Tiles 山体阴影（z5.5–13）；镜头关键帧 {t, center, zoom, pitch, bearing, 焦点位置 f / 竖屏 fp}，用 padding 把地点放到指定的屏幕位置；开场地球投影 + 星空；长距离用一段 ease-out 一口气推近。②昼夜：按图层类别逐个插值白天与夜晚配色，约 1 秒、中途经过去饱和的灰，不整体反色。③路线：航线虚线 + 飞机、铁路发光实线（line-gradient 按进度截断；几何从矢量瓦片里的 rail 线最短路提取）+ 车头、步行圆点、错误路线红线打叉；所有点位由同一个投影函数计算，端点与圆心严格重合。④HUD：左上 DAY 01 / 03 + 日期，右上坐标 / ELEV·Z / JST 时钟，顶部规尺按旅程进度填充，左下 NOW PLAYING + 双语歌词打字，右下步进器与车站印章（竖屏改为顶部 HUD + 右侧印章栏 + 底部步进器），计数徽章变化时上滚回弹。⑤事件：竖排汉字逐字模糊入场（550ms，字间 160ms）+ 英文模糊前沿打字；照片卡片浮入并用引线连到地图标记；卡片展开为全屏、HUD 保留并压暗；章节换强调色并描出四角框线 / 斜纹胶带；全屏插画回忆（独立框、档案标签、竖排字幕逐字）；分屏对比（分割线滑到中线 + 倾斜时间戳盖章）；红色 WRONG TRAIN 通栏 + REROUTING 胶囊；大号日序；结尾统计逐行计数 + 衬线 fin.。⑥标签避让：站名固定宽度 + 多个候选位置，避开 HUD 保留区与事件文字；文字永不压线。⑦声音：WebAudio 合成 120 BPM 乐谱（环境底、和弦、贝斯、鼓、阳音阶拨弦 + 每个事件的音），默认静音，可离线渲染 WAV。⑧工程：render(t) 纯函数，时间全部写进 config 轨道；window.__motion = {duration, seek(t)→Promise, play, pause, on}；?render=1 时 seek 等待瓦片；实时播放先扫描全片镜头需要的瓦片，再按时间顺序两级缓冲（下载 / 解析，内存预算，快速推拉帧的低价值瓦片降级），前方不足就暂停显示缓冲提示；颗粒用独立合成层平移；离线退回网格底图。\n\n## 视频生成 Prompt\n\n60-second travel cutscene in the style of a video-game map interface, delivered in two fixed frames (1920×1080 landscape and 1080×1920 portrait with its own layout). A pale paper-colored 3D map of Japan's Kansai region (warm light-grey land, blue-grey water, white roads, thin grey railway lines, extruded white buildings in the city close-ups) is the persistent world; the camera glides with slow ease-in-out moves and gentle pitch. Fixed HUD: top-left 'DAY 01 / 03' with a monospace date, top-right latitude/longitude, 'ELEV 38 M · Z 14.1' and a large clock with a 'JST' superscript, a thin progress rule across the top, bottom-left 'NOW PLAYING' with an equalizer icon and bilingual lyric lines, bottom-right a four-stop stepper (KIX, KYOTO, NARA, OSAKA) with red station stamps. Beats: a night globe with stars → the map turns to day through grey → large vertical Japanese title characters '関西周遊' blur in one by one while 'KANSAI LOOP '26' types in → a dashed flight arc with a small plane sweeps from Shanghai and the camera dives straight into Kansai Airport → a glowing vermilion rail line draws along the real railway to Kyoto → close-up of Fushimi Inari with 3D buildings, a photo card of torii gates floats in with a thin leader line, then expands to full screen while the HUD stays on top → a teal chapter frame draws around the screen corners over the Kamo River → an illustrated flashback with its own frame and vertical Japanese subtitles revealing character by character → split screen: a divider slides to center revealing a 1930s sepia postcard against the modern river, a tilted timestamp stamps down → night falls on the map layer by layer, a handwritten note card drops in → day two: rail to Nara, deer park card with an amber tape decoration → a red 'WRONG TRAIN' banner wipes in, the wrong route turns red and ends with an X, a black 'REROUTING…' capsule blinks → night arrival at Dotonbori with neon and tall 3D blocks → the camera pulls back over the whole loop → stacked statistics count up and a serif 'fin.'. Clean, restrained, game-UI precision, subtle film grain, rhythmic edits on a 120 BPM beat, no camera shake.\n\n## 负向约束\n\n不要整体反色做夜景；不要让多个全屏模式叠在一起；不要把 HUD 做成满屏发光科幻风；不要用卡通贴纸替代信息层；不要在高缩放时保留地图文字标注抢走注意力；不要让镜头连续快速甩动；不要让文字压在路线或标记上；不要横竖画幅共用一套自适应排版；不要使用动画作品名称、截图或无授权的照片与音乐；不要在地图没加载完时露白（缓冲时停在当前帧并提示）。\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **blur-in 逐字**：550ms outCubic，字间160ms。模糊18px→0，上移14px→0。地名标题使用同样参数。\n- **type-in 打字**：按字符推进，前沿字符带 7px 模糊\n- **card-in**：550ms outCubic浮入，400ms inCubic离场。图片持续Ken Burns推近。\n- **card-expand**：600ms inOutCubic展开。停2.2s，Ken Burns缩放1.04→1.10。550ms收回，HUD转白字，上下压暗。\n- **day-night**：约 1s，逐图层插值；中途经过去饱和的灰，不整体反色\n- **chapter-frame**：标签350ms擦出，标题700ms打字。框线800ms inOutCubic描出。四角方块120ms错峰，300ms outBack。\n- **split-compare**：分割线750ms outQuart滑到中线。时间戳360ms outBack盖章。\n- **stamp**：车站印章与步进器同列，按到达依次盖下（回弹 + 印章音）\n- **stat-stack**：每行 320ms 错峰计数，衬线 fin. 在 2s 后\n- **buffering**：缓冲<0.5s时暂停，显示BUFFERING MAP xx%。攒够4s继续。\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 画面、文字、地点与乐谱共同呈现关西三日旅程。\n- 照片、明信片与插画按画幅绘制。\n- OpenFreeMap底图与AWS高程显示建筑、铁路、水系和地名。\n- 在film/config.js填入照片，即可替换程序场景。\n- 横屏1920×1080、竖屏1080×1920等比缩放，网站文字≥12px。\n- 约730块/130MB；约290块/66MB必需。10Mbps缓冲1–2次。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/config.js → meta`：设置片名、副标题、时区、总天数、时长与BPM。\n- `film/config.js → stops`：设置地点名称、经纬度、海拔与最小缩放，路线端点自动对齐。\n- `film/config.js → tracks.camera`：c中心、z缩放、p俯仰、b方位、f/fp取景、zp竖屏缩放、e缓动。\n- `film/paths.js`：设置铁路与步行经纬度，可用rail图层或GeoJSON线。\n- `film/config.js → tracks.*`：调整各事件轨道时刻，画面与乐谱同步改变节奏。\n- `film/config.js → chapters / stepper`：设置章节标题、强调色、框线或胶带，以及四站步进器与印章。\n- `film/config.js → sound`：设置和弦、阳音阶与到站提示音，按轨道生成乐谱。\n- `film/config.js → layout`：分别设置横竖规尺、步进器、印章、卡片、避让区与统计区。\n- `film/config.js → palette / mapPalette / map`：设置纸色、墨色、夜色、强调色与地图昼夜配色、样式和高程。\n- `film/scenes.js`：cards[].media填图片路径，即可换成真实照片。\n- `film/script.js → BUF_CFG`：设置开头门槛、解析与下载范围、内存预算、暂停与继续阈值。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/map-pilgrimage/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/map-pilgrimage)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-3d-render.md","title":"3D 渲染 · soft. — Soft Landing","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 3D 渲染 · soft. — Soft Landing\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n# 3D 渲染系（C4D/Blender 质感） 3D Render / CGI Motion Design\n\n**原片**：soft.「Soft Landing 柔软着陆」 · 1920×1080 · 24 fps · 10 秒 · AI 评审终评 7.71 / 10\n\n**源码**：[demos/04-3d-render/](../demos/04-3d-render/)\n\n## 怎么用\n\n1. 新建一个空文件夹，在里面打开一个能写代码、能执行命令的 AI 助手（例如 Claude Code）。本机需要能跑网页渲染（Node + Chrome）和 ffmpeg；这种风格建议的路线要用 Blender。\n2. 把下面「提示词」整段复制进去发送。\n3. 想换成自己的内容：改 `Creative seed` 里的故事、品牌名、文案和配色，或者改 `Output` 里的尺寸（比如竖屏 1080×1920）。不要删 `Signature features` 那一段，它是这种风格被一眼认出来的依据。\n4. 想再提高：成片出来后，另开一个 AI 用 [rubric.md](../rubric.md) 评审，把评审意见贴回给制作的 AI 再改一轮。原片就是这样改了两轮。\n\n## 提示词\n\n```text\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n3D 渲染系（C4D/Blender 质感） 3D Render / CGI Motion Design\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 24 fps, exactly 10.000 s (240 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nBlender 5.1.2 CLI (bpy script → Cycles on Metal GPU with OIDN denoise, or EEVEE if it holds quality) → PNG sequence → ffmpeg; optional HTML overlay pass for typography\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「Soft & Satisfying」The C4D/Octane pastel product-ident look (Maxon demo-reel vibe): soft candy materials, cloner arrays, physics-feel motion.\n- Pastel studio: infinite cyc backdrop, big soft area lights + HDRI (see /assets/hdri), shallow DOF (f/1.8 feel), 24 fps, real motion blur.\n- A MoGraph-style cloner field (geometry-nodes grid of glossy rounded pills/spheres) ripples with an effector wave; a hero object — inflated/bevelled 3D wordmark (e.g. \"SOFT\" or an invented brand) or a glossy jelly logo — drops in, squash-and-stretch jiggle (damped spring), collides with and displaces the cloner field.\n- Material trio: SSS gummy (candy pink / peach), glossy plastic (cream / lilac), frosted glass or chrome accent — with AO, soft reflections, subtle subsurface glow.\n- Camera: long-tail ease (80% of the move in the first 20%), ends on a clean hero composition held ~1s.\nSound: ASMR-satisfying soft thuds, squishes, bubbly pops, airy cinematic pad; hits frame-synced to impacts.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\nCinema 4D + Redshift/Octane 或 Blender 渲染的实体质感动画：软胶、玻璃、金属、布料，配合克隆阵列和物理模拟。是高端产品片（手机、饮料、球鞋）和品牌 ident 的主流，Maxon 官方 Demo Reel 就是该风格的年度风向标。\n视觉特征 PBR真实材质, 浅景深, 柔和棚拍布光, 克隆器阵列, 软体碰撞, 糖果色软胶质感\n关键技法 MoGraph 核心：Cloner 克隆器 + Random/Plain Effector 做群体波浪式动画\n质感三件套：SSS 次表面散射（软胶感）+ AO + HDRI 三点布光\n运动多用长尾 ease：位移曲线前 20% 完成 80% 路程，收尾极慢，配 motion blur\n24/25fps 电影帧率 + 浅景深（f/1.8 感）区别于 2D 系的 30fps 利落感\n常见结构：产品为轴心，粒子/流体/布料围绕它做物理模拟编排\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n```\n\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **帧序列**：const FPS = 24, N = 240;\n- **落点冲击**：const pun = df >= 0 ? 0.035 * (1 - expoOut(df / 6)) : 0;\n- **四帧抖动**：const shk = [2, -1.5, 1, -0.5][df] || 0;\n- **英文错峰**：const u = prog(t, T0 + 0.07 * k, 0.9);\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，24fps；只提供横屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `assets/frames/`：替换 24fps、240 帧的三维画面。\n- `source/blender/、source/assets/mesh/`：以原作场景、模拟和网格生成三维画面。\n- `film/cues.json、film/style.css`：调整落点、标语时刻和页面后期。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入时间轴、原片音轨与窗口等比缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-3d-render/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-3d-render)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-aurora-glass.md","title":"极光与玻璃拟态 · Aurora — Think in Light","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 极光与玻璃拟态 · Aurora — Think in Light\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n弥散渐变 / 玻璃拟态 Gradient Blur (Aurora) & Glassmorphism\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML WebGL: aurora mesh-gradient shader + glass refraction (SDF lens, chromatic dispersion) + DOM/CSS backdrop-filter glass cards\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「Liquid Glass」2025–26 AI-product-launch aesthetic: slow, translucent, expensive.\n- Deep indigo-black base; 4–5 aurora blobs (violet/blue/cyan/magenta, adjacent hues only) drifting on bezier paths, blending into a mesh gradient, 3–5% noise dithering (no banding).\n- Frosted glass cards (backdrop blur ~30px, 5–10% white fill, 1px 30% white inner highlight, large radius) float in with parallax depth and slight 3D tilt; micro-UI inside (chat bubble, voice waveform, toggles) animates with opacity + 8px rise.\n- WOW: a Liquid-Glass lens (true refraction, chromatic dispersion on the rim, specular edge) glides across and magnifies the aurora and the cards.\n- Title (invented product, e.g. \"Aurora — think in light\") in a light elegant sans; sine/breathing easing everywhere; nothing fast.\nSound: ambient cinematic pad, soft shimmer, very subtle UI ticks.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n大面积高斯模糊的彩色光斑（aurora/mesh gradient）缓慢漂移作底，磨砂半透明玻璃卡片浮在其上。苹果 iOS 26 Liquid Glass 与各家 AI 产品发布把这一风格推成 2024-2026 科技品牌片的默认视觉，气质是'慢、透、高级'。\n视觉特征 大色斑高斯模糊漂移, 磨砂玻璃卡片, 1px高光描边, 邻近色低对比配色, 缓慢呼吸感节奏\n关键技法 底层 aurora：3~5 个纯色大圆 blur 80~150px，各自沿贝塞尔路径 20~40 秒漂移循环，彼此 blend 出 mesh gradient 感\n玻璃卡片配方：backdrop-filter blur(20~40px) + 白色 5~10% 填充 + 1px 白色 30% 内描边 + 大半径圆角\n配色用邻近色 2~3 色（紫蓝青/橙粉红），撞色会脏；暗底亮斑比亮底更出效果\n全局叠 3~5% 噪点防 banding（与颗粒质感技法交叉）\n缓动接近 linear 或 sine 呼吸曲线，一切都慢——快动作会立刻破坏气质；文字入场也只用 opacity+8px 位移\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **相机焦距**：const F = 2000;\n- **磨砂模糊**：const TAPS_FROST = gaussTaps(30 * DPR / 4);\n- **极光漂移**：30、34、26、36、40、24、32 秒闭合路径。\n- **控钮尺寸**：const TOG = { x: 440 - 32 - 80, y: 92 - 22.5, w: 80, h: 45 }; const KNOB_R = 18.75;\n- **结尾字标**：const WORD_SIZE = 178, WORD_BASE = 596, WORD_TRACK = 4;\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/main.js → PAL、BLOBS、CARDS`：调整光场配色、漂移轨道、卡片布局与界面内容。\n- `film/main.js → WORD、lensState`：调整字标、透镜轨迹和字母接合位置。\n- `film/cues.json、film/out/env.json`：调整画音节点和配乐音量包络；source/audio.py 保存原作生成过程。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入时间轴、原片音轨与窗口等比缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-aurora-glass/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-aurora-glass)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-bauhaus.md","title":"几何包豪斯 · KONSTRUKTION · 20 Beats","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 几何包豪斯 · KONSTRUKTION · 20 Beats\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n几何构成 / 包豪斯 Geometric / Bauhaus Motion\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML: SVG/Canvas + GSAP on a strict modular grid, beat grid at 120 BPM\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「包豪斯动态海报」Bauhaus 1919 kinetic poster — mechanical, rational, musical.\n- Cream paper (#F1E9DA), primaries red #E03C31, yellow #F2B705, blue #1E4FA3, black #111; strict modular grid (e.g. 240px modules); every move is an integer number of modules; every landing on a grid line.\n- 120 BPM (0.5 s/beat): each beat a module acts — quarter circles rotate 90° about a corner pivot, semicircles slide one module, triangles flip, squares split; rotation pivots alternate (own centre / corner / frame centre).\n- 0–2s grid lines draw & the first red circle lands; 2–6s the composition assembles into a Kandinsky/Bauhaus poster; 6–8s phase-shifted cascade wave across the grid on the drop; 8–10s freeze into a perfect poster with Swiss typography: \"BAUHAUS\" set vertically in heavy geometric sans + small caps \"FORM · FARBE · FUNKTION\".\n- Easing: power2.inOut or linear — NO overshoot; subtle paper tooth + slight print misregistration allowed.\nSound: minimal techno/click — each flip = a pitched click/blip, kick on quarters.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n圆、三角、矩形在严格网格上做精确的平移、旋转、缩放，三原色+黑白的限定色板，机械理性的秩序美。源自包豪斯与瑞士国际主义平面传统（Adobe 曾与 Bauhaus 档案馆合作 Hidden Treasures 项目），也是动态海报（kinetic poster）的主流语言，与音乐节拍天然合拍。\n视觉特征 基础几何形, 红黄蓝黑限定色, 严格网格对齐, 旋转以几何中心为轴, 节拍驱动的模块化运动\n关键技法 一切运动锚定网格：位移距离=网格模数整数倍，落点必在网格线上\n缓动克制：easeInOutQuad 或干脆匀速，禁用 overshoot——机械感是特征不是缺陷\n节拍驱动：每个几何元素在节拍点瞬时出现/翻转，一拍一个动作，类似我们已做的卡点逻辑\n旋转轴心玩法：绕自身中心、绕边缘顶点、绕画面中心三种交替制造韵律\n生成式变体：Processing/p5.js 用三角函数相位差批量驱动几何阵列（国内动态海报圈主流做法）\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **网格模数**：120px；每拍 0.5 秒。\n- **组合转向**：3.25–4.0 秒，12 个 7.5° 棘齿完成 90° 转向。\n- **级联波**：6.0 秒旋转、6.5 秒横向翻牌、7.2 秒列对滑动、7.5 秒向心翻牌。\n- **海报字序**：8.0 秒开始，每 0.125 秒出现一个 BAUHAUS 字母，共 7 个。\n- **套印锁定**：9.5 秒色版锁定，纸张位移在随后两帧归位。\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 10 秒、1920×1080、30fps；原作 motionBlur 为 8 子帧、快门 0.5。\n- 原作来自 Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，作者 Vincentwei1021，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可；完整出处与素材许可见 Demo 内 LICENSES.md。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/cues.json`：调整拍点、几何落位与四次级联波时，同步使用同一节点表组织画面与声音。\n- `film/film.js`：几何坐标、网格模数、色版、海报文字与印刷处理在此定义。\n- `source/audio.py`：读取 film/cues.json 合成极简点击电子节拍与落点音效。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入本库的时间轴、中文控制条、固定横屏缩放与原片音轨同步。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-bauhaus/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-bauhaus)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-cel-boil.md","title":"逐帧线条抖动 · HAND MADE","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 逐帧线条抖动 · HAND MADE\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n逐帧手绘 / 线条沸腾 Cel Animation / Frame-by-Frame & Line Boil\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 24 fps, exactly 10.000 s (240 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML Canvas2D: custom variable-width brush renderer (centreline + pressure → outline polygon), boil = 3–4 jitter variants cycled every 2 frames; paper texture multiply\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「手作魔法」Hand-made frame-by-frame magic, Buck/Giant-Ant hybrid (clean shapes + hand-drawn cel FX), animated on 2s at 24 fps.\n- Warm paper ground; ink linework that BOILS (lines redrawn with slight variation every 2 frames); fills slightly off-register like hand colouring.\n- Story: a matchstick strikes (SMEAR frame, on 1s for the fast action) → a flame spirit character jumps out, anticipation + squash, dances (on 2s) → it bursts into cel FX: smoke puffs curling, sparks, star bursts, speed lines → the FX re-form into hand-lettered title (e.g. \"HAND MADE\" or 手作) that keeps boiling on a 1s hold (on 3s for the hold).\n- Palette 3–4 colours: ink black, tomato red, sunny yellow, cream paper; paper grain multiply 10–15%.\nSound: playful jazzy pizzicato/xylophone bed + cartoon SFX: strike, fwoosh, pop, poof, sparkle — synced to the frame.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n手绘逐帧或在矢量动画上叠加逐帧质感，标志性特征是 line boil——线条每隔几帧轻微抖动，仿佛画面在'呼吸'。Giant Ant、Buck 等工作室大量使用 cel 元素（烟、水花、速度线）点缀主动画，反数字精致感的核心手段。\n视觉特征 线条持续微抖(boil), 一拍二/一拍三节奏, smear拖影帧, 手绘烟火水花点缀, 纸纹底\n关键技法 打帧节奏：24fps 下'一拍二'（实际12fps）为主，快动作切'一拍一'，静止镜头'一拍三'\nline boil 伪造法：AE 用 Turbulent Displace（数量2~5、大小50）+ 每 2 帧随机化 evolution + Posterize Time 12fps；真 boil 则画 3~4 张微差线稿循环\nsmear frame：快速位移的中间帧把物体拉长 150%~300% 只保留 1 帧\ncel FX 点缀层：烟/水花/闪电用纯手绘逐帧叠在矢量主体上（Buck 式 hybrid）\n整体叠纸纹（multiply 10~15%）统一手作气质\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **曝光表**：24fps；SCHED 中 step 为 1、2、3；D.step === 3 ? D.id % 3 : D.id % 4。\n- **填色套偏**：REG = { dx: -5, dy: 4 }。\n- **爆炸冲击**：impact_frames = [6.5, 6.542]；NSPARK = 30。\n- **逐笔写字**：strokes = [7.25, 7.375, 7.5, 7.625, 7.75, 7.875, 8.0, 8.125, 8.25, 8.375, 8.5]。\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，24fps；提供公开成片的默认版本与横屏原作画幅。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/engine.js → PAL`：调整墨线、填色、纸面和红铅笔色板。\n- `film/scene.js → CHAR_SHOU、CHAR_ZUO、LET、TAG`：替换手绘字形与标语，并配套相应字体文件。\n- `film/cues.json → exposure 与动作节点`：调整曝光节奏和画音节点。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入 Motion Kit 时间轴、原片音轨与窗口缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-cel-boil/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-cel-boil)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-collage.md","title":"拼贴剪贴 · NOGGIN Quarterly","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 拼贴剪贴 · NOGGIN Quarterly\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n# 拼贴剪贴 Collage / Cutout Animation\n\n**原片**：NOGGIN 脑洞季刊「脑洞大开 The Mind Is a Collage」 · 1920×1080 · 30 fps · 10 秒 · AI 评审终评 8.14 / 10\n\n**源码**：[demos/06-collage/](../demos/06-collage/)\n\n## 怎么用\n\n1. 新建一个空文件夹，在里面打开一个能写代码、能执行命令的 AI 助手（例如 Claude Code）。本机需要能跑网页渲染（Node + Chrome）和 ffmpeg。\n2. 把下面「提示词」整段复制进去发送。\n3. 想换成自己的内容：改 `Creative seed` 里的故事、品牌名、文案和配色，或者改 `Output` 里的尺寸（比如竖屏 1080×1920）。不要删 `Signature features` 那一段，它是这种风格被一眼认出来的依据。\n4. 想再提高：成片出来后，另开一个 AI 用 [rubric.md](../rubric.md) 评审，把评审意见贴回给制作的 AI 再改一轮。原片就是这样改了两轮。\n\n## 提示词\n\n```text\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n拼贴剪贴 Collage / Cutout Animation\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML: DOM/Canvas with PNG cutouts from /assets/images (rembg), SVG/CSS white-edge + halftone filters; stepped 12 fps (render 30 fps, hold motion on 12 fps grid)\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「脑洞拼贴」Surreal Dada/Monty-Python cutout collage in a modern editorial magazine finish.\n- Newsprint/kraft paper ground; a public-domain Victorian portrait cutout with rough white scissor edge + halftone; the top of the head FLIPS OPEN like a lid (Terry Gilliam homage) revealing deep space (NASA PD imagery) from which flowers, birds, planets, pointing hands and a vintage rocket spill out.\n- Jaw/mouth on a separate cut flaps with the sound; hands slap elements onto the page; torn-paper strips; bold constructivist red/black diagonal typography (e.g. \"THE MIND IS A COLLAGE\" / 脑洞大开).\n- Motion on 12 fps (even 6 fps for some holds) with ±2px hand-placement jitter; paper-flip / torn-paper transition to the end card.\nSound: vinyl crackle, jazzy boom-bap bed, paper rustles, scissors snips, slaps and a comic 'pop' when the lid opens.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n把老照片、报纸、手撕纸片剪出来重新拼装的复古超现实风格，源头是 Monty Python 和苏联构成主义海报。人物头身比例失衡、嘴巴单独开合、半调网点纹理是标志。近年与'杂志风'合流，成为音乐类、街头潮流类短视频的高频风格。\n视觉特征 照片剪影白描边, 半调网点, 报纸纹理, 比例失衡的超现实拼装, 定格式抽帧运动\n关键技法 素材处理：人物/物件抠图后加 2~4px 白描边（剪刀剪出来的感觉）+ 半调 halftone 滤镜\n关节动画：锚点设在肩/肘/颌，做 puppet 式分段旋转，嘴巴用两三张替换帧开合\n刻意降帧：主体运动 12fps 甚至 6fps（stop-motion 感），位置加 ±2px 随机抖动模拟手摆\n图层结构：背景纸纹 → 大形色块 → 照片剪影 → 手写涂鸦/胶带贴纸 → 颗粒调整层\n转场用'手把元素拍上来'或整页翻纸\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n```\n\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **运动步长**：const K = t => Math.floor(t * 12 + 1e-4);\n- **停留抽帧**：const Q6 = t => Math.floor(t * 6 + 1e-4) / 6;\n- **落地挤压**：if (k === 0) return { s: 0.972, lift: 0, k, sq: 1 };\n- **卷纸分条**：const NS = 12, q = PI * CR / 2 / NS;\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `assets/gen/、source/work/`：替换拼贴物件，原作脚本保存半调、剪边与纸张制作过程。\n- `film/scene.js → SPEECH、SPILL、CH、PEEL`：调整纸片内容、飞出动作与撕纸卷曲。\n- `film/cues.json`：调整 12fps 网格上的拍点与段落。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入时间轴、原片音轨与窗口等比缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-collage/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-collage)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-flat-vector.md","title":"扁平矢量 · popwise — One Dot","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 扁平矢量 · popwise — One Dot\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n扁平矢量动画 Flat / Vector 2D Motion Graphics\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML: SVG + GSAP (CustomEase/CustomBounce/MorphSVG); motion blur mb=4 for fast moves\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「一镜到底的扁平世界」One-continuous-shot brand explainer, the canonical Motion-Ocean/Google-explainer form, pushed to showreel polish.\n- 0.0–1.2s HOOK: empty bold color field; a single saturated circle drops in with the three-phase anticipation → stretch → squash → overshoot → settle. Immediately readable craft.\n- 1.2–3.0s: the circle becomes the sun; a flat city pops up building-by-building with 2–4 frame stagger (each with its own mini overshoot), clouds slide, birds flap.\n- 3.0–5.5s: camera pushes into one window → a geometric character at a desk (limb rig with anchor rotations, head bob, blink) reacts; phone pings.\n- 5.5–8.0s: the notification bubble expands to fill the frame as a SHAPE WIPE transition; inside, icons burst in a choreographed rhythm (bar chart grows, check mark draws, heart pops, coin flips).\n- 8.0–10.0s: element-driven transition — everything collapses/flies into a logo lockup for an invented brand (e.g. \"Popwise\") + tagline, elastic settle, 1s hold with micro-motion.\nRules: one hero moves at a time; squash&stretch ~10%; secondary action & follow-through; element-driven transitions (an object flies out and carries the cut); strictly flat (no gradients), bold 5–6 color palette (e.g. ultramarine #2B2BFF, coral #FF5A4E, sunflower #FFC62B, mint #2EE6A8, cream #FFF6E9, ink #151433).\nSound: upbeat future-bass/pop ~120 BPM; pop/boing/whoosh on each entry, synced to the frame.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\nMG 动画最主流的基本盘风格，源自 Google Material/企业解释视频（explainer）传统。纯色几何化的人物与场景、无描边或极简描边、大色块撞色，一切元素都是矢量形状。常见于 SaaS 产品宣传、科普解说、企业年报视频。\n视觉特征 纯色大色块, 几何化角色, 无渐变或极少渐变, 干净留白, 高饱和品牌色板, 元素弹性入退场\n关键技法 AE Shape Layer + 父子级 null 控制层级，人物四肢用锚点旋转做 rig\n弹性缓动是灵魂：overshoot 用 cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1) 或 AE 里 70~85% influence 的贝塞尔手柄；入场'预备-冲出-回弹'三段式\n元素错峰入场（stagger 2~4 帧），同一时刻只让一个主体动\n30fps 居多；位移动画带 10% 左右 squash&stretch 增加弹性\n转场常用色块擦除（shape wipe）或元素飞出带动整场切换\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **弹性曲线**：cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)；闭式阻尼弹簧与速度驱动的压扁拉伸。\n- **建筑错峰**：bldStart=44 帧，bldStagger=3 帧，bldCount=9。\n- **图标落点**：180、195、210、225 帧。\n- **标语入场**：中文 259 帧，英文 266 帧；圆点 255 帧落字。\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/scene.js → C`：调整原作色板。\n- `film/scene.js → WORD、CN 与英文标语`：替换品牌与标语，并配套相应字体文件。\n- `film/cues.json → frames、build、drop、outro`：调整画面节点与配乐阶段，保持同一时间表。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入 Motion Kit 时间轴、原片音轨与窗口缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-flat-vector/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-flat-vector)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-hanazi.md","title":"综艺花字 · 喵呜日记 EP.07","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 综艺花字 · 喵呜日记 EP.07\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n# 综艺花字 Variety Show Kinetic Captions (Hanazi)\n\n**原片**：喵呜日记 EP.07「今日份快乐」 · 1080×1920 · 30 fps · 10 秒 · AI 评审终评 7.64 / 10\n\n**源码**：[demos/18-hanazi/](../demos/18-hanazi/)\n\n## 怎么用\n\n1. 新建一个空文件夹，在里面打开一个能写代码、能执行命令的 AI 助手（例如 Claude Code）。本机需要能跑网页渲染（Node + Chrome）和 ffmpeg。\n2. 把下面「提示词」整段复制进去发送。\n3. 想换成自己的内容：改 `Creative seed` 里的故事、品牌名、文案和配色，或者改 `Output` 里的尺寸（比如竖屏 1080×1920）。不要删 `Signature features` 那一段，它是这种风格被一眼认出来的依据。\n4. 想再提高：成片出来后，另开一个 AI 用 [rubric.md](../rubric.md) 评审，把评审意见贴回给制作的 AI 再改一轮。原片就是这样改了两轮。\n\n## 提示词\n\n```text\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n综艺花字 Variety Show Kinetic Captions (Hanazi)\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1080×1920, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML DOM/SVG: multi-layer text-stroke 花字 components + spring pops + SVG burst/sweat/sparkle decorations over a pet-vlog footage layer (CC0 photos with Ken Burns + handheld shake + punch-ins)\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「萌宠综艺感 vlog」综艺花字 in its native habitat — reactive captions over a pet vlog.\n- Base layer that feels like footage: CC0/PD cat or dog photos from /assets/images with slow Ken Burns, subtle handheld shake, snap punch-in zooms on 'moments' (you may also build a stylised scene if photos look weak).\n- 花字 moments synced to beats: title \"今日份快乐\" (fill gradient + thick white stroke + coloured outer stroke + drop shadow, rounded heavy font), \"？？？\" bouncing question marks, \"震惊!!\" inside a radial 爆炸框 with speed lines + 放射线 flash, \"（小声）\" small aside, \"绝绝子\" with sparkles, sweat drops, a \"猫主子认证\" stamp.\n- Motion: pop 0 → 1.15 → 1.0 in ~8 frames, per-character bounce with 2-frame stagger, slight rotation, gentle wiggle while holding; appear 2–3 frames after the audio/visual moment. High-saturation pink/yellow/cyan with white strokes.\nSound: bouncy variety-show bed (pizzicato/bass/claps) + boing, pop, ding, slide whistle, record scratch on '？？？'.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n源自电视综艺后期的情绪化装饰字幕：多层描边圆体字带弹性入场，跟随人物情绪变色变形，配打击音效。现已下沉为 vlog、萌宠、访谈、搞笑二创的通用包装语言，剪映内置大量花字模板，B 站也有免费花字样式包流通。\n视觉特征 多层描边圆体/胖体字, 高饱和撞色+白边+投影, 弹性 pop 入场, 配合音效出现, 手绘装饰符号（爆炸框/汗滴/闪光）\n关键技法 字体三层结构：填充色+粗白描边+彩色外描边/投影（CSS 可用多层 text-shadow 或 SVG stroke 模拟）\n入场 overshoot：scale 0→1.15→1.0（约 8 帧），或逐字弹跳错帧 2 帧\n情绪匹配：吐槽用歪斜手写体、惊讶用放射线爆炸框、尴尬用汗滴符号\n出现时机对齐笑点/音效，比语音晚 2~3 帧更自然\n长时间驻留花字加轻微 wiggle 保持活性\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n```\n\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **弹簧参数**：function spring(t, z = 0.517, w = 22)\n- **逐字错峰**：\"title\": [0.2, 0.267, 0.333, 0.4, 0.467]\n- **推镜倍率**：\"pushZ\": [1.4, 2.0, 2.9]\n- **指针时间**：\"needle\": [7.0, 7.133]\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1080×1920，30fps；只提供竖屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/scene.js → HZ、charXf、PL`：调整花字层次、弹簧与照片构图。\n- `assets/、source/assets/`：替换照片与炸毛贴图，保留原作制作脚本。\n- `film/cues.json`：调整逐字时刻、推镜与主拍节点。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入时间轴、原片音轨与窗口等比缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-hanazi/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-hanazi)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-hud.md","title":"赛博朋克 HUD · KESTREL-9 · Target Acquired","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 赛博朋克 HUD · KESTREL-9 · Target Acquired\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n赛博朋克 HUD / FUI Cyberpunk HUD / FUI (Fictional UI)\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML: SVG/Canvas FUI layers + Three.js wireframe hologram; seeded random data; glow/scanline post pass\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「目标锁定 TARGET ACQUIRED」Cyberpunk HUD / FUI, film-UI grade (Territory Studio-level density & restraint).\n- Deep teal-black; cyan #00E5FF linework with orange/red #FF6A00 alert state; hex grid, concentric rotating rings with ticks, radar sweep (conic) with blips, data columns (monospace numbers rolling 3–5 frames then settling), typewriter status lines with cursor, sparkline graphs, a central Three.js wireframe hologram (globe or drone) with scanlines.\n- Layered build-up: lines draw on in hierarchical staggered order → data comes alive → a target is found → lock brackets snap 1.4 → 1.0 (fast-out slow-in) → everything flips to alert orange with 'TARGET LOCKED / 目标锁定', coordinates \"N31°14′ E121°29′\".\n- Glow, slight chromatic aberration, scanlines, restrained micro-glitches.\nSound: darksynth pulse + HUD beeps, scan sweeps, ascending lock-on tone, alarm on lock.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n模拟科幻电影/游戏界面的抬头显示包装：青橙霓虹线框、目标锁定框、雷达扫描、数据流小字。在科技数码测评、游戏剪辑（赛博朋克2077、EVA 二创）、军事航天科普和 AI 产品演示中作为『科技感』的默认皮肤，B 站 AE HUD 案例教程播放量达 20 万。\n视觉特征 青色/橙色霓虹线框, 目标锁定框与十字准星, 雷达/环形扫描 loop, 等宽小字数据流与打字机文字, 六边形网格与辉光\n关键技法 线框生长：SVG stroke-dasharray/dashoffset 描边动画，元素按层级错帧展开\n环形雷达：conic-gradient 扫描扇区旋转 loop + 目标点闪烁\n数字滚动：随机数快速跳变 3~5 帧后落定真实值；文字打字机 + 光标闪烁\n锁定框：四角括号从大到小收缩吸附目标（scale 1.4→1.0 + 快出缓入）\n全局外发光（glow）+ 轻微色差 + 扫描线叠加统一质感\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **锁定主拍**：export const LOCK = 6.4;\n- **雷达周期**：\"radar_period\": 2.0\n- **警报波**：E.outC(prog(t, LOCK, K.wave_dur)) * 1350\n- **镜头穿入**：\"dive\": [6.4333, 7.1]\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/js/util.js → TARGET、CND`：调整目标与候选经纬度。\n- `film/js/hud.js`：调整面板、遥测、标题与坐标文案。\n- `film/js/holo.js、film/js/post.js`：调整全息地球、镜头、警报波与模拟屏幕后期。\n- `film/cues.json`：调整开机、扫描、发现、锁定、地图解析和回传节点。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入时间轴、原片音轨与窗口等比缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-hud/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-hud)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-isometric.md","title":"等距 2.5D · ISOPOLIS — Let the City Grow","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 等距 2.5D · ISOPOLIS — Let the City Grow\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n等轴 2.5D Isometric / 2.5D\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML: Three.js OrthographicCamera at true isometric angle + soft shadows + AO (three/addons postprocessing), or SVG with SSR matrix faces\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「微缩智慧城」An isometric miniature city / data campus that builds itself — the School-of-Motion isometric mograph showpiece.\n- True isometric camera (orthographic, 35.264° elevation, 45° azimuth), no perspective, pastel studio palette (lavender ground, mint, peach, sky blue, white) with soft shadows + ambient occlusion so it reads like a premium Dribbble/Behance hero.\n- 0–2s: ground tiles flip/drop in as a wave from the centre (tiny bounce each);\n- 2–5s: buildings GROW — base lands, walls scaleY from 0 with overshoot, roof caps 2–3 frames later; trees pop; windows light up in sequence;\n- 5–8s: life — cars loop along roads, a little train, drones carrying packets, glowing data streams pulse between buildings, a wind turbine spins; camera does parallel slides (no rotation) with 1 : 0.8 : 0.6 parallax layers (foreground clouds);\n- 8–10s: pull back to reveal the whole island floating in a pastel void; title card set ON the isometric plane (text skewed into iso space) e.g. \"SMART CITY OS\".\nSound: bright plucky tech melody (FM marimba/pluck), soft clicks/pops for every tile/building landing, airy whoosh on the pull-back.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n以 30° 等轴测投影展示微缩世界：小城市、办公室切片、数据机房，无灭点、处处等比。信息密度高又不失可爱，是科技公司架构图动画和 App 功能演示的标配。School of Motion 有专门的 isometric mograph 教程系列。\n视觉特征 30°等角投影, 无透视灭点, 微缩场景, 楼房生长动画, 平行滑轨式运镜\n关键技法 SSR 公式造等轴面：Scale 纵向 86.6% → Shear/skew ±30° → Rotate ∓30°，三个面分别做后拼合\n假 3D 靠图层排序：Z 序=画面 y 坐标，物体沿等轴网格移动时保持 2:1 像素斜率\n楼房'生长'：底面先落位，立面用 scaleY 从 0 拉起 + 顶面延迟 2~3 帧盖上\n运镜是整组平移（无旋转），配合前中后景 1:0.8:0.6 的视差速度\nAE 里可用真 3D 图层+正交相机（无透视）偷懒，Motion Design School 的 Isometric Camera 技巧即此路\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **地块环节点**：rings=[0.25,0.5,0.75,1.0,1.25,1.5]；角向错峰 ang*0.07。\n- **墙体生长**：A.spring(tau,14.8,0.61,0)；墙体延后 1/30 秒；roof_lag=0.375。\n- **激活波**：drop=6.0；PULSE_T=cues.drop-0.015；pulse_speed=15.0；FLIP_D=5/30。\n- **视差层**：前景、城市、背景为 1.0 : 0.8 : 0.6；相机不旋转。\n- **字母落点**：letters_start=8.5625；letters_step=0.0625；final=9.0。\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/world.js → PAL、MAP 与模型定义`：调整城市配色、12×12 地块布局与模型参数。\n- `film/main.js → CAM、buildTitle、buildTags`：调整镜头轨道、品牌文字、标语与三张信息卡内容。\n- `film/cues.json`：调整地块、建筑、核心、数据卡与落版节点，画面与配乐共用时间表。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入 Motion Kit 时间轴、原片音轨与窗口缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-isometric/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-isometric)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-line-art.md","title":"线条艺术 · ATELIER LINEA — One Line","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 线条艺术 · ATELIER LINEA — One Line\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n线条动画 Line Art / Line Animation\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML: SVG paths + stroke-dashoffset (getTotalLength) + GSAP; a virtual camera that follows the pen tip\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「一笔画」One-line narrative for a luxury / architecture brand — the whole film is ONE continuous line.\n- Deep midnight ground (#0B1320 or near-black) + a single champagne-gold line (#E9D7A5), constant ~3px, round caps, a softly glowing pen tip that leads the draw.\n- Story (continuous path, the tail of each figure is the start of the next): a seed → sprouts into a sapling → branches become the structural lines of a building → the building outline extends into a skyline/horizon → the horizon line lifts and loops into a monogram logo → LINE-TO-FILL moment (logo fills with gold from its anchor) → thin letter-spaced serif wordmark (e.g. \"ATELIER LINEA\") fades up.\n- Draw speed eases into corners (cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)); the virtual camera drifts/pushes to keep the tip in frame, then dollies out at the end to reveal the whole drawing composed as a poster; older line segments dim to ~35% as the camera moves on.\nSound: minimal felt piano + soft string swell; a pen-on-paper whisper whose loudness follows tip speed; delicate chime on the fill.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n以单色细线为唯一造型语言，线条自我描绘（draw-on）、延伸、转折并变形为下一个图形，一笔连成整支片子。极简高级感强，常见于奢侈品、金融、建筑类品牌片和 logo 动画。\n视觉特征 等宽细线, 单色或双色, 大量负空间, 线条连续生长, 线面转换瞬间\n关键技法 核心是 stroke 描绘：AE 用 Trim Paths 0→100%，Web 端用 SVG stroke-dasharray/dashoffset\n线宽全片恒定（2~4px），转角处让描绘速度略减速，用 easeInOut cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)\n'一笔画'叙事：上一图形的尾线即下一图形的起线，路径提前在 Illustrator 里连好\n线转面：描完轮廓后用同路径的 fill 从锚点扩展填充\n配合微小的端点圆头（round cap）与路径抖动可增加手绘感\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **描绘缓动**：cubicBezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1)；KCORN = 9；STEP = 0.5。\n- **笔尖跟随**：sigma: 0.3；lead: 0.08；hook lag: 0.067。\n- **线转面**：start: 7.5；swell: 0.367；cubicBezier(0.24, 0.3, 0.2, 1)。\n- **字标收拢**：start: 8.333；stagger: 0.045；dur: 0.95；track = 0.46。\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/film.js → PIECES、WV`：调整连续路径的图形、浪花与衔接位置。\n- `film/film.js → GOLD、AGED、HOT、NAVY 与 drawText`：调整配色、品牌字标与标语，并配套相应字体文件。\n- `film/cues.json → draw、zoom、camera、fill、wordmark`：调整描绘、镜头、线面转换与文字节点，配乐读取同一时间表。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入 Motion Kit 时间轴、原片音轨与窗口缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-line-art/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-line-art)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-liquid.md","title":"液态动效 · drop. — It All Starts with a Drop","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 液态动效 · drop. — It All Starts with a Drop\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n液态流动 Liquid Motion\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML WebGL2 fragment shader: 2D SDF metaballs (smooth-min) + fake 3D lighting from field gradient normals, text SDF for the logo\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「液态创世」Liquid logo genesis — glossy, organic, high energy.\n- Deep plum ground; glossy candy liquid (hot orange → pink → violet) with specular highlights and fresnel rim so it reads like thick 3D liquid, not flat blobs.\n- 0–2s: droplets fall and splash with squash on landing; 2–4s: blobs merge via metaball fusion — stretched necks, snap, 2–3 frame rebound; secondary droplets follow 2–3 frames late;\n- 4–6s: a big liquid wave floods across the frame as a transition (wavy front with 3–5 phase-offset bulges);\n- 6–8.5s: the liquid coalesces into a wordmark (e.g. \"FLUX\") — text SDF blended with the metaballs;\n- 8.5–10s: a last drip falls from the logo and ripples; hold.\nEase: flung, never uniform (cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)).\nSound: bubbly gloops, pour, splash, drip, deep bass swell under a glossy synth bed.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n图形像液体一样流动、拉丝、滴落、融合：转场是一泼颜料漫过屏幕，logo 从一滴液体聚合成形。有机、解压、高能量，广泛用于音乐视频、食品饮料广告和转场包装。\n视觉特征 波浪边缘转场, 拉丝与滴落, metaball融合, 次级液滴跟随, 有机曲线永不直线\n关键技法 液态转场：遮罩路径手 K 波浪形前沿扫过画面，前沿加 3~5 个错相位的凸起\nmetaball 融合的通用伪造法：高斯模糊(20px+) → 提高对比度阈值（AE 用 Levels 收紧、Web 用 feColorMatrix alpha 阈值），两球靠近即自动'粘连'\n拉丝-断裂-回弹：主形离开时留一条细颈，断裂瞬间两端各回弹 2~3 帧\n缓动前快后慢 cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)，液体只会被'甩'出去不会匀速\n次级液滴延迟主体 2~3 帧跟随（follow-through），落地做扁平化 squash\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **抛出缓动**：export const flung = bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n- **重力**：const G = 5000;\n- **字标收束**：const massY = word.baseY - 100, SLOT = 0.55;\n- **距离场字形**：weight: 900, size: 400, tracking: 10, pad: 170, sigma: 10\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/js/scene.js → drops、CAM、JELLY_HITS`：调整落滴、镜头和字标果冻波。\n- `film/main.js → buildLetterSDF`：调整字标内容、字号、字距与距离场平滑。\n- `film/js/shaders.js → palThin、palMid、palDeep`：调整厚液配色与高光。\n- `film/cues.json、film/js/type.js`：调整液浪、成字、末滴节点与双语标语。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入时间轴、原片音轨与窗口等比缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-liquid/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-liquid)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-morph.md","title":"形状变形 · morphe. — One Shape, Every Story","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 形状变形 · morphe. — One Shape, Every Story\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n形变动画 Morphing / Shape Morph\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML: SVG + flubber or GSAP MorphSVGPlugin (tune shapeIndex), color-field wipes\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「万物相连」Apple-keynote-grade morph chain: one hero shape continuously becomes 6–8 meaningful icons, on the beat.\n- Chain example: coffee cup → (circle) → sun → sunset over sea → gull → paper plane → location pin → heart → invented brand logo \"morphe\" with wordmark.\n- Every A→B goes through a simple intermediate (circle/capsule) with rotation and 10–15% squash&stretch; sub-parts morph in sync (steam → sun rays → waves).\n- Background color fields change with each morph (clean color-block wipes); ease cubic-bezier(0.7,0,0.3,1), 3-frame cushions at start/end; no knotting/tangling ever (check every morph mid-point stills).\nSound: rhythmic plucky arpeggio; a pitched whoosh per morph landing on the beat.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n一个图形丝滑连续地变成另一个图形：手机变成地图钉、咖啡杯变成落日。是图形叙事（visual storytelling）的核心语法，苹果发布会动效和高端 explainer 里最见功力的部分。\n视觉特征 轮廓连续过渡无跳变, 中介形状桥接, 形变伴随位移旋转, 变形瞬间的挤压拉伸\n关键技法 路径对齐是前提：两形状顶点数一致、首顶点方位对应（AE 里重设 first vertex），否则会打结\n复杂 A→B 不直接变：先收敛为中介简形（圆/胶囊）再展开，'A→圆→B'两段各 8~12 帧\n形变全程叠加 10~15% squash & stretch 与轻微旋转，掩盖插值的机械感\n速度曲线中段最快 cubic-bezier(0.7,0,0.3,1)：起止各留 3 帧缓冲\nWeb 端用 flubber/polymorph 库做最优顶点匹配插值，效果远好于朴素 SMIL\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **主体采样**：const NB = 240, NH = 72, NM = 24, NS = 60;\n- **形变缓动**：const EM = bez(0.7, 0, 0.3, 1);\n- **杯转太阳**：'cup>sun': { via: [0, 18, 116], rot: 24, ctrl: [70, -10], sq: 0.13 }\n- **归点时间**：const ED = { t0: 8.44, st: 0.04, dur: 0.70 };\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/scene.js → I、MP、C`：调整图形定义、形变中介、轮廓对应关系与配色。\n- `film/glyphs.json`：字标轮廓由 source/tools/glyphs.py 从字体提取。\n- `film/cues.json`：调整形变、落点、字幕、色域与圆点归位节点。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入时间轴、原片音轨与窗口等比缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-morph/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-morph)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-paperclip.md","title":"贴纸科普 · How Many Elements Hide in a Phone?","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 贴纸科普 · How Many Elements Hide in a Phone?\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n粗描边贴纸人科普 MG（回形针/林超风格） Bold-outline Sticker Explainer MG (PaperClip / Lin Chao style)\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML: one huge canvas (e.g. 6000×3000 px) with a camera transform (long eases), SVG charts, photo stickers with 10px white outline\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「回形针式硬核科普」The PaperClip-style knowledge-video look: sticker-ized photos + flat icons + precise charts on a giant canvas with continuous camera moves.\n- Topic (write your own tight copy), e.g. 「一部手机里，藏着多少种元素？」.\n- Calm blue-grey/off-white canvas (#E9EEF2 + slate), 2–3 colours + one accent (e.g. #FF5A36); equal-weight sans typography, strict alignment.\n- One continuous camera path: sticker phone photo (white 10px outline, soft shadow) → exploded-parts stickers with leader-line labels → periodic-table grid where element tiles light up → bar chart grows with count-up \"70+\" → world map with supply routes drawing → pull out to a bold typographic title card in the 回形针 manner (heavy sans, huge number, small caption).\n- Every beat introduces a new visual element; charts are exact (bars to scale, numbers consistent).\nSound: clean tech-explainer bed, UI clicks, ticking during count-up, soft whoosh on camera moves.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n回形针 PaperClip 带火的知识区标准包装：实拍图片抠图后加粗白描边变成『贴纸』，与扁平图标、数据图表一起铺在大画布上，镜头平移缩放串联信息点；林超等财经/跨学科 UP 主将其与手写板书、公式卡片结合。至今仍是硬核科普、财经知识区、企业宣传片的主流范式。\n视觉特征 照片贴纸化（粗白描边）, 蓝灰/米白冷静底色, 扁平图标+精确数据图表, 大画布镜头平移缩放, 信息密度极高的节拍化叙事\n关键技法 素材照片抠图 + 8~12px 白描边统一质感，消除图片来源差异\n超宽大画布布局，摄像机层做平移/缩放（ease 长曲线），一镜串多个信息点\n图表动效：柱状图生长、数字滚动计数、路径描边生长\n解说词逐句驱动画面元素入场，语速快、每句必有新视觉元素\n克制配色（2~3 色）+ 等线字体，保持『严肃感』\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **大画布**：\"world\": { \"w\": 2400, \"h\": 5900 }\n- **飞行缓动**：const eFly=bez(.62,0,.22,1), ePull=bez(.5,0,.08,1);\n- **白色描边**：S=2; OUT=10*S\n- **元素飞行**：\"chip_flight\": 0.65; \"chip_stagger\": [0.0025, 0.025]; \"chip_rows\": [1, 0, 2, 3, 4]\n- **数字落点**：\"peel\": 7.9; \"endline\": [7.96, 8.14]; \"slam\": 8.14\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/scene.js → PARTS、CATS、数据定义`：调整部件、周期表元素和分类图表的内容与布局。\n- `film/cues.json → cam、ev`：调整大画布镜头轨迹与拆解、元素、地图和落版节点。\n- `assets/stickers/`：替换照片贴纸与尺寸数据；source/tools/stickers.py 保存原作抠图和描边过程。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入时间轴、原片音轨与窗口等比缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-paperclip/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-paperclip)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-pixel.md","title":"像素艺术 · PIXEL QUEST","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 像素艺术 · PIXEL QUEST\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n像素风 Pixel Art / 8-bit\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML Canvas at 320×180 internal resolution, integer-scaled ×6 with nearest-neighbour; sprites authored as pixel arrays in code; limited palette\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「像素冒险 PIXEL QUEST」A retro side-scroller title/attract sequence.\n- Internal 320×180, ×6 nearest-neighbour; limited palette (PICO-8-like 16–32 colours) with dithered sky gradient; 3–4 parallax layers (sky, far mountains, mid forest/city, near ground tiles) moving by whole pixels.\n- Hero sprite (hand-authored 16×16–24×24, 6–8 frame run cycle at ~10–12 fps) runs, jumps, collects coins (sparkle), bops a slime; the palette shifts day → sunset; a treasure chest opens with a light burst.\n- Dialogue box with pixel CJK font typing 「欢迎来到像素世界！」; chunky pixel logo \"PIXEL QUEST\" drops in with shine sweep; optional CRT pass (scanlines, slight barrel, phosphor glow) that doesn't blur pixels into mush.\n- Strictly: nearest-neighbour, integer pixel positions, stepped timing (no smooth easing on sprites).\nSound: chiptune (pulse lead, triangle bass, noise drums) + jump/coin/chest SFX.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n低分辨率大颗粒像素 + 有限色板 + 低帧率精灵动画的复古游戏美学，在 B 站游戏区（MC、泰拉瑞亚、独立游戏）、8-bit 音乐 MV 和品牌怀旧营销中常见；Aseprite 教程在 B 站有 10 万+ 播放的稳定学习生态。\n视觉特征 大颗粒像素与硬边缘, 有限色板(8~32色), 8~12fps 精灵帧动画, 抖动渐变 dithering, CRT 扫描线滤镜\n关键技法 Aseprite 绘制精灵表（sprite sheet）+ 序列帧循环（走路 6~8 帧、呼吸 2~4 帧）\n缩放必须最近邻插值（CSS image-rendering: pixelated），杜绝抗锯齿糊边\n动画用 steps() 阶梯时序而非平滑缓动，保持逐帧感\n视差卷轴背景：远中近三层不同速度整像素平移\n可选 CRT 后处理：扫描线+桶形畸变+磷光辉光\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **像素画布**：320×180，常规放大 6 倍至 1920×1080。\n- **精灵时序**：30fps 输出，奔跑每 3 帧切换姿态，循环包含 6 帧。\n- **阶梯推近**：5.9、6.0、6.1 秒依次放大至 8、10、12 倍；6.4 秒回到 6 倍。\n- **结尾节点**：7.2 秒片名、7.6 秒高光、8.0 秒起副标题和夜色、8.4 秒开始提示。\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps，横屏。\n- 原作作者 Vincentwei1021，仓库 https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15 ，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可；字体与配乐出处见 Demo 内 LICENSES.md。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/film.js 的像素数组与色板`：替换角色、道具、片名与配色，保持整像素绘制、阶梯动作和有限色板。\n- `film/cues.json`：调整跳跃、金币、对话、开箱和标题的时刻，画面与配乐同步使用该时刻表。\n- `source/audio.py 与 audio/film.m4a`：为新作品合成芯片配乐与音效；本案例播放从原片抽取的音轨。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：连接 Motion Atlas 时间轴、横屏缩放、中文控制条与音轨同步。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-pixel/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-pixel)\n"},{"path":"prompts/cases/mg-synthwave.md","title":"80 年代合成波 · NEON DRIVE — Midnight 1986","group":"案例 Prompt","content":"# 80 年代合成波 · NEON DRIVE — Midnight 1986\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\nYou are the director, motion designer, engineer and sound designer of ONE 10-second motion-design film.\nThe goal is the most classic, yet most stunning form of this style — award-shortlist / high-end commercial quality. A clean,\ntemplate-looking result is a fail. Benchmarks: Buck, ManvsMachine, Ordinary Folk, Giant Ant, Territory Studio, Apple keynote\nmotion, Pentagram motion identities, top Behance/Motionographer features, top 抖音/B站 designer accounts.\n\n# Style\n复古系（80s Synthwave / Y2K 千禧） Retro: 80s Synthwave / VHS / Y2K\n\n# Output (fixed)\n- 1920×1080, 30 fps, exactly 10.000 s (300 frames), H.264 MP4 with stereo AAC audio (48 kHz), mastered to −14 LUFS\n  integrated, true peak ≤ −1 dBTP. Final file: video.mp4.\n\n# Suggested technical route\nHTML WebGL (perspective grid, sun, mountains shader) + canvas chrome text + CSS/SVG glow; VHS pass\n(You may choose a better route if it clearly raises quality; say why.)\n\n# Creative seed\n「OUTRUN 1986」The quintessential 80s synthwave title sequence.\n- Starry night, striped retro sun (horizontal band cut-outs, magenta→orange→yellow), wireframe mountains, palm silhouettes, neon magenta/cyan perspective grid rushing toward the camera.\n- 0–1s: VHS tracking noise + 'PLAY ▶' OSD; 1–4s: camera flies low over the grid, sun rises; 4–6s: CHROME title (e.g. \"NEON DRIVE\", multi-stop metallic gradient, bevel highlight, star glint sweeping across) SLAMS in with a lens flare; 6–7.5s: pink neon script word (e.g. \"Midnight\") writes on like a neon tube with flicker; 7.5–10s: sustained ride, subtle VHS chroma bleed/scanlines, end on the hero frame.\n- Double glow (tight ~4px + wide ~30px), deep purple sky gradient.\nSound: synthwave — gated-reverb snare, arpeggiated saw bass, lush pads, big chord + crash on the title slam.\n\nYou are the director: you may change the concept, copy, story beats and brand names if you find a stronger idea, but the result must remain the CANONICAL, instantly-recognisable form of this style and must hit its signature features below.\n\n# Signature features and key techniques (the result is judged against these)\n对特定年代媒介美学的整体引用：80s synthwave 是霓虹网格+日落渐变+镀铬字；VHS 是扫描线+色偏+磁带噪声；Y2K 千禧风是液态镀铬金属、酸性绿紫、拟物系统窗口和低保真 3D。近两年 Y2K 在音乐视频与潮流品牌片中强势回潮，B站模板市场大量供应'酸性镀铬'素材。\n视觉特征 霓虹辉光, 透视网格地平线, 扫描线与RGB色偏, 镀铬金属字, 酸性配色, 拟物窗口UI\n关键技法 synthwave 三件套：透视网格滚动（一点透视 grid + 纵向位移循环）、日落多层渐变球、双层辉光（内层紧 4px 高亮+外层散 30px 低透明）\nVHS 做旧链：RGB split（红蓝通道各偏 1~2px）→ 扫描线（2px 间隔 10% 黑条）→ 波浪扭曲抖动（每秒 1~2 次随机 glitch 抽帧）→ 4:3 圆角遮罩\nY2K 镀铬字：极高对比的多段金属渐变 + bevel 高光 + 环境映射感反光，配 lens flare\nY2K 运动语言：弹窗式 pop 出现、光标点击、窗口拖拽，界面拟物即动画叙事\n帧率故意不稳：关键段落抽帧到 15fps 或倒放 2 帧制造磁带卡顿\n\n# How to work\n1. Treatment. Write down one clear idea: a hook in the first 0.5 s (never open on more than 0.3 s of empty or black), an\n   escalation, one unmistakable hero moment at ~60–75 % of the runtime, and a composed end frame held ~0.8–1.2 s with living\n   micro-motion. Map every signature feature above to a moment. Keep one cue sheet (beats and hit times) that both the\n   picture and the sound read from.\n2. Key frames before motion. Build the look, render stills at 6–10 key times and actually look at them. Each still should be\n   poster-worthy: composition, hierarchy, negative space, type set properly (kerning, line-height, weight contrast, CJK\n   punctuation, ~5 % safe margins). Iterate until nothing looks default, generic, cramped or \"AI-template\".\n3. Motion. Build the choreography and preview at low resolution. Step through the fastest moves frame by frame: spacing,\n   easing, arcs, overlap, anticipation and follow-through, motion blur. No unintended dead spans; the energy follows the music.\n4. Sound. Write genre-correct music and sound design locked to the cue sheet. Check that visual hits land on audio onsets.\n   Master to the output spec.\n5. Final. Render at full resolution (motion blur where apt), then check: exactly 10.00 s, resolution, fps, audio present and at\n   the right loudness, no black frames, no fallback fonts or tofu, no clipped elements at the frame edges, no shimmer on thin\n   lines, no gradient banding. Fix and repeat until you would submit it to a festival.\n6. Write an honest self-critique: what is strongest, what is weakest, what you would do with more time.\n\n# Rules\n- Rendering must be deterministic: every frame is a pure function of time t. Seeded randomness only; physics and particles\n  precomputed or closed-form; no real-time clocks; no state-triggered CSS transitions. A reliable route: a web page that can\n  draw any time t on request, captured frame by frame with a headless browser and encoded with ffmpeg (or a Blender script\n  that renders a PNG sequence).\n- Assets: only CC0 / public domain / OFL / Apache / free-for-commercial-use. Record each source and licence in CREDITS.md.\n  No real brand trademarks; invent brand names.\n- On-screen text must be correct and natural: idiomatic Chinese, proper CJK punctuation, no typos.\n\n# Craft checklist (what a jury looks for)\n- Style authenticity: an expert names the style in one second; every signature technique is present and executed correctly.\n- Motion craft: purposeful easing (no linear unless mechanical by design), overlap and stagger, anticipation and\n  follow-through, arcs, squash and stretch where the style allows, consistent physics, motion blur where apt; transitions\n  carried by elements, not crossfades.\n- Rhythm: hits locked to the music; contrast between busy and calm; no monotony.\n- Design: strong composition, grid, typographic hierarchy, controlled palette; texture and finishing (grain, glow, vignette)\n  only where the style wants it; nothing looks accidental.\n- Technical polish: no jitter (unless intended), no popping, no aliasing, no banding, no fallback fonts, no half-loaded images.\n- Sound: genre-correct, musical, synced, mastered.\n\n# Before you deliver, score yourself honestly\n1–10 on style fidelity, concept wow, motion craft, design & typography, finish & texture, sound & sync, technical\n(6 = template-level, 8 = high-end agency, 9 = award shortlist). Aim for 9; fix whatever scores lowest first.\n\n# Deliver\nvideo.mp4, plus a short report: the concept in two sentences; a beat sheet with timecodes; how each signature feature is\nrealised; the tech route; check numbers (duration, resolution, fps, loudness, true peak); your honest top-3 weaknesses.\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **地平线偏移**：const SHIFT = 75;\n- **标题构成**：const TITLE = 'NEON DRIVE', TS = 1.5, TITLE_W = 1400, TITLE_CY = 300;\n- **霓虹轮廓**：const SFS = 226, SCRIPT = 'Midnight', SCX = 1195, SCY = 470, SROT = -0.13;\n- **显像管末帧**：const CRT = { 295: [1, .30, .25, 0], 296: [1, .0019, 1, .030], 297: [.26, .0019, 1.1, .022], 298: [.0073, .013, 1.3, .036], 299: [.0055, .010, .35, .012] };\n\n## 制作约束\n\n- 原作：Vincentwei1021，https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/mg-styles-15，固定提交 49052d80bfaf9fa8412cc9710530e5e95a3b8d8c，MIT 许可。\n- 10 秒，1920×1080，30fps；只提供横屏原作画幅，复刻公开成片的默认版本。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `film/scene.js → TITLE、SCRIPT、TAG`：调整镀铬标题、霓虹手写内容与标语。\n- `film/scene.js → speed、poseCam、carGap`：调整公路速度、镜头与跑车推进。\n- `film/cues.json`：调整换道、倒带、落版、描写、点亮和关机节点。\n- `index.html → MotionKit.mountFilm`：接入时间轴、原片音轨与窗口等比缩放。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/cases/mg-synthwave/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../cases.html#case/mg-synthwave)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/alert-reroute.md","title":"警示横幅与改道","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 警示横幅与改道\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n坐错车时红色警示横幅压下，错误路线打叉，改道路线重新描画。复用地图巡礼的 drawAlert、addRouteLayers、updateRoutesGL、drawRoutesSVG、drawMarkers、measureMarkerLabels、cameraAt、project 与对应 CSS。警示横幅、改道胶囊、错误路线与 X、改道路线、该时段标记标签，以及已完成的持续路线。片段：caseT 44.8→50.3；时长 6.2s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定镜头的实时地图，声音由 score.json 挂接。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：6.2s\n- **声音 voice**：blip、whoosh、error、glitch、clack、alarm、beep、stamp\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **警示**：0.2s\n- **错误终点**：1.5s\n- **改道**：2.2s\n- **时长**：6.2s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置警示、改道提示、路线与标签。\n- `依赖`：配置MapLibre 5.6.0、样式、图层与地图镜像。\n- `需要的数据`：设置警示轨道、错误路线、地图与横竖布局。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：44.8→50.3\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/alert-reroute/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/alert-reroute)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/analytic-motion-blur.md","title":"解析运动模糊","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 解析运动模糊\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-morph 原片 5.2–9.6 秒；mg-paperclip 原片 0–8.34 秒；总时长 12.74 秒。以快门区间的位置解析生成拖影：圆形生成胶囊轮廓与透明度坡，镜头运动使用仿射偏移采样和速度相关高斯模糊。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-morph 原片 5.2–9.6 秒；mg-paperclip 原片 0–8.34 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 12.74 秒。\n- **速度解析拖影**：L31: const qT = x => Math.round(x * FPS) / FPS, SH = 0.5 / FPS;；L607: const [R0, G0, B0] = hexRgb(col).map(v => Math.round(v * 255)), cs = a => `rgba(${R0},${G0},${B0},${a})`, ux = dx / L, uy = dy / L, T = L + 2 * r, am = Math.min(1, 2 * r / L), o1 = Math.min(2 * r, L) / T, an = Math.atan2(dy, dx);；L608: const gr = c.createLinearGradient(mx - ux * T / 2, my - uy * T / 2, mx + ux * T / 2, my + uy * T / 2);\n- **相机仿射快门**：L567: const camEl=document.getElementById('cam'),mbg=document.getElementById('mbg'),MBN=12,SH=.5,RM=1100,DL=SH/MBN;；L575: function camSigma(t){const{vx,vy,g}=camVel(t),k=.8*DL/4,vz=620*Math.abs(g);return[Math.hypot(vx*k,vz*k),Math.hypot(vy*k,vz*k)];}；L579: [-.375,-.125,.125,.375].forEach((f,k)=>{const h=f*DL;MO[k].setAttribute('dx',(h*vx).toFixed(3));MO[k].setAttribute('dy',(h*vy).toFixed(3));\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/analytic-motion-blur/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/analytic-motion-blur)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/anchor-pullback-phone.md","title":"锚点拉远显载体","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 锚点拉远显载体\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-paperclip 原片 6.8–8.2 秒；总时长 1.4 秒。以屏幕空间锚点约束两段拉远和旋转，先露局部屏幕，再揭示全部内容都在一部手机内。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-paperclip 原片 6.8–8.2 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 1.4 秒。\n- **锚点拉远显手机**：L79: const EASE={fly:eFly,pull:ePull,pullA:bez(.3,0,.1,1),pullB:bez(.42,0,.22,1),hold:u=>u*u*(3-u)/2};；L85: const z=Math.exp(lerp(Math.log(s.a.z),Math.log(s.b.z),e)),r=lerp(ra,rb,e)+(s.b.swing||0)*Math.sin(Math.PI*e);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/anchor-pullback-phone/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/anchor-pullback-phone)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/bezier-aurora-drift.md","title":"贝塞尔极光漂移","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 贝塞尔极光漂移\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-aurora-glass 原片 0–10 秒；总时长 10 秒。邻近色椭圆光斑沿闭合贝塞尔轨道漂移，结合视差与非线性混色形成连续光场。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-aurora-glass 原片 0–10 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 10 秒。\n- **贝塞尔极光漂移**：L137: { col: PAL.violet, rx: 470, ry: 300, ang: 18, i: 1.15, path: loopBezier([[600, 300], [780, 240], [840, 420], [560, 460]], 30, 0.05) },；L139: { col: PAL.cyan, rx: 360, ry: 260, ang: 32, i: 1.0, path: loopBezier([[1500, 860], [1320, 700], [1160, 660], [1420, 980]], 26, 0.12) },；L813: blobs.set([p[0] - cam.x * 0.35, p[1] - cam.y * 0.35, b.rx, b.i], i * 4); blobE.set([b.ry, b.ang * D2R + 0.08 * Math.sin(t * 0.3 + i)], i * 2);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/bezier-aurora-drift/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/bezier-aurora-drift)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/blueprint-tile-drop-wave.md","title":"蓝图落块波","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 蓝图落块波\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用等距 2.5D 来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 重放原片0–2.1秒，时长2.1秒。蓝图先从中心扩开，六个地块环按0.25、0.5、0.75、1、1.25、1.5秒落位；ring=max(abs(dx),abs(dz))-.5，tl=ringT[ring]+ang*.07+(R()-.5)*.02，R=A.rng(7)。保留倾斜落块 A.drop(T-t.tl,.3,2.2,t.rot0,.075)、触地压扁与两次微回弹，木质点击和环音符与画面共用时间。保留原作模型、材质、字体和同区间音轨，1920×1080、30fps，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **地块环**：rings=[0.25,0.5,0.75,1.0,1.25,1.5]；ring=max(abs(dx),abs(dz))-.5。\n- **错峰**：tl=ringT[ring]+ang*.07+(R()-.5)*.02；R=A.rng(7)。\n- **落块**：rot0=-(1.25+R()*.3)；A.drop(T-t.tl,.3,2.2,t.rot0,.075)。\n- **触地**：b1=.16，b2=.1；第二次回跳幅度为第一次*.3；sy=1-.3*exp(-tau/.05)*cos(tau*40)。\n- **时长**：2.1s；原片0–2.1s。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/blueprint-tile-drop-wave/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/blueprint-tile-drop-wave)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/boot-typing.md","title":"终端逐字开机序列","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 终端逐字开机序列\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n实现当前案例的约 21.92 秒终端开场：直接复用 bootMotion、bootLogoTrack、扫描轨道、BootSequence 与字形。以 floor((t+5)×25+0.00001) 取原片帧，权限帧 170–187 依 1,1,3,4,5,6,9,11,12,14,17,18,19,20,22,23,25,26 揭字；标志使用帧 229–264 的同一条轮廓前后端与 0.25→26 线宽，保留 RHINE·LAB。身份帧 282–339 保留 ID CONFIRMED : JOYCE MOORE；随后 REQUEST RECEIVED、START PROCESSING 及 449/453/457 帧的省略号，再在 14.48 秒进入扫描、17.76 秒进入欢迎。声音引用 ../../cases/archive-os/audio/film-audio.ogg，仅播放 0–21.92 秒，默认关闭。字体引用 ../../cases/archive-os/film/app/fonts/；render(t) 可任意 seek；减少动态时停在 20.5 秒欢迎画面。 在原有 21.92 秒之后依次重放mg-hud 原片 0.2–2.4 秒；mg-hud 原片 7.05–8.7 秒；全部重放总时长 25.77 秒。HUD 以字符速率增加可见子串，坐标使用34字符每秒，末尾方块光标按2.5Hz闪烁。参数沿用：export function typed(t, t0, str, cps = 90) {\n  return str.slice(0, Math.floor((t - t0) * cps + 1e-6));\n  const ty = typed(t, K.coords, coord, 34);\n    if (blink(t, 2.5) || ty.length < coord.length) T('█', CX - cw / 2 + TW(ty, { s: 26, w: 500, ls: 2 }) + 6, CY + hh + 63, { s: 22, c: CYA });\n原有段的画面和时序保持原样，新增段沿用同区间原片音轨，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 视频生成 Prompt\n\n制作 21.92 秒、25fps 帧表驱动的 RHINE LAB 开场。1.8 秒逐字出现 ACCESS PERMISSION REQUIRED，4.16 秒起沿一条共享轮廓描绘标志并移动，6.28 秒起确认 JOYCE MOORE 身份，9.68 秒起请求、11.92 秒起处理，14.48 秒扫描、17.76 秒欢迎，21.56 秒开始缩小失焦并于 21.92 秒结束。字形、材质色彩、轮廓轨迹与声音均使用当前 archive-os 文件。\n\n## 负向约束\n\n不要双独立圆环，不要均匀每字间隔，不要 LUMEN、K. ARLEN 或 ANALYSIS OS 请求文案，不要方波替代逐字采样，不要添加块状闪烁光标或 180ms 反色闪，不要跨目录依赖案例。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **权限**：1.8s 开始，2.48s 揭完；4.08s 隐藏\n- **标志**：4.16s 显示；帧 229–264 沿单轮廓描绘，随后移向左侧\n- **身份**：6.28–8.56s；请求 9.68–10.56s；处理 11.92–13.28s\n- **扫描与欢迎**：14.48s 扫描；17.76s 欢迎；21.56–21.92s 缩小、失焦并淡出\n- **总时长**：25.77 秒\n- **日志逐字光标参数**：export function typed(t, t0, str, cps = 90) {\n  return str.slice(0, Math.floor((t - t0) * cps + 1e-6));\n  const ty = typed(t, K.coords, coord, 34);\n    if (blink(t, 2.5) || ty.length < coord.length) T('█', CX - cw / 2 + TW(ty, { s: 26, w: 500, ls: 2 }) + 6, CY + hh + 63, { s: 22, c: CYA });\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/boot-typing/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/boot-typing)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/capsule-sweep-lift.md","title":"扫浪托起字母","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 扫浪托起字母\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-3d-render 原片 0–4.3 秒；总时长 4.3 秒。扫波到达胶囊阵列 → 高斯波包同步驱动胶囊高度、倾斜与着色，反向扫波按阅读顺序托起字母。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：((0.34, -0.94), 0.12, 3.4, 0.80, 0.26, 1.0, (-1.8 + V5_DX, 0.2))\n(tuple(CS_D), CS_TM, CS_SP, 0.75, 0.10, 0.55, (0.0, 0.0))\nV_LIFT = 1.55。使用 1920×1080 横屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-3d-render 原片 0–4.3 秒；1 倍速，总时长 4.3 秒。\n- **扫浪托起字母**：((0.34, -0.94), 0.12, 3.4, 0.80, 0.26, 1.0, (-1.8 + V5_DX, 0.2))\n(tuple(CS_D), CS_TM, CS_SP, 0.75, 0.10, 0.55, (0.0, 0.0))\nV_LIFT = 1.55\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/capsule-sweep-lift/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/capsule-sweep-lift)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/card-depth-arrival-parting.md","title":"卡片穿焦起落","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 卡片穿焦起落\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-aurora-glass 原片 0–8.8 秒；总时长 8.8 秒。卡片从纵深与下方倾斜进入并衰减回摆，浮动后沿独立轴向退开，失焦先于离场。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-aurora-glass 原片 0–8.8 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 8.8 秒。\n- **卡片穿焦起落**：L472: const tilt = 20 * Math.exp(-3.2 * tau) * Math.cos(3.6 * tau);；L475: let y = c.base[1] + 70 * (1 - e) + fl[0] + c.drift[1] * eo;；L476: let z = c.base[2] + 560 * (1 - e) + c.drift[2] * eo;；L506: const defocus = 0.5 + 16 * dfk;\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/card-depth-arrival-parting/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/card-depth-arrival-parting)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/card-expand-fullscreen.md","title":"卡片展开为全屏","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 卡片展开为全屏\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n照片卡片由引线牵出，展开到全屏停留，再收回原位。复用地图巡礼的 drawCards、drawLeader、drawMarkers、measureMarkerLabels、mountScene、sceneCanvas、paintScene 与对应 CSS。inari 标记、引线、照片卡片、全屏展开与收回。片段：caseT 18.4→24.6；时长 6.6s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定底图与屏幕锚点，声音由 score.json 挂接。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：6.6s\n- **声音 voice**：shutter、paper、whoosh、impact\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **出卡**：0s\n- **展开**：2.6s\n- **收回**：5.4s\n- **时长**：6.6s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置卡片、引线、场景绘制与镜头。\n- `依赖`：配置舞台、时间轴、预加载、声音、横竖布局、颗粒与暗角。\n- `需要的数据`：设置20.4s底图锚点、鸟居照片、卡片与展开轨道、横竖布局。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：18.4→24.6\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/card-expand-fullscreen/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/card-expand-fullscreen)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/cel-line-boil.md","title":"逐张重画：线条沸腾与换纸","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 逐张重画：线条沸腾与换纸\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 重放0–10秒，全长12.701秒。保留24fps的SCHED曝光表，在一拍一、一拍二和一拍三之间切换；静态形体以D.id%4循环线稿，三帧曝光以D.id%3循环。沿用boil的amp=2.4、scale=70与z=seed*2.371+0.5；纸齿按同一绘制编号从470×310范围取偏移，以multiply、alpha=0.5合成；尘点以v%4轮换、alpha=0.22叠加并翻转。沿用原画面、字体、纸纹和同区间成品音轨，保持1920×1080、24fps，声音默认关闭。 按 index.html 内联 segments 在原有 10 秒之后重放mg-hanazi 原片 1.3–1.834 秒；mg-hanazi 原片 5.8–7.967 秒，总时长 12.701 秒。综艺片按帧号替换照片贴图边缘，以耳朵四帧扭动和三张炸毛轮换形成动作。画面与音轨沿用同一映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **曝光表**：SCHED=[[0,8,2],[8,24,1],[24,48,2],[48,60,1],[60,108,2],[108,120,3],[120,132,2],[132,168,1],[168,224,2],[224,230,1],[230,240,3]]；24fps。\n- **线稿变体**：bv=(D)=>(D.step===3?D.id%3:D.id%4)；boil(pts,seed,amp=2.4,scale=70)；z=seed*2.371+0.5。\n- **纸齿换位**：ox=floor(hs(v,51)*470)；oy=floor(hs(v,52)*310)；globalCompositeOperation=multiply；globalAlpha=0.5。\n- **尘点轮换**：IMG.dust[v%4]；globalAlpha=0.22；按v%2、v%3翻转。\n- **重放时长**：原片0–10秒，巧思总时长12.701秒。\n- **追加原片区间**：mg-hanazi 原片 1.3–1.834 秒；mg-hanazi 原片 5.8–7.967 秒；['e11', 'e16', 'e11', 'e6'][ef]\nconst pick = fm >= 0 && fm < 2 ? 'hL135' : (fm >= 2 && fm < 4) || (fd >= 2 && fd < 4) ? 'hL12' : fd < 2 ? 'hL06' : 'hB' + (Math.floor(tt * 12) % 3);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/cel-line-boil/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/cel-line-boil)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/center-out-tracking-in.md","title":"中轴散字收拢","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 中轴散字收拢\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 以1倍速重放原片8.133–9.85秒，巧思时长1.717秒。字标入场节点到达后，字母按离中轴的距离错峰，从宽字距向最终位置收拢显现；标语随后抬入，两侧细线由亮点领绘向外展开。const word = 'ATELIER LINEA', size = 50, track = 0.46;start: 8.333；stagger: 0.045；dur: 0.95；const d = Math.abs(i - mid);const spread = (1 - e) * 0.22 * size * (i - mid);tagline: 8.75；rules: [9.25, 9.6]；hl = 24 * ru；gap = 1.2 * ts。沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、30fps；画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：8.133–9.85秒，1倍速；巧思时长1.717秒。\n- **字标尺寸字距**：const word = 'ATELIER LINEA', size = 50, track = 0.46;\n- **由中轴错峰**：start: 8.333；stagger: 0.045；dur: 0.95；const d = Math.abs(i - mid);\n- **字母收拢**：const spread = (1 - e) * 0.22 * size * (i - mid);\n- **标语与签章**：tagline: 8.75；rules: [9.25, 9.6]；hl = 24 * ru；gap = 1.2 * ts。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/center-out-tracking-in/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/center-out-tracking-in)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/chapter-frame.md","title":"章节主题：标签、强调色与四角框线","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 章节主题：标签、强调色与四角框线\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n章节标签配框线或胶带网点入场，为一段旅程划出章节。复用地图巡礼的 drawChapter、applyStaticLayout 与对应 CSS。drawChapter 的章节标签、框线、四角方块、胶带与网点。片段：caseT 24.2→25.85；caseT 33→33.8；caseT 40.6→44.8；重放总时长 9.45s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定底图与屏幕锚点，声音由 score.json 挂接。 在原有 7.05 秒之后依次重放mg-hud 原片 0–2.4 秒；全部重放总时长 9.45 秒。HUD 的边框、外环、刻度、面板和地球按开机节点错时描出，日志按同一层级依次上线。参数沿用：  \"boot\": {\n    \"frame\": 0.12,\n    \"ring_outer\": 0.4,\n    \"ring_ticks\": 0.55,\n    \"ring_inner\": 0.7,\n    \"panel_left\": 0.9,\n    \"panel_right\": 1.15,\n    \"hex\": 1.2,\n    \"globe\": 1.4,\n    \"log_lines\": [\n      0.4,\n      0.9,\n      1.4,\n      1.9\n  const p1 = E.outC(prog(t, K.boot.ring_outer, 0.5));\n  v.uT.value = t; v.uFrame.value = f; v.uOpen.value = E.outC(prog(t, 0.0, 0.3)); v.uGlitch.value = glitch(t);\n原有段的画面和时序保持原样，新增段沿用同区间原片音轨，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：9.45 秒\n- **声音 voice**：bell、confirm\n- **分层描线开机参数**：  \"boot\": {\n    \"frame\": 0.12,\n    \"ring_outer\": 0.4,\n    \"ring_ticks\": 0.55,\n    \"ring_inner\": 0.7,\n    \"panel_left\": 0.9,\n    \"panel_right\": 1.15,\n    \"hex\": 1.2,\n    \"globe\": 1.4,\n    \"log_lines\": [\n      0.4,\n      0.9,\n      1.4,\n      1.9\n  const p1 = E.outC(prog(t, K.boot.ring_outer, 0.5));\n  v.uT.value = t; v.uFrame.value = f; v.uOpen.value = E.outC(prog(t, 0.0, 0.3)); v.uGlitch.value = glitch(t);\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **鸭川框线入场**：0s\n- **框线退场**：1.65s\n- **奈良胶带与网点**：2.45s\n- **时长**：7.05s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置章节标签、标题、框线与胶带。\n- `依赖`：配置舞台、时间轴、预加载、声音、横竖布局、颗粒与暗角。\n- `需要的数据`：设置章节轨道、标题、配色、装饰与横竖布局。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：24.2→25.85/33→33.8/40.6→44.8\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/chapter-frame/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/chapter-frame)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/collect-counter.md","title":"收集计数徽章与收集物托盘","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 收集计数徽章与收集物托盘\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n每到一站计数滚动加一，印章落进托盘，步进器同步前进。复用地图巡礼的 drawHud、stepAtX、ruleX、stampXY 与对应 CSS。MIKAN 徽章、收集计数、印章托盘与 drawHud 的步进器。片段：caseT 8.1→8.9；caseT 12.6→14；caseT 19.2→20.4；caseT 41.8→43；caseT 51.2→52.6；时长 9.533s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定底图与屏幕锚点，声音由 score.json 挂接。 通过 index.html 内联 segments 在前 6.6 秒之后依次重放mg-paperclip 原片 3.1–4.7 秒，总时长 9.533 秒。手机科普片按斜向种子次序点亮余下格子，数字统计当前已亮格数，并在整十及终值处回弹。沿用同区间原片音轨，声音默认关闭。 按 index.html 内联 segments 在原有 8.2 秒之后重放mg-hanazi 原片 1.367–2.7 秒，总时长 9.533 秒。综艺片将三格快乐电池依次充满，满电时弹出闪电、放射标记并轻推照片。画面与音轨沿用同一映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：9.533s\n- **声音 voice**：confirm、stamp、sparkle\n- **点亮级联同步计数**：L222: const R1=rng(19);const rest=[...USED.keys()].filter(Z=>!FIRST.includes(Z)).map(Z=>{const[r,c]=rc(Z);return{Z,k:c+.45*r+R1()*2.2};}).sort((a,b)=>a.k-b.k).map(o=>o.Z);；L224: rest.forEach((Z,i)=>litT.set(Z,lerp(EV.cascade[0],EV.cascade[1],1-Math.cbrt(1-(i+1)/rest.length))));；L260: if(o.lt!=null&&t>=o.lt){lit++;const q=P(t,o.lt,.16);const w=wob(t-o.lt,5,12);s*=1+.16*(1-q)*(o.lt===EV.first_lit?.94:1)+.02*w*(o.lt===EV.first_lit?2:1);\n- **追加原片区间**：mg-hanazi 原片 1.367–2.7 秒；const k = spring(ub, .5, 28); X(b, -54 + j * 52, 29 - 29 * k, 0, 1, k);\nconst h = addK(hand(t, 1, .8), kick(t, C.charge[2], 7, 12, 14))\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **徽章出现**：0s\n- **×1 + 关空**：0.8s\n- **×2 + 京都**：2.2s\n- **×3 + 奈良**：3.4s\n- **×4 + 大阪**：4.6s\n- **时长**：8.2s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置计数、徽章、收集物托盘（来源为车站印章）与回弹。\n- `依赖`：配置舞台、时间轴、预加载、声音、横竖布局、颗粒与暗角。\n- `需要的数据`：设置计数与收集事件（来源为车站印章）、镜头和横竖布局。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：8.1→8.9/12.6→14/19.2→20.4/41.8→43/51.2→52.6\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/collect-counter/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/collect-counter)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/continuous-line-narrative.md","title":"一线连续成景","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 一线连续成景\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 以1倍速重放原片0–7.7秒，巧思时长7.7秒。描绘进度沿同一条连续路径推进，上一形象的尾线接成下一形象；枝端卷须保留路径点序，展开为水平屋梁后接入建筑。const STEP = 0.5; const CHUNK = 12;const tauOfT = monotone(DK.map((k) => k[0]), DK.map((k) => markerTau(k[1])), 1.3, 0);2.063–2.223秒；MX[i] = 358 + (S[i] - pieceStart.tendril); const MORPH = cues.morph; cubicBezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1)。7.5秒到达 arch>，连续线完成圆环与拱门。沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、30fps；画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：0–7.7秒，1倍速；巧思时长7.7秒。\n- **路径采样**：const STEP = 0.5; const CHUNK = 12;\n- **描绘进度**：const tauOfT = monotone(DK.map((k) => k[0]), DK.map((k) => markerTau(k[1])), 1.3, 0);\n- **卷须成梁**：2.063–2.223秒；MX[i] = 358 + (S[i] - pieceStart.tendril); const MORPH = cues.morph; cubicBezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1)。\n- **闭合节点**：7.5秒到达 arch>，连续线完成圆环与拱门。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/continuous-line-narrative/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/continuous-line-narrative)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/core-ignition-wave.md","title":"核心激活全城","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 核心激活全城\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用等距 2.5D 来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，重放原片5.7–7.35秒，时长1.65秒。核心在5.90–5.967秒下蹲蓄力，Y缩6%、XZ扩3%，镜头缩小2%、曝光压低.15EV。PULSE_T=cues.drop-.015，drop=6，PULSE_V=15，PULSE_R0=1；按r=max(abs(x),abs(z))的切比雪夫距离传播方形波。空地以FLIP_D=5/30和Math.PI*A.easeOutBack(u,1.4)翻到彩色面，载物地块由顶点着色器携模型跳起.25*y，建筑沿立面扫描着色。核心冲量exp(-(T-PULSE_T)*6)*cos((T-PULSE_T)*26)*.07，镜头两帧冲近6%后.4秒回定，主拍曝光+.3EV衰减；保留光柱、光环、冲击和扫过音。1920×1080、30fps，画面和原片同区间音轨使用同一时间映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **预备**：A.smooth(A.inv(5.90,5.967,T))；核心Y-6%、XZ+3%；镜头缩小2%；曝光-0.15EV。\n- **波前**：PULSE_T=cues.drop-.015；drop=6；PULSE_V=15；PULSE_R0=1；r=max(abs(x),abs(z))。\n- **地块翻面**：FLIP_D=5/30；Math.PI*A.easeOutBack(u,1.4)；中段抬升.15*sin(πu)。\n- **核心冲量**：exp(-(T-PULSE_T)*6)*cos((T-PULSE_T)*26)*.07；载物顶点波抬升.25*y。\n- **镜头与曝光**：镜头2帧冲近6%，.4秒easeOutExpo回定；曝光主击+.3EV，exp(-max(0,t-drop)*30)衰减。\n- **时长**：1.65s；原片5.7–7.35s。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/core-ignition-wave/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/core-ignition-wave)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/corner-hud.md","title":"四角信息 HUD","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 四角信息 HUD\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n日序、坐标、时钟、歌词与步进器钉在四角，数值随镜头与时间持续更新，中央留给地图。复用地图巡礼的 drawHud、cameraAt、clockAt、stepAtX、ruleX 与对应 CSS。仅 drawHud 的日序、日期、规尺、指南针、坐标、海拔、缩放、时钟、歌词、步进器、比例尺和署名。片段：caseT 7→13.6；caseT 35.8→42.4；时长 13.8s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定底图与屏幕锚点，声音由 score.json 挂接。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：13.8s\n- **声音 voice**：click、kick、sub\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **顶部 HUD 入场**：0s\n- **跨天**：6.6s\n- **时长**：13.8s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置镜头、时钟、步进器与规尺函数。\n- `依赖`：配置舞台、时间轴、预加载、声音、横竖布局、颗粒与暗角。\n- `需要的数据`：设置日序、日期、进度、歌词、步进器与横竖布局。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：7→13.6/35.8→42.4\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/corner-hud/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/corner-hud)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/crt-boot-shell.md","title":"显像管开机与屏幕外壳","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 显像管开机与屏幕外壳\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n调用来源 PIXEL QUEST 的 renderAt(t) 重放显像管开机与屏幕外壳，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 以 1 倍速播放原片 0–10 秒，画面和同一区间音轨保持原作，声音默认关闭。输出 1920×1080、30fps。开机前 6 帧纵比例依次为 [0.012,0.007,0.006,0.034,0.334,1]，横比例首帧 0.018、之后为 1；f6 用 8/180 纵向循环偏移；f7–10 用 [1,-0.75,0.5,-0.25] 的 wob 控制奇偶行反向横摆和 RGB 增益 (1+0.05*wob,1,1-0.05*wob)。保留 k=0.03 的桶形采样、0.0022/0.004 边缘遮罩、以 mix(0.30,0.47,lum) 调宽的扫描线，以及两圈八方向、半径 1.6/3.4 的磷光邻域采样。继续使用原作 LINEAR 纹理过滤与 GLSL sharp 函数，使用横屏、时间定位、播放暂停与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：0–10 秒，1 倍速；输出 1920×1080、30fps\n- **亮点展屏**：前 6 帧纵比例 [0.012,0.007,0.006,0.034,0.334,1]；横比例首帧 0.018，之后为 1\n- **纵向滚屏**：f6，即 0.2 秒，uRoll=8/180；边缘压暗 smoothstep 宽度 0.012\n- **交错行摆**：f7–10 的 wob 为 [1,-0.75,0.5,-0.25]；奇偶行反向位移 wob/uSrc.x；RGB 增益 (1+0.05*wob,1,1-0.05*wob)\n- **桶形与边缘**：k=0.03，cc=c*(1+k*dot(c,c))/(1+k)；横纵边缘阈值 0.0022、0.004\n- **扫描线**：亮度权重 (0.3,0.59,0.11)，宽度 mix(0.30,0.47,lum)，强度 0.64–1，输出色乘 1.10\n- **磷光辉光**：两圈各 8 方向，角步 0.785398，半径 1.6、3.4 源像素，第二圈权重 0.6，归一化除 12.8，再用 max(g-0.30,0)*0.55\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/crt-boot-shell/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/crt-boot-shell)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/crt-line-dot-shutdown.md","title":"显像管线点收屏","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 显像管线点收屏\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-synthwave 原片 9.467–9.966666667 秒；mg-hud 原片 9.5667–9.966666667 秒；总时长 0.899633333 秒。整幅画面先沿纵向压成水平亮线，再沿横向缩成磷光点并熄灭。参数保持原作数值：  if (fr >= st) return CUES.stop + (Math.floor(fr / 2) * 2 - st) / FPS * .5;           // STOP: tape winds down\nconst CRT = { 295: [1, .30, .25, 0], 296: [1, .0019, 1, .030], 297: [.26, .0019, 1.1, .022], 298: [.0073, .013, 1.3, .036], 299: [.0055, .010, .35, .012] };\n    col += vec3(1., .92, .98) * uCrtG * exp(-ly*ly / 1.1) * exp(-lx*lx / 5.);                 // the hot line / dot\n  bloom.radius = 0.45 - (t >= LOCK ? 0.2 * Math.exp(-(t - LOCK) * 4) : 0); v.uClose.value = prog(t, 9.7667, 0.2);\n  float cz = uClose, csy = 1.0, csx = 1.0;\n  if (cz > 0.0) { csy = max(pow(1.0 - min(cz / 0.6, 1.0), 2.2), 0.003); csx = cz > 0.6 ? max(1.0 - (cz - 0.6) / 0.4, 0.0) : 1.0; }\n  vec2 uv = cz > 0.0 ? vec2(0.5 + (vUv.x - 0.5) / max(csx, 1e-3), 0.5 + (vUv.y - 0.5) / csy) : vUv; float g = uGlitch;\n  // micro-glitch: horizontal slice displacement (seeded per frame)\n  float bnd = floor(uv.y * 54.0), hb = h11(bnd * 1.7 + uFrame * 13.1);\n  float sl = step(1.0 - 0.22 * g, hb);\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-synthwave 原片 9.467–9.966666667 秒；mg-hud 原片 9.5667–9.966666667 秒；1 倍速，总时长 0.899633333 秒。\n- **显像管线点收屏参数**：  if (fr >= st) return CUES.stop + (Math.floor(fr / 2) * 2 - st) / FPS * .5;           // STOP: tape winds down\nconst CRT = { 295: [1, .30, .25, 0], 296: [1, .0019, 1, .030], 297: [.26, .0019, 1.1, .022], 298: [.0073, .013, 1.3, .036], 299: [.0055, .010, .35, .012] };\n    col += vec3(1., .92, .98) * uCrtG * exp(-ly*ly / 1.1) * exp(-lx*lx / 5.);                 // the hot line / dot\n- **全息屏线点关机参数**：  bloom.radius = 0.45 - (t >= LOCK ? 0.2 * Math.exp(-(t - LOCK) * 4) : 0); v.uClose.value = prog(t, 9.7667, 0.2);\n  float cz = uClose, csy = 1.0, csx = 1.0;\n  if (cz > 0.0) { csy = max(pow(1.0 - min(cz / 0.6, 1.0), 2.2), 0.003); csx = cz > 0.6 ? max(1.0 - (cz - 0.6) / 0.4, 0.0) : 1.0; }\n  vec2 uv = cz > 0.0 ? vec2(0.5 + (vUv.x - 0.5) / max(csx, 1e-3), 0.5 + (vUv.y - 0.5) / csy) : vUv; float g = uGlitch;\n  // micro-glitch: horizontal slice displacement (seeded per frame)\n  float bnd = floor(uv.y * 54.0), hb = h11(bnd * 1.7 + uFrame * 13.1);\n  float sl = step(1.0 - 0.22 * g, hb);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/crt-line-dot-shutdown/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/crt-line-dot-shutdown)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/cutout-arc-flight-flutter.md","title":"剪影弧线飞出","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 剪影弧线飞出\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-collage 原片 4.46–7.7 秒；总时长 3.24 秒。地球、鹰或蝴蝶 cue 到达 → 剪影沿二次曲线飞出并落位，按物件叠加落地压扁、俯冲或双姿势振翅。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：const fl = 6, u = clamp(k / fl), e = eOut(u);\nif (it.mode === 'swoop' && Math.floor(tl * 6 + 1e-4) % 2) { sy = 0.74; skx = -0.12; r += 3 * DEG; }\nif (it.mode === 'flutter') sx = k < fl ? [1, 0.35][K(tl) % 2] : [1, 0.58][Math.floor(tl * 6 + 1e-4) % 2];。使用 1920×1080 横屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-collage 原片 4.46–7.7 秒；1 倍速，总时长 3.24 秒。\n- **弧线飞出振翅**：const fl = 6, u = clamp(k / fl), e = eOut(u);\nif (it.mode === 'swoop' && Math.floor(tl * 6 + 1e-4) % 2) { sy = 0.74; skx = -0.12; r += 3 * DEG; }\nif (it.mode === 'flutter') sx = k < fl ? [1, 0.35][K(tl) % 2] : [1, 0.58][Math.floor(tl * 6 + 1e-4) % 2];\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/cutout-arc-flight-flutter/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/cutout-arc-flight-flutter)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/day-night-flip.md","title":"昼夜翻转：逐层插值","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 昼夜翻转：逐层插值\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n地图配色与 HUD 强调色一起在昼夜之间过渡，交代时间的流逝。复用地图巡礼的 dayNight、valueAt、cameraAt、drawHud、clockAt、classify、setPaint 与对应 CSS。地图、3D 建筑、HUD 与案例暖色 wash；镜头固定为案例 34.5s，HUD 与昼夜值按 caseT 31.3→35.8、36.6→39.1 求值。片段：caseT 31.3→35.8；caseT 36.6→39.1；固定镜头 caseT 34.5，全部 HUD 按片段求值；时长 7s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定镜头的实时地图，声音由 score.json 挂接。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：7s\n- **声音 voice**：whoosh、sub、reverse、chime\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **白天**：0s\n- **入夜**：1.5s\n- **天亮**：4.5s\n- **时长**：7s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置昼夜配色、镜头、时钟与HUD。\n- `依赖`：配置MapLibre 5.6.0、样式、图层与地图镜像。\n- `需要的数据`：设置昼夜、镜头、时钟、HUD；镜头固定在34.5s。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：31.3→35.8/36.6→39.1/镜头34.5，全部 HUD 按片段求值\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/day-night-flip/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/day-night-flip)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/decrypt-reveal.md","title":"对角解密与磨砂转清","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 对角解密与磨砂转清\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n从当前archive-os裁出单档案解密。引用../../cases/archive-os/film/app/中的archive-cassette.glb与MiSans字体，保留CardAppearance/glass-reveal/internal-optics和decryption/document-decryption/inspection-overlay源模块，保持案例GLB各层材质、照明和长焦详情投影。进入detail后等待detail>0.78且lift>3.3，再以速率1.5播放参考时间34.12→39.56秒，物理解密总长3.6267秒。一条模型空间对角线从[-1.6,0.5]到[1.98,3.24]，34.24→36.04秒两端接通、37.72→38.84秒收束，按源文件测量结点做单调Hermite插值，保留四角标与中心点。38.84→39.56秒高度相关着色器把Frosted_Polymer粗糙度0.42转0.025。正文读取X-001当前莱茵生命/RHINE LAB、Kristen Wright/Saria及摘要；用Range.getClientRects测量实际折行，每行覆盖装饰黑条，clarity>0才启动0.95秒揭示：delay=order/(count−1)×0.22，行进度=(progress−delay)/0.78，自定义加减速后translateX至101%。Demo以当前阵列待机10秒的状态为起点，按源lift临界阻尼速率4.2、detail指数速率2.8及相机速率5在60Hz推导到解密门槛，保留当时的位置与速度，再从正式解密起点展示，保留5.2秒时间轴容纳正文尾部；该物理解密段本身不另触发声音，开档声发生在此前输入阶段，声音默认关闭。可调项集中index.html顶部CONFIG，异步加载资源后render(t)按t直接求帧，减少动态直接显示完成态。出处：demos/cases/archive-os/source/rhinelabui/src/scene.ts:341–405,1434–1439；decryption.ts:3–103,148–175；document-decryption.ts:25–95。\n\n## 视频生成 Prompt\n\n暖灰底的长焦档案特写，使用当前archive-os的GLB档案真实玻璃、内构件与RHINE LAB标签。只保留一条模型平面对角线与四角标：从两端接通、保持、向中心收束。整个物理解密3.6267秒，最后0.48秒磨砂玻璃自上而下转清。右侧X-001档案正文依实际折行覆盖黑条，玻璃开始转清才以0.95秒顺序向右移开。保持材质、测量曲线与文案，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 负向约束\n\n不要双交叉X线、SVG假玻璃、CSS模糊盖层、整块scaleX黑条、均匀80毫秒错峰、旧LUMEN文案、提前露字、回弹或自造解密音效；不要引用cases目录或把整个案例嵌入巧思。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **对角线**：参考34.24→36.04秒接通，36.04→37.72秒保持，37.72→38.84秒收束；互动时间分别约1.2秒、1.12秒、0.7467秒，使用测量结点的单调三次Hermite插值\n- **转清**：参考38.84→39.56秒，互动时间约0.48秒；总物理解密约3.6267秒\n- **遮挡条**：只在玻璃clarity>0后开始；总长0.95秒，按DOM实际折行分配0→0.22的进度延迟，每行占0.78进度\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/decrypt-reveal/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/decrypt-reveal)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/dot-drop-wordmark.md","title":"圆点落字成标","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 圆点落字成标\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 重放柱条接字干、圆点升空悬停与落字。保留237/30–245/30秒的矩形形变，247→250帧的上升、250→251帧的悬停、251→255帧的下降；上升用 E.outQ，下降用 E.inQ。落字后按 abs(L.i-4) 帧延迟把10像素冲量传到各字母，保留1.22倍镜头推近、r60→1100的扩散环、持续5帧的六条放射线，以及9.000秒和9.500秒的回跳。沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、30fps；画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **柱条接字干**：237/30–245/30=7.900–8.167秒；源框x558…642、y170…460、rx24；p=E.ioC(inv(237/30,245/30,t))。\n- **字点升空与落字**：245/30–247/30=8.167–8.233秒蓄力；247→250帧上升，250→251帧悬停，251→255帧下降；AP.y=TIT.y-210；升段E.outQ，降段E.inQ。\n- **字干压缩**：stem=.12*kick(t,dl,3.5,.4)+.07*an-.05*kick(t,lau,4,.4)；sx=1+.5*stem，sy=1-stem；基线548。\n- **逐字冲量**：dip=10*kick(t,dl+F(abs(L.i-4)),3.2,.4)；字母基线WBASE+dip；每字延迟abs(i-4)/30秒。\n- **镜头推震**：下落push=.22*E.inC(inv(dotDrop,dotLand2,t))；落地后.22*(1-spring(t-dl,4.5,.48))；慢推1+.045*E.ioQ(inv(dl,10.4,t))。\n- **落字扩散环**：255/30=8.500秒起；r60→1100、线宽24、10帧。\n- **落字放射线**：角度-168/-128/-100/-80/-52/-12度；长度76/104/88/110/92/72；线宽14；持续5帧。\n- **按拍回跳**：270/30=9.000秒、285/30=9.500秒起；hop+=16*hump(E.outQ(inv(tb,tb+F(9),t)))。\n- **末次扩散环**：285/30=9.500秒起；r=DOT_R+14→DOT_R+170、线宽18、12帧。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/dot-drop-wordmark/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/dot-drop-wordmark)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/drip-ripple-glyph-reveal.md","title":"末滴涟漪显字","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 末滴涟漪显字\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-liquid 原片 6.9–9.7 秒；总时长 2.8 秒。末滴落地后涟漪从落点传播，标语字形按距落点的距离延迟显现、抬入并去模糊。参数保持原作数值：  const hero = { x: (x0r + x1r) / 2, y: pyBest - 6, rMax: 25, tLand: cues.drip_land };\n        S.rip = { x: hero.x, y: FY, age: tl, amp: 1 };\n          const tPass = 0.02 + Math.abs(cx - rip.x) / 2000 + li * 0.06;   // r2: wave spreads outward from the splash, done in ~0.5 s\n          a = smooth(k); dy = 8 * (1 - flung(k)); blur = 4 * (1 - smooth(inv(0, 0.7, k)));\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-liquid 原片 6.9–9.7 秒；1 倍速，总时长 2.8 秒。\n- **末滴涟漪显字参数**：  const hero = { x: (x0r + x1r) / 2, y: pyBest - 6, rMax: 25, tLand: cues.drip_land };\n        S.rip = { x: hero.x, y: FY, age: tl, amp: 1 };\n          const tPass = 0.02 + Math.abs(cx - rip.x) / 2000 + li * 0.06;   // r2: wave spreads outward from the splash, done in ~0.5 s\n          a = smooth(k); dy = 8 * (1 - flung(k)); blur = 4 * (1 - smooth(inv(0, 0.7, k)));\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/drip-ripple-glyph-reveal/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/drip-ripple-glyph-reveal)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/element-flight-regroup.md","title":"同物飞排重组","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 同物飞排重组\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-paperclip 原片 2.54–6.44 秒；总时长 3.9 秒。同一元素在信息结构之间飞行换位：标签徽章飞入周期表格子，格子飞排成单位柱图，稀土柱条压成标签飞到产地地图。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-paperclip 原片 2.54–6.44 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 3.9 秒。\n- **徽章飞入周期表**：L234: const o={d,b1:d.children[0],b2:d.children[1],nm:d.children[2],zn:d.children[3],S:[sx,sy],T:[tx+TS/2,ty+TS/2],pk:EV.badge_peel+.012*k,ts:EV.badge_peel+.083+.011*k,ld:EV.badge_land[k],sg:k%2?1:-1,amp:60+(k*37)%70,rr:(k%2?-1:1)*(5+(k*13)%5)};；L236: const eIO=u=>u<.5?4*u*u*u:1-Math.pow(-2*u+2,3)/2, S0=62/104, eBd=bez(.55,0,.3,1);\n- **元素飞排单位柱图**：L270: const DX=300,DY=3860,RP=150,CW=60,CH=72,CPX=66;；L287: chips.push({Z,ci,j,d,b:d.querySelector('b'),fx:x,fy:y,tx:DX+j*CPX,ty:c.slotY,tl,t0:EV.chips[0]+j*EV.chip_stagger[0]+ROWO.indexOf(ci)*EV.chip_stagger[1],col:c.k==='re'?OR:INK});ord++;}));；L289: const chipPos=(o,t)=>{const u=P(t,o.t0,EV.chip_flight),e=ioS2(u),arc=Math.sin(Math.PI*e);return{u,e,arc,x:lerp(o.fx,o.tx,e)+arc*(o.ci-2)*40,y:lerp(o.fy,o.ty,e)-arc*30};};\n- **稀土柱条压成标签**：L365: U.push((t,C,W)=>{const[s0,s1,s2]=EV.re_pill;；L371: const lag=.12*oC(P(t,s0,s1-s0)),CL=cam(t-lag),WL=worldM(t-lag,CL),A=mapW(WL.m,BC[0],BC[1]),kA=CL.z*WL.ls;；L374: const X=lerp(A[0],B[0],e)+nx*arc*110,Y=lerp(A[1],B[1],e)+ny*arc*110,k=Math.exp(lerp(Math.log(kA),Math.log(kB),e))*(1+.12*oC(e));\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/element-flight-regroup/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/element-flight-regroup)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/envelope-radiating-waveform.md","title":"音量包络放射声波","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 音量包络放射声波\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-aurora-glass 原片 0.25–7.2 秒；总时长 6.95 秒。从发光球向两侧按距离延迟读取配乐的 100Hz 音量包络，条高随包络变化，球核同步呼吸。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-aurora-glass 原片 0.25–7.2 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 6.95 秒。\n- **音量包络放射声波**：L364: const OX = q('orbx', 178), cy = 122, maxH = 80, bw = 6, step = 11.5;；L367: const tt = t - dist * 0.0042;；L371: const h = Math.max(5, maxH * on * (0.1 + 0.9 * Math.pow(e, 0.75) * shape * jitter));\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/envelope-radiating-waveform/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/envelope-radiating-waveform)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/explode-parts-leaders.md","title":"拆件引线联动","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 拆件引线联动\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-paperclip 原片 0.98–2.6 秒；总时长 1.62 秒。部件从手机位置沿弧线飞到分解位，引线从锚点生长，端点与双语标签依次展开。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-paperclip 原片 0.98–2.6 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 1.62 秒。\n- **拆件引线联动**：L169: p.land=EV.parts[i]; p.lt=EV.leaders[i];；L198: const x=lerp(src.x,p.x,e), y=lerp(src.y,p.y,e)-arc*60; const w=wob(t-p.land,4,9);；L202: const lu=P(t,p.lt,.28);p.line.setAttribute('stroke-dashoffset',1-oC(lu));\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/explode-parts-leaders/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/explode-parts-leaders)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/film-grain.md","title":"可复现的胶片颗粒与暗角","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 可复现的胶片颗粒与暗角\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n动态胶片颗粒与暗角覆盖地图、照片和插画，统一整片的质感。复用地图巡礼的 render、sceneCanvas、paintScene、grainPass、vignette 与对应 CSS。地图、kix 照片画布与回忆插画三段全屏底，以及案例颗粒和暗角。片段：地图固定 caseT 10.4；kix 照片画布固定 caseT 13.5；回忆插画画布固定 caseT 27.56；时长 67.5s：原有三段 7.5s，之后接几何包豪斯全片 10s，再接线条艺术全片 10s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定地图底图与给定 caseT 的程序画布，声音由 score.json 挂接。线条艺术段沿用原作固定种子 mulberry(f * 7919 + 13)，2048像素颗粒贴图逐帧偏移，overlay透明度0.1，与H * 0.35至W * 0.66的径向暗角共同覆盖金线画面；同区间原片音轨随时间轴播放，声音默认关闭。 通过 index.html 内联 segments 在前 27.5 秒之后依次重放mg-morph 原片 0–10 秒；mg-aurora-glass 原片 0–10 秒，总时长 67.5 秒。形变片按帧号平移固定种子的软颗粒，并以纸纹亮度调制画面。极光片在移动颗粒和暗角上加入三角分布抖动。沿用同区间原片音轨，声音默认关闭。 按 index.html 内联 segments 在原有 47.5 秒之后重放mg-3d-render 原片 0–10 秒；mg-collage 原片 0–10 秒，总时长 67.5 秒。三维片按帧号平移种子颗粒并叠加暗角；拼贴片逐格移动颗粒并交替两块尘点板。画面与音轨沿用同一映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：67.5s\n- **声音 voice**：vinyl\n- **线条片颗粒**：原片0–10秒，巧思17.5–27.5秒；const f = Math.floor(t * FPS + 1e-4), r = mulberry(f * 7919 + 13); const ox = Math.floor(r() * 2048), oy = Math.floor(r() * 2048); ctx.globalCompositeOperation = 'overlay'; ctx.globalAlpha = 0.1；径向暗角H * 0.35、W * 0.66。\n- **逐帧纸面颗粒**：L800: const GT = 512, GN = new Int8Array(GT * GT);；L805: const k = 2.0 / Math.sqrt(ss / b.length); for (let i = 0; i < b.length; i++) GN[i] = Math.max(-6, Math.min(6, Math.round(b[i] * k))); }；L812: const img = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, W, H), d = img.data, ox = (f * 197) % GT, oy = (f * 331) % GT;\n- **颗粒抖动防色阶**：L800: const frame = Math.round(t * FPS * 4);；L876: gl.uniform1f(L.uBloomAmt, 0.22); gl.uniform1f(L.uGrainAmt, +(Q.get('grain') || 0.14)); gl.uniform1f(L.uFrame, frame); gl.uniform1f(L.uVig, 0.18);\n- **追加原片区间**：mg-3d-render 原片 0–10 秒；mg-collage 原片 0–10 秒；opacity: .09; mix-blend-mode: overlay;\ngrain.style.transform = `translate(${Math.round(hash(i) * 64 - 32)}px, ${Math.round(hash(i + 999) * 64 - 32)}px)`;；c.globalCompositeOperation = 'overlay'; c.globalAlpha = 0.26;\nc.globalCompositeOperation = 'multiply'; c.globalAlpha = 0.35;\ndustC[Math.floor(k / 2) % 2]\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **地图上的颗粒**：0s\n- **照片颗粒**：2.5s\n- **插画颗粒**：5s\n- **时长**：47.5s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置场景绘制、颗粒与暗角。\n- `依赖`：配置舞台、时间轴、预加载、声音、横竖布局、颗粒与暗角。\n- `需要的数据`：颗粒按floor(t×12)定位；10.4s地图配机窗照片与回忆。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：地图固定 10.4/kix 照片画布固定 13.5/回忆插画画布固定 27.56\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/film-grain/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/film-grain)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/flip-tile-cascade.md","title":"方片翻牌级联波","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 方片翻牌级联波\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n用来源案例的原作renderAt(t)重放方片翻牌级联波。6秒开始R1，120px方片按距(840,300)的径向延迟自转90°，dur=0.25、span=0.25，并用s=1/(abs(cosθ)+abs(sinθ))内缩。6.5秒开始R2，240px卡片按对角延迟绕横轴翻面，dur=0.2、span=0.3、sc=cos(π*ease(u))。保留xs=1-0.22*sn*(0.5+0.5*fs*ca/120)的梯形透视、col*=1-0.2*shd的明暗与黑床衔接。背面显示黄色三角、红色方块与蓝色圆形；7.1秒在背面遮挡时复位正面映射。7.5秒开始R4，卡片按距(960,540)的向心延迟绕竖轴翻回正面，dur=0.2、span=0.3、sc=-cos(π*ease(u))，8秒归位。按index.html 内联配置的segments映射时间，保留原作字体、素材和同区间音轨，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **径向自转**：R1.start=6秒；中心(840,300)；dur=0.25，span=0.25，size=120，angle=90；s=1/(abs(cosθ)+abs(sinθ))。\n- **对角翻牌**：R2.start=6.5秒；dur=0.2，span=0.3，size=240；sc=cos(π*ease(u))；sc<0为背面。\n- **翻牌透视**：sn=sqrt(1-sc²)；xs=1-0.22*sn*(0.5+0.5*fs*ca/120)；gShade=cov*sn；col*=1-0.2*shd。\n- **黑床衔接**：board=mix(isK?1:0,back?fB:fF,smoothstep(0.72,0.96,abs(sc)))；abs(sc)<0.002时返回board。\n- **遮挡复位**：frontReset=7.1秒；rotTile在tt>=resetT时返回原q与coverage=1。\n- **背面三元**：reveal=7–7.2秒；黄色三角[(120,780),(600,780),(360,300)]；红方块(720,300,480,480)；蓝圆(1560,540,r240)。\n- **向心归牌**：R4.start=7.5秒；dur=0.2，span=0.3，size=240，中心(960,540)；delay=(maxRadius-distance)*span/(maxRadius-minRadius)；sc=-cos(π*ease(u))；8秒归位。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/flip-tile-cascade/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/flip-tile-cascade)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/flipbook-pullback.md","title":"拉远翻纸溯帧","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 拉远翻纸溯帧\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 重放原片218/24−0.2至232/24+0.2秒，全长0.9833333333333343秒。保留218、220、222帧依次缩至0.9、0.86、0.84的三步拉远，显露灯箱、定位尺与叠纸。224至229帧由拇指掀角翻页，按RIFFLE=[150,121,108,61,30,13]重放旧画格，再回到顶层标题；保留蓝色洋葱皮、透纸灯光和翻页音。张数由drawing(239).id+1-RIFFLE.length给出，圈注在218与220帧分两步完成，并接箭头。沿用原画面、字体与同区间成品音轨，保持1920×1080、24fps，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **三步拉远**：pullScale(fq)=fq<218?1:fq<220?0.9:fq<222?0.86:0.84。\n- **溯帧序列**：RIFFLE=[150,121,108,61,30,13]；rif=f>=224&&f<=229?f-224:-1。\n- **灯箱透光**：[[124,0.14],[80,0.24],[44,0.38]]；洋葱皮偏移[8,-4]与[-5,7]，alpha=0.12与0.16。\n- **掀角形状**：a=[350,530,475,560,495,300][rif]*s；b=[250,380,340,405,358,214][rif]*s。\n- **总张数圈注**：TOTAL=drawing(239).id+1-RIFFLE.length；p=D.fq>=220?1:0.5；n=44；m=round(n*1.16*p)。\n- **重放时长**：原片218/24−0.2至232/24+0.2秒，巧思总时长0.9833333333333343秒。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/flipbook-pullback/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/flipbook-pullback)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/focus-burst-caption-hit.md","title":"集中线炸字主拍","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 集中线炸字主拍\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-hanazi 原片 5.8–7.833 秒；总时长 2.033 秒。炸毛主拍到达 → 集中线、放射底、爆炸框和震惊花字同时展开，冲击抖动后保留轻摆并在定格帧闪白。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：function focusD(cx, cy, seed, n = 120)\nburstD(0, 0, 432, 288, 15, 100 + boil)\nconst K6 = kick(t, C.drop, 26, 7, 11)\nfN === Math.round(C.freeze * 30) ? .85 : 0。使用 1080×1920 竖屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-hanazi 原片 5.8–7.833 秒；1 倍速，总时长 2.033 秒。\n- **集中线炸字主拍**：function focusD(cx, cy, seed, n = 120)\nburstD(0, 0, 432, 288, 15, 100 + boil)\nconst K6 = kick(t, C.drop, 26, 7, 11)\nfN === Math.round(C.freeze * 30) ? .85 : 0\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/focus-burst-caption-hit/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/focus-burst-caption-hit)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/freeze-to-framed-card.md","title":"定格退为相框","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 定格退为相框\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-hanazi 原片 7.3–9.2 秒；总时长 1.9 秒。定格 cue 到达 → 保持主拍画面并略推，随后照片缩小、旋转、圆角裁切，白框与阴影展开，余振停稳。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：const uf = t - C.freeze, uh = (uf - HOLD) / (11 * FR);\nconst sc = lerp(zf, .72, p), rot = lerp(0, -4, p)\nconst T = 190 * e, Bm = 560 * e, L = 70 * e, b = 30 * e;。使用 1080×1920 竖屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-hanazi 原片 7.3–9.2 秒；1 倍速，总时长 1.9 秒。\n- **定格退为相框**：const uf = t - C.freeze, uh = (uf - HOLD) / (11 * FR);\nconst sc = lerp(zf, .72, p), rot = lerp(0, -4, p)\nconst T = 190 * e, Bm = 560 * e, L = 70 * e, b = 30 * e;\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/freeze-to-framed-card/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/freeze-to-framed-card)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/fresh-ink-aging.md","title":"新墨笔锋渐暗","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 新墨笔锋渐暗\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 以1倍速重放原片0–8.02秒，巧思时长8.02秒。笔尖经过路径点后，新画线段和笔锋先保持明亮，旧线按绘制年龄降低亮度；抬升段逐渐增亮，标志保持高亮。FLOOR[i] = 0.4; (1 - smooth(0.2, 1.5, age))。FLOOR[i] = 0.96;glowAt(sx, sy, 56 * fl, 0.09 * vis, '214,178,112');7.5–7.82秒；const vis = 1 - smooth(cues.tip_fade[0], cues.tip_fade[1], t);沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、30fps；画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：0–8.02秒，1倍速；巧思时长8.02秒。\n- **旧线退亮**：FLOOR[i] = 0.4; (1 - smooth(0.2, 1.5, age))。\n- **标志亮度**：FLOOR[i] = 0.96;\n- **笔锋光晕**：glowAt(sx, sy, 56 * fl, 0.09 * vis, '214,178,112');\n- **笔尖淡出**：7.5–7.82秒；const vis = 1 - smooth(cues.tip_fade[0], cues.tip_fade[1], t);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/fresh-ink-aging/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/fresh-ink-aging)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/grid-beat-construction.md","title":"网格逐拍构成","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 网格逐拍构成\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n用来源案例的原作renderAt(t)重放网格逐拍构成。保留120px模数、120BPM与每拍0.5秒；网格线对按L=0.125+d*0.125落笔，draw=0.25，使用io2。红圆用u=prog(t,-0.2,0.5)^2和dx=(1-u)*6*M加速落位；target1至target4分别在1.25–1.5、1.75–2、2.25–2.5、2.75–3秒预示落点，再由几何覆盖。红圆在2.75–3秒以sl=io2(prog(t,2.75,3))滑入接触位置。拍数按n=clamp(floor(snap(t)/cues.beat+1e-6)+1,1,20)跳变。按index.html 内联配置的segments映射巧思时间与原片时间，保留原作字体、素材和同区间音轨，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **网格**：M=120；Y0=60；15条竖线、9条横线；L=land0+d*step；land0=0.125，step=0.125，draw=0.25；io2。\n- **拍数**：每拍0.5秒；n=clamp(floor(snap(t)/cues.beat+1e-6)+1,1,20)；padStart(2,\"0\")。\n- **圆形落位**：u=prog(t,-0.2,0.5)^2；dx=(1-u)*6*M；圆心(840+dx,300-M*(1-sl))，r=240。\n- **反拍准星**：target1：1.25–1.5秒；target2：1.75–2秒；target3：2.25–2.5秒；target4：2.75–3秒；环半径21–25，中心点半径4，十字短线32×4。\n- **一格接触**：sl=io2(prog(t,2.75,3))；圆心局部y=300-120*(1-sl)。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/grid-beat-construction/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/grid-beat-construction)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/hang-slam-capsule-crown.md","title":"悬球砸落冠波","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 悬球砸落冠波\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-3d-render 原片 4.8–8.2 秒；总时长 3.4 秒。金属球进入并减速悬停 → 急砸软床触发镜震和径向胶囊翻跳，冠波顶点放慢后追上时钟，最后沉降。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：herm(ts, HB, TC, 0.80, 0.0, -1.4, -30.0)\nt_launch = TC + rr_ / CS\nk_spin = np.where(v0 > 4.2, 3, 1)\n_w = 1 - 0.65 * _plateau(_tt, 6.42, 6.48, 6.70, 6.76)\nconst pun = df >= 0 ? 0.035 * (1 - expoOut(df / 6)) : 0;\nconst shk = [2, -1.5, 1, -0.5][df] || 0;。使用 1920×1080 横屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-3d-render 原片 4.8–8.2 秒；1 倍速，总时长 3.4 秒。\n- **悬球砸落冠波**：herm(ts, HB, TC, 0.80, 0.0, -1.4, -30.0)\nt_launch = TC + rr_ / CS\nk_spin = np.where(v0 > 4.2, 3, 1)\n_w = 1 - 0.65 * _plateau(_tt, 6.42, 6.48, 6.70, 6.76)\nconst pun = df >= 0 ? 0.035 * (1 - expoOut(df / 6)) : 0;\nconst shk = [2, -1.5, 1, -0.5][df] || 0;\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/hang-slam-capsule-crown/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/hang-slam-capsule-crown)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/hud-lock-alert-wave.md","title":"锁定括号警报波","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 锁定括号警报波\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-hud 原片 5.7–8.1 秒；总时长 2.4 秒。四角括号收拢吸附并蓄势，锁定主拍弹定标题、闪白并从目标发出改色波，警报脉冲随后衰减。参数保持原作数值：  \"bracket_travel\": [\n    5.9,\n    6.1667\n  ]\n  u.uWave.value = t >= LOCK ? E.outC(prog(t, LOCK, K.wave_dur)) * 1350 : -1;\n  float inside = uWave < 0.0 ? 0.0 : 1.0 - smoothstep(uWave - 110.0, uWave, dw);\n  float ann = uWave < 0.0 ? 0.0 : exp(-pow((dw - uWave + 22.0) / 40.0, 2.0)) * (1.0 - smoothstep(900.0, 1300.0, uWave));   // re-ink glow = 40 px annulus, not a disc\n  // titles: LOCKED + 目标锁定 land clean on the impact frame (scale 1.15 → 1 over 3 frames, first frame white-hot); only the small lines scramble\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-hud 原片 5.7–8.1 秒；1 倍速，总时长 2.4 秒。\n- **锁定括号警报波参数**：  \"bracket_travel\": [\n    5.9,\n    6.1667\n  ]\n  u.uWave.value = t >= LOCK ? E.outC(prog(t, LOCK, K.wave_dur)) * 1350 : -1;\n  float inside = uWave < 0.0 ? 0.0 : 1.0 - smoothstep(uWave - 110.0, uWave, dw);\n  float ann = uWave < 0.0 ? 0.0 : exp(-pow((dw - uWave + 22.0) / 40.0, 2.0)) * (1.0 - smoothstep(900.0, 1300.0, uWave));   // re-ink glow = 40 px annulus, not a disc\n  // titles: LOCKED + 目标锁定 land clean on the impact frame (scale 1.15 → 1 over 3 frames, first frame white-hot); only the small lines scramble\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/hud-lock-alert-wave/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/hud-lock-alert-wave)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/idle-breathing.md","title":"空闲呼吸","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 空闲呼吸\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n实现空闲呼吸：仅在非电影模式、阵列已展示、非详情且无归位中的卡片时启用。模式切换、选档、拖拽及惯性更新 lastInteraction，空闲超过2.5s 后目标强度为1，否则为0；每帧强度以1−exp(−dt×rate)靠近目标，进入rate=0.8、退出rate=4。第row行lane列位移=强度×[0.075·sin(2πt/8+0.3row−0.45lane)+0.027·sin(2πt/13−0.17row+0.3lane)]世界单位，总幅度不超过0.102。prefers-reduced-motion 完全关闭。Demo 保留九张卡片和计量图，按每世界单位50px示意位移；按钮模拟一次实际操作，外部seek/play回到预设事件。参数出处：demos/cases/archive-os/source/rhinelabui/src/motion.ts:74–80、scene.ts:1302–1317。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **阈值与包络**：2.5s 后开始；指数进入速率0.8、退出速率4，无固定完成时刻\n- **周期与幅度**：8s / 13s，幅度0.075 / 0.027世界单位，归一化权重约0.735 / 0.265\n- **二维相位**：0.3row−0.45lane / −0.17row+0.3lane；总幅度上限0.102世界单位\n- **退出**：模式切换、选档、阵列拖拽及惯性更新最后操作时间，按速率4指数退出\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/idle-breathing/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/idle-breathing)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/integer-pixel-parallax.md","title":"整像素多速视差","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 整像素多速视差\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n以原作 PIXEL QUEST 的 renderAt(t) 重放整像素多速视差，保留来源目录内的代码、字体与音轨。按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 以 1 倍速重放原片 0–10 秒，画面仍由原函数绘制。逻辑画布 320×180，输出 1920×1080，30fps，通常放大 6 倍；沿用原作 LINEAR 纹理过滤与 GLSL sharp：reg=0.5-0.5/sc，f=(cd-clamp(cd,-reg,reg))*sc+0.5。远山、中景、近丘、前景分别使用 floor(cx×0.125)、floor(cx×0.3)、floor(cx×0.55)、floor(cx×1.4)。相机按 hx-96 追随角色，末段由 254 到 260，f106 定机；远山叠加 floor(max(0,f-F_CAMSTOP)/16) 继续移动。声音重放原片同一区间，默认关闭；提供横屏、时间定位、播放暂停与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：0–10 秒，1 倍速\n- **画布与输出**：320×180 → 1920×1080，30fps，通常放大 6 倍\n- **像素采样**：原作 LINEAR 纹理采样配合 GLSL sharp；reg=0.5-0.5/sc，f=(cd-clamp(cd,-reg,reg))*sc+0.5\n- **分层位移**：远山 floor(cx×0.125)，中景 floor(cx×0.3)，近丘 floor(cx×0.55)，前景 floor(cx×1.4)\n- **追拍与定机**：r=hx-96；相机末段从 254 到 260，f100–106 每帧一步，f106/30=3.5333 秒定机\n- **远山续移**：floor(max(0,f-F_CAMSTOP)/16)，定机后每 16 帧增加一逻辑像素\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/integer-pixel-parallax/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/integer-pixel-parallax)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/isometric-leader-card.md","title":"等轴引线数据卡","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 等轴引线数据卡\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用等距 2.5D 来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，重放原片6.1–8.12秒，时长2.02秒。三张数据卡节点为6.5、6.75、7秒，引线提前.2秒从世界锚点沿竖直短桩与等轴轴线画出，卡片到点后以A.spring(tau,20,.55,8)横向展开。右面矩阵rotate(-30deg) skewX(-30deg) scaleY(.86602)，左面矩阵rotate(30deg) skewX(30deg) scaleY(.86602)；CW=360，CH=210，S=.8165*60*zoom*.01。保留.04–.46秒数值计数、i*.035秒柱条错峰、端点弹出扩圈与按屏幕y排序。退出节点7.62/7.66/7.7，卡片与引线在.22秒内同步收回。保留原作模型、字体、颜色和提示音，1920×1080、30fps，同区间原片音轨默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **等轴矩阵**：右面rotate(-30deg) skewX(-30deg) scaleY(.86602)；左面rotate(30deg) skewX(30deg) scaleY(.86602)。\n- **卡片尺寸**：CW=360，CH=210；S=.8165*60*zoom*.01。\n- **引线与卡片**：A.easeOutCubic(A.inv(-.2,0,tau))；A.spring(tau,20,.55,8)；callouts=[6.5,6.75,7]。\n- **数值与柱条**：A.easeOutCubic(A.inv(.04,.46,tau))；A.easeOutBack(A.inv(.06+i*.035,.28+i*.035,tau),1.6)。\n- **退出**：tOut=7.62/7.66/7.7；A.easeInCubic(A.inv(d.tOut,d.tOut+.22,T))。\n- **时长**：2.02s；原片6.1–8.12s。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/isometric-leader-card/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/isometric-leader-card)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/layered-frosted-glass.md","title":"玻璃逐层磨砂","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 玻璃逐层磨砂\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-aurora-glass 原片 0–8.8 秒；总时长 8.8 秒。每张玻璃卡片模糊其背后已合成的内容，再加入倾斜平面的边缘、高光与界面。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-aurora-glass 原片 0–8.8 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 8.8 秒。\n- **玻璃逐层磨砂**：L239: const TAPS_FROST = gaussTaps(30 * DPR / 4);；L839: blurInto(cur, T.qB, thin > 0 ? gaussTaps(lerp(30, 9, thin) * DPR / 4) : TAPS_FROST);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/layered-frosted-glass/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/layered-frosted-glass)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/layered-hanazi-spring-pop.md","title":"厚边花字弹入","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 厚边花字弹入\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-hanazi 原片 0–2.7 秒；mg-hanazi 原片 5.73–7.83 秒；mg-hanazi 原片 7.9–10 秒；总时长 6.9 秒。逐字 cue 到达 → 挤出、彩边、白边、渐变与高光一起弹入，驻留轻摆并按标题拍点依次跳动。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：function spring(t, z = 0.517, w = 22)\nconst hold = clamp((u - .22) / .35), wf = o.wf ?? 1.15;\nwhite: 13, outer: 12\ngloss: .55。使用 1080×1920 竖屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-hanazi 原片 0–2.7 秒；mg-hanazi 原片 5.73–7.83 秒；mg-hanazi 原片 7.9–10 秒；1 倍速，总时长 6.9 秒。\n- **厚边花字弹入**：function spring(t, z = 0.517, w = 22)\nconst hold = clamp((u - .22) / .35), wf = o.wf ?? 1.15;\nwhite: 13, outer: 12\ngloss: .55\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/layered-hanazi-spring-pop/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/layered-hanazi-spring-pop)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/line-ring-to-medallion.md","title":"线环熔成金章","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 线环熔成金章\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 以1倍速重放原片7.2–10秒，巧思时长2.8秒。圆环和拱门轮廓闭合后，线环收细蓄势并向内填成保留镂空拱门的金章，外缘过冲、镜头冲击、回声圈与扫光随落章出现，光脉沿原线回溯至种子后在末段正向流回金章。预备7.4–7.5秒；start: 7.5；swell: 0.367；const easeSwell = cubicBezier(0.24, 0.3, 0.2, 1);const ri = Math.max(0, MR * (1 - Math.min(1, e))); const ro = MR + 1.5 / c.z + MR * 0.04 * ov;overshoot: [7.6, 7.8, 7.93]；echo: [7.533, 7.933]；const EC = cues.echo, eq = clamp((t - EC[0]) / (EC[1] - EC[0]));7.55–8.45秒；const easePulse = cubicBezier(0.45, 0, 0.2, 1); const sp = TOTAL * (1 - easePulse(pu)); Math.exp(-(((S[im] - sp) / 300) ** 2))。8.95–9.5秒；bp = TOTAL * easeIO(bu) * 1.04 - 60；Math.exp(-(((S[im] - bp) / 240) ** 2))。const sh = clamp((t - 9.2) / 0.76);沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、30fps；画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：7.2–10秒，1倍速；巧思时长2.8秒。\n- **收细预备与填面**：预备7.4–7.5秒；start: 7.5；swell: 0.367；const easeSwell = cubicBezier(0.24, 0.3, 0.2, 1);\n- **径向填充**：const ri = Math.max(0, MR * (1 - Math.min(1, e))); const ro = MR + 1.5 / c.z + MR * 0.04 * ov;\n- **过冲与回声**：overshoot: [7.6, 7.8, 7.93]；echo: [7.533, 7.933]；const EC = cues.echo, eq = clamp((t - EC[0]) / (EC[1] - EC[0]));\n- **回溯光脉**：7.55–8.45秒；const easePulse = cubicBezier(0.45, 0, 0.2, 1); const sp = TOTAL * (1 - easePulse(pu)); Math.exp(-(((S[im] - sp) / 300) ** 2))。\n- **正向回流**：8.95–9.5秒；bp = TOTAL * easeIO(bu) * 1.04 - 60；Math.exp(-(((S[im] - bp) / 240) ** 2))。\n- **金属扫光**：const sh = clamp((t - 9.2) / 0.76);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/line-ring-to-medallion/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/line-ring-to-medallion)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/liquid-bar-split-wordmark.md","title":"液条断颈成字","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 液条断颈成字\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-liquid 原片 5.55–7.1 秒；总时长 1.55 秒。液体在主拍前挤成横条，主拍沿字缝断颈，每段距离场切换为字形并弹开，碎滴与光环跟随冲量。参数保持原作数值：  const massY = word.massY ?? word.baseY - 100, SLOT = 0.55;   // v5 sets word.massY (CJK ink centre)\n        const m = clamp((ts * 30 - 0.6 * i + 1.5) / 2);\n        const tBr = tSnap + (br.i + 0.5) / 30;\n        S.ring = [960, massY + 10, 40 + 1360 * kr, 0.62 * (1 - 0.45 * kr) * (1 - smooth(inv(5 / 30, 12 / 30, tr)))];\n  \"logo_snap\": 6.4,\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-liquid 原片 5.55–7.1 秒；1 倍速，总时长 1.55 秒。\n- **液条断颈成字参数**：  const massY = word.massY ?? word.baseY - 100, SLOT = 0.55;   // v5 sets word.massY (CJK ink centre)\n        const m = clamp((ts * 30 - 0.6 * i + 1.5) / 2);\n        const tBr = tSnap + (br.i + 0.5) / 30;\n        S.ring = [960, massY + 10, 40 + 1360 * kr, 0.62 * (1 - 0.45 * kr) * (1 - smooth(inv(5 / 30, 12 / 30, tr)))];\n  \"logo_snap\": 6.4,\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/liquid-bar-split-wordmark/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/liquid-bar-split-wordmark)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/liquid-neck-leap.md","title":"液团拉丝跃起","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 液团拉丝跃起\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-liquid 原片 1.3–4.4 秒；总时长 3.1 秒。液团起跳时拉出细颈，细颈变细断裂、两端回弹，液团沿抛物线并入大液团或落下，引出后续液浪。参数保持原作数值：  const MX = 960, GH = 5000, TH = 0.34;\n  hops.forEach((h) => { const d = drops[h.who]; h.side = Math.sign(d.x - MX); h.tTake = h.tc - TH; h.x0 = d.x; h.x1 = MX + h.side * 42; h.vy = GH * TH / 2 + 60 / TH; });\n          if (tt < 0.09 && rs === 1) {                        // take-off neck to the floor, snapping\n  else { float w = exp(-k*(d-f.m)); f.s += w; f.g += w*g; f.u += w*u; }\n  const tLeap = cues.leap, tApex = cues.apex, tImpact = 4.0;\n          const rm = lerp(14, 0.7, Math.pow(k, 0.9));\n  const GL = 3750;                                      // leap gravity (surface-tension jump reads floatier)\n  \"thread_snap\": 3.433,\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-liquid 原片 1.3–4.4 秒；1 倍速，总时长 3.1 秒。\n- **跳滴拉丝并团参数**：  const MX = 960, GH = 5000, TH = 0.34;\n  hops.forEach((h) => { const d = drops[h.who]; h.side = Math.sign(d.x - MX); h.tTake = h.tc - TH; h.x0 = d.x; h.x1 = MX + h.side * 42; h.vy = GH * TH / 2 + 60 / TH; });\n          if (tt < 0.09 && rs === 1) {                        // take-off neck to the floor, snapping\n  else { float w = exp(-k*(d-f.m)); f.s += w; f.g += w*g; f.u += w*u; }\n- **液团拔丝跃起参数**：  const tLeap = cues.leap, tApex = cues.apex, tImpact = 4.0;\n          const rm = lerp(14, 0.7, Math.pow(k, 0.9));\n  const GL = 3750;                                      // leap gravity (surface-tension jump reads floatier)\n  \"thread_snap\": 3.433,\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/liquid-neck-leap/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/liquid-neck-leap)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/macro-hero-focus-relay.md","title":"镜头焦点接力","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 镜头焦点接力\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-3d-render 原片 0–10 秒；总时长 10 秒。各段相机 cue 到达 → 镜头在微距、全字、金属球与正面落版之间换位，独立焦点跟随主角，片尾持续微推。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：POSE3 = dict(pos=(0.0, -9.9, 3.6), tgt=(0.0, 0.0, 0.30), lens=55, fstop=0.42, roll=0.0)\nconst tc = t - 8.4, crp = tc <= 0 ? 0 : 0.0092 * (tc < 0.6 ? tc * tc / 1.2 : tc - 0.3);。使用 1920×1080 横屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-3d-render 原片 0–10 秒；1 倍速，总时长 10 秒。\n- **镜头焦点接力**：POSE3 = dict(pos=(0.0, -9.9, 3.6), tgt=(0.0, 0.0, 0.30), lens=55, fstop=0.42, roll=0.0)\nconst tc = t - 8.4, crp = tc <= 0 ? 0 : 0.0092 * (tc < 0.6 ? tc * tc / 1.2 : tc - 0.3);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/macro-hero-focus-relay/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/macro-hero-focus-relay)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/metaball-lens-glide.md","title":"拉丝玻璃珠与滑读透镜","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 拉丝玻璃珠与滑读透镜\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-aurora-glass 原片 4.3–7.1 秒；总时长 2.8 秒。控钮按压后以 SDF 平滑并合拉出玻璃珠，脱离后展开为胶囊透镜沿文字滑行放大，速度驱动弹簧拉伸。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-aurora-glass 原片 4.3–7.1 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 2.8 秒。\n- **控钮拉丝出玻璃珠**：L623: const ant = seg(t, cues.bead - 0.2, cues.bead) * (1 - seg(t, cues.bead, cues.bead + 0.25));；L625: const press = 1.14 * (1 + 0.08 * seg(t, cues.bead - 0.2, cues.bead));；L634: const dt = t - cues.snap, wob = Math.sin(TAU * 7.5 * dt) * Math.exp(-14 * dt) * 0.12;；L651: const beadK = t < 5.9 ? q('neck', 40) * kn[2] * (1 - seg(t, cues.snap - 0.16, cues.snap + 0.01)) + 0.6 : 0;\n- **透镜沿句滑读**：L577: const beadRise = hermite([{ t: KN_T, v: [0, 0], m: [150, -6] }, { t: 5.1, v: [q('b1x', 42), q('b1y', -5)] }, { t: cues.snap, v: [q('b2x', 100), q('b2y', -12)] }, { t: 6.0, v: [170, -190] }]);；L579: const G0 = [q('g0x', -150), q('g0y', 36)], G1 = [q('g1x', -40), q('g1y', 40)];；L603: const t0 = 4.9, dt = 1 / 240; let sx = 0, sy = 0, vx = 0, vy = 0;；L604: const w = TAU * 2.0, z = 0.3;；L609: const tvx = (cur[0] - prev[0]) / dt * 0.00016, tvy = (cur[1] - prev[1]) / dt * 0.00016; prev = cur;；L599: const lensMag = keysS([[4.62, 1.0], [5.1, 1.14], [6.0, 1.36], [7.0, 1.32], [7.6, 1.26], [SETTLE, 1.2]], eSine);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/metaball-lens-glide/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/metaball-lens-glide)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/meter-needle-overrange.md","title":"量表扫针爆表","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 量表扫针爆表\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-hanazi 原片 6.7–7.833 秒；总时长 1.133 秒。量表主拍到达 → 表盘砸入，指针四帧从左端扫过终点并抵住抖动，爆表字和炸毛再击同拍发生。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：lerp(-88, 96, E.outBack(wn))\n3.5 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * 17 * t)\n[[10, -5], [-10, 6], [6, -3]][fm]。使用 1080×1920 竖屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-hanazi 原片 6.7–7.833 秒；1 倍速，总时长 1.133 秒。\n- **量表扫针爆表**：lerp(-88, 96, E.outBack(wn))\n3.5 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * 17 * t)\n[[10, -5], [-10, 6], [6, -3]][fm]\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/meter-needle-overrange/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/meter-needle-overrange)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/misregistration-lock.md","title":"套印漂移与锁版","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 套印漂移与锁版\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n用来源案例的原作renderAt(t)重放套印漂移与锁版。保留plate A的RGB分色和plate B的黑墨通道、彩色镂空与黑套印；色边使用原作4px补缝及lineWidth=5的彩形描边。保留oY、oR、oB、oK的原偏移表达式，初始reg=1、dens=0.955。6.5秒至reveal-1/30，按reg=1+1.3*in2(prog(q,R2.start,reveal-1/30))漂开色版。7秒主击时偏移收至reg=0.15，并在首帧、次帧分别增加墨密度0.12、0.05。8.5秒至lock-1/30，以io2推进reg=1+0.4*u和spread=4.5*u。9.5秒锁版时reg=0.12、dens=0.985，首帧、次帧再加0.10、0.04，spread归0。按index.html 内联配置的segments映射时间，保留原作字体、素材和同区间音轨，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **分色套印**：plate A RGB分别编码Y/R/B，plate B R编码K；black不清除plate A；Y=(242,183,5)/255，R=(224,60,49)/255，B=(30,79,163)/255，K=17/255。\n- **色边补缝**：方块宽+4*s；半圆r=244、clip x=1436；红形左边1436；背面彩形描边lineWidth=5，外扩2.5px。\n- **微偏套准**：oY=rough+(spread,0)；oR=rough+(1.3,-0.9)*reg+(0,spread)；oB=rough+(-1,1.2)*reg-(0,spread)；oK=rough+(0.5,0.4)*reg；初值reg=1，dens=0.955。\n- **翻牌漂开**：6.5–6.9667秒；reg=1+1.3*in2(prog(q,R2.start,reveal-1/30))。\n- **主击墨吻**：7秒；reg=0.15+0.85*io2(prog(q,R4.start,FREEZE))；fr=0时dens+=0.12，fr=1时+=0.05。\n- **定格松版**：8.5–9.4667秒；u=io2(prog(q,FREEZE+0.5,lock-1/30))；reg=1+0.4*u；spread=4.5*u。\n- **末拍锁版**：9.5秒；reg=0.12，dens=0.985；fl=0加0.10，fl=1加0.04；spread回0。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/misregistration-lock/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/misregistration-lock)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/morph-primitive-bridge.md","title":"简形桥接连续变形","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 简形桥接连续变形\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-morph 原片 0.8–8.8 秒；总时长 8 秒。主体、孔洞与子件经圆或胶囊中介连续变形，同时位移、旋转并挤压回弹。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-morph 原片 0.8–8.8 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 8 秒。\n- **简形桥接连续变形**：L40: const EM = bez(0.7, 0, 0.3, 1);；L58: const NB = 240, NH = 72, NM = 24, NS = 60;；L276: 'sun>sunset':   { rot: 0, ctrl: [0, 0], sq: 0.05 },\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/morph-primitive-bridge/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/morph-primitive-bridge)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/neon-write-on-ignition.md","title":"霓虹描写通电","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 霓虹描写通电\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-synthwave 原片 5.6–7.1 秒；总时长 1.5 秒。发亮笔头沿真实字形路径推进并留下暗玻璃管，通电节点按逐帧电平闪烁，最后整字稳定发光。参数保持原作数值：  const drawn = lvl > 0 ? TOTAL : p * TOTAL;\n    strokeRange(g, drawn - 60, drawn, LIT);\n  \"neon_trace\": [5.8, 6.6],\n  \"neon_strike\": [[6.6, 1], [6.633, 0.15], [6.667, 1], [6.7, 1], [6.733, 0.08], [6.767, 0.5], [6.8, 0.85], [6.833, 1]],\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-synthwave 原片 5.6–7.1 秒；1 倍速，总时长 1.5 秒。\n- **霓虹描写通电参数**：  const drawn = lvl > 0 ? TOTAL : p * TOTAL;\n    strokeRange(g, drawn - 60, drawn, LIT);\n  \"neon_trace\": [5.8, 6.6],\n  \"neon_strike\": [[6.6, 1], [6.633, 0.15], [6.667, 1], [6.7, 1], [6.733, 0.08], [6.767, 0.5], [6.8, 0.85], [6.833, 1]],\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/neon-write-on-ignition/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/neon-write-on-ignition)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/outro-stat-stack.md","title":"结尾数据堆叠与计数","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 结尾数据堆叠与计数\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n收尾时统计数字逐行堆叠，最后以 fin. 收束。复用地图巡礼的 drawOutro、blurIn 与对应 CSS。drawOutro 的统计行、数值计数与 fin.。片段：caseT 55.6→60；时长 5.2s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定底图与屏幕锚点，声音由 score.json 挂接。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：5.2s\n- **声音 voice**：blip、tick、bell、shimmer、sub\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **统计**：0.65s\n- **fin.**：2.4s\n- **时长**：5.2s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置统计行、数值计数与fin.入场。\n- `依赖`：配置舞台、时间轴、预加载、声音、横竖布局、颗粒与暗角。\n- `需要的数据`：设置收尾与横竖布局；58s底图显示完成路线和标记。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：55.6→60\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/outro-stat-stack/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/outro-stat-stack)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/pen-led-camera.md","title":"笔尖牵引镜头与停笔节奏","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 笔尖牵引镜头与停笔节奏\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 以1倍速重放原片0–10秒，巧思时长10秒。笔尖在转角密集处按加权路径长度减速，并在重复标记处停笔；镜头以高斯采样跟随，随停笔刹停与续笔追赶，再把焦点交给标志和海报。const KCORN = 9; (1 + KCORN * Math.min(CORN[i], 0.3))。2.083–2.233、3.5–3.65、4.75–4.9秒。const HA = 0.133, HR = 0.5; const dt = k * 0.05；sigma: 0.3；lead: 0.08；hook lag: 0.067。logo_from: 6.0；logo_to: 7.3；poster_from: 7.8；poster_to: 9.0；end_push amount: 0.03。env = np.clip(spd / 3000.0, 0, 1) ** 0.6 * (tt < T_END + 0.02)；env = filters.lpf(env.astype(np.float32), 30.0)。沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、30fps；画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：0–10秒，1倍速；巧思时长10秒。\n- **转角减速**：const KCORN = 9; (1 + KCORN * Math.min(CORN[i], 0.3))。\n- **停笔区间**：2.083–2.233、3.5–3.65、4.75–4.9秒。\n- **镜头刹停追赶**：const HA = 0.133, HR = 0.5; const dt = k * 0.05；sigma: 0.3；lead: 0.08；hook lag: 0.067。\n- **焦点交接**：logo_from: 6.0；logo_to: 7.3；poster_from: 7.8；poster_to: 9.0；end_push amount: 0.03。\n- **笔触响度**：env = np.clip(spd / 3000.0, 0, 1) ** 0.6 * (tt < T_END + 0.02)；env = filters.lpf(env.astype(np.float32), 30.0)。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/pen-led-camera/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/pen-led-camera)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/phase-offset-liquid-flood.md","title":"三层液浪漫屏","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 三层液浪漫屏\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-liquid 原片 3.8–5.95 秒；总时长 2.15 秒。三层不同方向和相位的波前依次漫屏，后沿退去时从液面边缘拉出四组字标种子。参数保持原作数值：  function sheet(delay, rdelay, u, amp, freq, ph0, lean, dx, dur = 0.46) {\n  const sheetV = sheet(0.0, 0.14, 0.9, 80, 0.0115, 0.3, 0.02, 0.42, 0.62);  // s4: slower front (peak diff /1.3)    // main field (violet) L->R, fuses with blobs\n  const sheetO = sheet(0.07, 0.07, 0.06, 85, 0.0102, 2.1, -0.03, -0.55); // tangerine R->L\n  const sheetP = sheet(0.14, 0.0, 0.46, 90, 0.0125, 4.4, 0.04, 0.3);     // hot pink L->R, top sheet (crisp)\n  \"sheets_in\": [\n    4.035,\n    4.105,\n    4.175\n  ],\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-liquid 原片 3.8–5.95 秒；1 倍速，总时长 2.15 秒。\n- **三层液浪释滴参数**：  function sheet(delay, rdelay, u, amp, freq, ph0, lean, dx, dur = 0.46) {\n  const sheetV = sheet(0.0, 0.14, 0.9, 80, 0.0115, 0.3, 0.02, 0.42, 0.62);  // s4: slower front (peak diff /1.3)    // main field (violet) L->R, fuses with blobs\n  const sheetO = sheet(0.07, 0.07, 0.06, 85, 0.0102, 2.1, -0.03, -0.55); // tangerine R->L\n  const sheetP = sheet(0.14, 0.0, 0.46, 90, 0.0125, 4.4, 0.04, 0.3);     // hot pink L->R, top sheet (crisp)\n  \"sheets_in\": [\n    4.035,\n    4.105,\n    4.175\n  ],\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/phase-offset-liquid-flood/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/phase-offset-liquid-flood)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/pinch-rip-cylinder-peel.md","title":"夹纸裂页翻卷","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 夹纸裂页翻卷\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-collage 原片 7.21–8.37 秒；总时长 1.16 秒。手指夹住纸页上沿 → 锯齿裂缝向下展开，左右纸半错一步沿圆柱翻卷，露出反面和下一张红纸。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：const NS = 12, q = PI * CR / 2 / NS;\n'-1': { a: [-20, 6, 10, 12], E: [330, 640, 980, 1320], R: [70, 110, 130, 130]\nconst fmap = (d, R) => d <= PI * R ? R * Math.sin(d / R) : PI * R - d;。使用 1920×1080 横屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-collage 原片 7.21–8.37 秒；1 倍速，总时长 1.16 秒。\n- **夹纸裂页翻卷**：const NS = 12, q = PI * CR / 2 / NS;\n'-1': { a: [-20, 6, 10, 12], E: [330, 640, 980, 1320], R: [70, 110, 130, 130]\nconst fmap = (d, R) => d <= PI * R ? R * Math.sin(d / R) : PI * R - d;\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/pinch-rip-cylinder-peel/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/pinch-rip-cylinder-peel)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/punch-in-camera-shake.md","title":"分级急推镜震","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 分级急推镜震\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-collage 原片 1.13–7.7 秒；mg-hanazi 原片 4.7–6.2 秒；总时长 8.07 秒。拍点到达 → 镜头分级急推，每级在少数帧内完成推近、过冲与镜震，之后继续缓推或加强颤动。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：z = [1.11, 1.075, 1.056, 1.05][kp]; cx = [12, -8, 3, 0][kp]; cy = [26, -14, 6, 0][kp];\nif (q6 >= 5.5 - 1e-4) { z = 1 + 0.022 * eIO((q6 - 5.5) / 2.0); px = 900; py = 540; }；const u = tt - p, e = E.outExpo(clamp(u / (2 * FR)));\nos = 1 + .03 * Math.exp(-Math.pow((u - 1.6 * FR) / (.9 * FR), 2))\n9 + 4 * k\n\"pushZ\": [\n  1.4,\n  2.0,\n  2.9\n ]。横屏来源使用 1920×1080，竖屏来源使用 1080×1920。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-collage 原片 1.13–7.7 秒；mg-hanazi 原片 4.7–6.2 秒；1 倍速，总时长 8.07 秒。\n- **逐格俯拍冲镜**：z = [1.11, 1.075, 1.056, 1.05][kp]; cx = [12, -8, 3, 0][kp]; cy = [26, -14, 6, 0][kp];\nif (q6 >= 5.5 - 1e-4) { z = 1 + 0.022 * eIO((q6 - 5.5) / 2.0); px = 900; py = 540; }\n- **预警三连推**：const u = tt - p, e = E.outExpo(clamp(u / (2 * FR)));\nos = 1 + .03 * Math.exp(-Math.pow((u - 1.6 * FR) / (.9 * FR), 2))\n9 + 4 * k\n\"pushZ\": [\n  1.4,\n  2.0,\n  2.9\n ]\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/punch-in-camera-shake/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/punch-in-camera-shake)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/push-through-window.md","title":"穿窗推镜","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 穿窗推镜\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 重放穿窗推镜。保留86/30–90/30秒的负向预备、90/30–105/30秒的加速推进与105/30–115/30秒的过冲弹定；缩放按对数尺度计算，NP=2.2、OB=1.2。保留22条分三批出现且各持续2帧的速度条、105帧奶油色闪片、112与113帧的到达镜震，以及115/30–160/30秒的室内续推。沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、30fps；画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **预备拉回**：86/30–90/30=2.867–3.000秒；A0=-.05；p=A0*E.ioQ(inv(camAntic,push,t))。\n- **连通推进**：90/30–105/30=3.000–3.500秒；S1=1920/64=30；NP=2.2；s=exp(lerp(log(1.12),log(30),p))。\n- **过冲弹定**：105/30–115/30=3.500–3.833秒；OB=1.2；kA=NP/(tg-tp)，kB=(OB+3)/(tS-tg)，PG=(kB+A0*kA)/(kA+kB)。\n- **放射速度条**：22条；f0=102+i%3；各持续2帧；ra=r0+320*u；len=200+rng*300。\n- **穿窗闪白**：fr===105；fill=#FFF6E9；持续1/30=.033秒。\n- **到达镜震**：112帧s*=1.03、cy-=9/s；113帧s*=.988、cx+=7/s。\n- **室内续推**：115/30–160/30=3.833–5.333秒；s*=1+.14*w；cx=P.x+100/S1*w；cy=P.y-40/S1*w。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/push-through-window/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/push-through-window)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/radar-sweep-persistent-blips.md","title":"雷达扫掠显点","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 雷达扫掠显点\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-hud 原片 2.2–6.6 秒；总时长 4.4 秒。扫描扇区转过目标方位时，目标点发亮并按最近扫过的时间衰减，列表读数随首次扫过上线。参数保持原作数值：    const a = (K.radar_theta0_deg + 180 * (t - K.radar_start) - 90) * DEG, tr = 0.6 * Math.PI, f = tr / (2 * Math.PI);\n    const since = (((brg - b.brg) % 360) + 360) % 360 / 180, age = t - K.radar_start - (((b.brg - K.radar_theta0_deg) % 360 + 360) % 360) / 180;\n  \"radar_period\": 2.0,\n  \"radar_theta0_deg\": 52,\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-hud 原片 2.2–6.6 秒；1 倍速，总时长 4.4 秒。\n- **雷达扫掠显点参数**：    const a = (K.radar_theta0_deg + 180 * (t - K.radar_start) - 90) * DEG, tr = 0.6 * Math.PI, f = tr / (2 * Math.PI);\n    const since = (((brg - b.brg) % 360) + 360) % 360 / 180, age = t - K.radar_start - (((b.brg - K.radar_theta0_deg) % 360 + 360) % 360) / 180;\n  \"radar_period\": 2.0,\n  \"radar_theta0_deg\": 52,\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/radar-sweep-persistent-blips/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/radar-sweep-persistent-blips)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/rolling-digits.md","title":"滚动数字与文字","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 滚动数字与文字\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n实现当前 archive-os 的逐字符滚动：直接裁出案例 bundle 中的滚动库，使用 createRollingNumber/createRollingText，duration:460、motionBlur:true，文字 transition:direct、stagger:none。每个字符建独立 slot/reel/face，临界阻尼使用 49 点及 exp(-10h)；连续更新必须先通过 Bs.read 读取当前动画位置和速度，再向最新目标接续。数字按照上下、左右输入方向滚动；文字使用默认正向。数字 --rn-blur 为 0.35，文字为 0.2，SVG Gaussian blur 随字高和速度变化。档案数据保存在 archives.json，字体引用 ../../cases/archive-os/film/app/fonts/，声音引用 ../../cases/archive-os/audio/film-audio.ogg。自动驾驶复用案例 62.6 秒后的四向输入，9 秒及 9.35 秒连续切列；真实输入接管，seek 恢复自动驾驶；默认静音并支持减少动态。\n\n## 视频生成 Prompt\n\n制作档案 HUD 的 13 秒滚轮片段，时间与 archive-os 的 62.6–75.6 秒对应。显示当前 RHINE LAB 档案的 X- 编号、行列号、中文标题、权限和列名；每次选择以 460ms 临界阻尼逐字符翻动，9 秒与 9.35 秒连续切列时保持当前位置和速度。保留 MiSans、浅灰底、字高相关速度模糊与案例原声音片段。\n\n## 负向约束\n\n不要 outCubic，不要整行文字滑入淡出，不要从上一次目标重启，不要固定像素正弦模糊，不要让文字与数字强制共用方向，不要 LUMEN 或固定 X-017 旧档案，不要跨目录读取案例。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：每次 460ms，49 点临界阻尼轨迹\n- **运动模糊**：SVG Gaussian blur 随字高与实时速度变化；数字 0.35、文字 0.2\n- **方向**：编号、行号与列号按导航方向；文字默认正向\n- **连续输入**：9s 与 9.35s 接连切列；第二次读取未完成动画的位置和速度\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/rolling-digits/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/rolling-digits)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/route-draw-marker.md","title":"路线描画与标记脉冲","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 路线描画与标记脉冲\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n路线按进度描画，车头沿线前进，站点标记弹入并打出双语站名。复用地图巡礼的 cameraAt、addRouteLayers、updateRoutesGL、drawRoutesSVG、drawMarkers、measureMarkerLabels、project、routeP、pointAt 与对应 CSS。三个固定镜头中的路线、车头、标记圆点与双语标签；jrNara minZoom=13；镜头间使用案例纸色转场。片段：kix: caseT 1.5→2.35；haruka: caseT 14.6→17.05；kyoto: caseT 16.6→17.45；naraLine: caseT 37.4→39.85；jrNara: caseT 39.4→40.25；walk1: caseT 39.4→41.25；naraPark: caseT 40.8→41.65；时长 13.175s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定镜头的实时地图，声音由 score.json 挂接。前10.6秒保留原有地图巡礼段，之后追加等距城市原片5.835–7.07秒的数据弧线段，追加1.235秒。数据弧线采用QuadraticBezierCurve3和TubeGeometry(curve,72,.021,8,false)，uT0=PULSE_T+.05+k*.035，uDur=.45，uSpeed=1.3+A.hash(k*7)*.6；到达后的屋顶环按ph=(u*.9)%1放大1+ph*2.2并淡出，沿用同区间原片音轨，声音默认关闭。 通过 index.html 内联 segments 在前 11.835 秒之后依次重放mg-paperclip 原片 5.86–7.2 秒，总时长 13.175 秒。手机科普片的弧线从产地锚点画向组装点，箭头按路线切线落位；数据包随后沿线循环，汇点回弹并周期扩圈。沿用同区间原片音轨，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：13.175s\n- **声音 voice**：sonar、whoosh、clack、blip、chime、tick\n- **供应路线流向汇点**：L328: const dx=DEST[0]-p[0],dy=DEST[1]-p[1],L=Math.hypot(dx,dy);const bend=Math.min(260,L*.35)*(i===0?-1:1);；L353: const ru=P(t,o.rt,EV.route_dur);o.route.setAttribute('stroke-dashoffset',1-ioC(ru));const ar=oB(P(t,o.rt+EV.route_dur-.08,.24),2);o.arw.style.opacity=ar>0?1:0;o.arw.setAttribute('transform',`translate(${o.ap.x} ${o.ap.y}) rotate(${o.aa}) scale(${ar*Math.min(pk,1.8)})`);；L356: const f=((t-o.rt-EV.route_dur)*0.55+k/3)%1;const q=o.route.getPointAtLength(o.len*f);c.style.opacity=clamp(f*8)*clamp((1-f)*8);c.setAttribute('cx',q.x);c.setAttribute('cy',q.y);});});；L358: const rp=((t-EV.pin)%1.1)/1.1;pinRing.style.opacity=t>EV.pin?(1-rp)*.8:0;pinRing.style.transform=`scale(${1+rp*1.6})`;\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **机场**：0s\n- **描画**：0.6s\n- **第二段**：4s\n- **步行**：7.2s\n- **时长**：13.175s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置镜头、路线、标记、引线、投影与标签避让。\n- `依赖`：配置MapLibre 5.6.0、样式、图层与地图镜像。\n- `需要的数据`：设置地点、路线、镜头与横竖S1/S2/S3取景。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：kix: 1.5→2.35/haruka: 14.6→17.05/kyoto: 16.6→17.45/naraLine: 37.4→39.85/jrNara: 39.4→40.25/walk1: 39.4→41.25/naraPark: 40.8→41.65\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/route-draw-marker/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/route-draw-marker)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/rpg-dialog-box.md","title":"像素对话框","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 像素对话框\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过来源 PIXEL QUEST 的 renderAt(t) 重放像素对话框，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 以 1 倍速播放原片 4.4–6.1 秒，声音使用同一区间原片音轨且默认关闭。4.6 秒起框高依次 10、20、30，前两级各 2 帧；框宽 176、x72、y0=99-(h>>1)。全高后显示 56×13 的宝箱名牌、24×20 头像框和指向宝箱的尾角。4.8 秒起使用原作 12px 中文像素字体，每 3 帧揭示一字，字距 1，按 n=min(9,floor((f-fType)/3)+1) 显示「欢迎来到像素世界！」。读完提示保留原作 f>=fType+27 与 ((f>>2)&1)===0 的门限，3 行三角顶宽 5。5.8 秒起按 [20,10,4] 收起，5.9 秒停止显示。继续调用原片代码与字体，使用横屏、时间定位、播放暂停和减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：4.4–6.1 秒，1 倍速，巧思时长 1.7 秒\n- **阶梯展开**：原片 4.6 秒起，高度 10、20、30；前两级各 2 帧；宽 176、x72，y0=99-(h>>1)\n- **说话者映射**：全高后显示 x82、56×13 名牌，24×20 头像框与指向宝箱的尾角；中文 12px\n- **中文逐字**：原片 4.8–5.6 秒，每 3 帧揭示一字；n=min(9,floor((f-fType)/3)+1)，字距 1\n- **读完提示**：f>=fType+27 且 ((f>>2)&1)===0 时绘 3 行三角，顶宽 5；默认绘制 f171，f172–173 隐藏\n- **阶梯收起**：原片 5.8 秒起，高度按 [20,10,4] 逐帧收起；f177，即 5.9 秒起停止显示\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/rpg-dialog-box/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/rpg-dialog-box)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/sea-mask-sunset.md","title":"海面遮罩吞日","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 海面遮罩吞日\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-morph 原片 2.2–4.6 秒；总时长 2.4 秒。海面升起，以同一水平边界裁掉太阳下半部，光芒变成波浪，随后海水上涌占满画面。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-morph 原片 2.2–4.6 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 2.4 秒。\n- **海面遮罩吞日**：L341: function heroClip(t) { if (t <= 2.3 || t >= 4.45) return null; return seaSurface(t) + 300 * EIO(clamp((t - 3.84) / 0.13)); }；L342: function seaSurface(t) { if (t < cues.wipes.sea) return H + 10; return lerp(H + 10, 560, EO(clamp((t - cues.wipes.sea) / 0.5))); }；L436: function seaTop(t) { if (t < WP.flood) return seaSurface(t); return lerp(560, -80, EIO(clamp((t - WP.flood) / 0.42))); }\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/sea-mask-sunset/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/sea-mask-sunset)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/seeded-digit-scramble-settle.md","title":"乱数跳变落定","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 乱数跳变落定\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-hud 原片 2.2–9.7 秒；总时长 7.5 秒。等宽数字按字符与帧种子快速跳变数帧后落定真实读数，标点保持原位。参数保持原作数值：export function roll(t, t0, final, id = 0, nFrames = 4) {\n  if (f >= nFrames) return final;\n    s += /[0-9]/.test(c) ? DIG[Math.floor(hash(id, i, f + 7) * 10)] : c;\n  const v = base + amp * (1 - (ey - y) / h);\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-hud 原片 2.2–9.7 秒；1 倍速，总时长 7.5 秒。\n- **乱数跳变落定参数**：export function roll(t, t0, final, id = 0, nFrames = 4) {\n  if (f >= nFrames) return final;\n    s += /[0-9]/.test(c) ? DIG[Math.floor(hash(id, i, f + 7) * 10)] : c;\n  const v = base + amp * (1 - (ey - y) / h);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/seeded-digit-scramble-settle/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/seeded-digit-scramble-settle)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/seekable-timeline.md","title":"可逐帧定位的时间轴","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 可逐帧定位的时间轴\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n所有画面都是时间 t 的函数，拖动、倒退、跳转都能得到同一帧。复用地图巡礼的 render、drawHud、drawCards、drawLeader、cameraAt、clockAt、controls 与对应 CSS。顶部 HUD（日序、日期、进度线、指南针、坐标、海拔、缩放与时钟）、kix 卡片与引线、MIKAN 徽章、控制条上方右对齐的署名，以及舞台内随 caseT 更新的复制控制条。片段：caseT 12→14；caseT 14→12.6；caseT 12.6→13.4；caseT 13.4→15.5；caseT 15.5→16.6；caseT 16.6→13；caseT 13→14.4；时长 7s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定底图与屏幕锚点，声音由 score.json 挂接。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：7s\n- **声音 voice**：shutter、paper、confirm、stamp、sparkle、tick\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **播放**：0s\n- **倒拖**：2s\n- **前跳**：3.4s\n- **再倒拖**：5s\n- **时长**：7s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置HUD、卡片、引线、镜头、时钟与控制条。\n- `依赖`：配置舞台、时间轴、预加载、声音、横竖布局、颗粒与暗角。\n- `需要的数据`：设置顶部HUD、kix卡片与MIKAN；13s底图配七段拖动。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：12→14/14→12.6/12.6→13.4/13.4→15.5/15.5→16.6/16.6→13/13→14.4\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/seekable-timeline/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/seekable-timeline)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/shape-docks-wordmark.md","title":"形体落位成字标","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 形体落位成字标\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-morph 原片 8.1–9.3 秒；mg-aurora-glass 原片 6.7–10 秒；总时长 4.5 秒。主体形状飞到字位、开合成字标中的一个字母，其余字母随后显现；先重放圆环伸展为 morphe，再重放透镜开成 Aurora 的 o。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-morph 原片 8.1–9.3 秒；mg-aurora-glass 原片 6.7–10 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 4.5 秒。\n- **圆环伸展成字标**：L614: const MB = { t0: 8.30, t1: 8.6, arches: [[571.5, 497], [650, 497]], Ro: 55.5, Ri: 22.5,；L683: const LANE = [352, 352, 346, 340, 296, 290], _lp = {};\n- **透镜落入字母**：L533: const WORD_SIZE = 178, WORD_BASE = 596, WORD_TRACK = 4;；L565: const LETTER_T = [0.3, 0.15, 0.0, null, 0.02, 0.17].map((d) => d === null ? null : cues.word + d);；L595: { t: SETTLE, v: [O_CX, O_CY], m: [0, 0] },；L598: const lensHY = keysS([[5.95, 110], [6.45, 122], [T_FREE, 106], [7.7, 88], [SETTLE, O_R]], eSine);；L672: const wave = [700 * eOutSine(kw), 0.11 * Math.pow(1 - kw, 0.8) * wk, 6.5 * Math.pow(1 - kw, 0.45) * wk];\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/shape-docks-wordmark/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/shape-docks-wordmark)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/shape-wipe-transition.md","title":"形状擦除转场","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 形状擦除转场\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 重放气泡预备与三段形状擦除。保留144/30–150/30秒的气泡挤压预备，150/30–160/30秒的珊瑚彗星放大旋转，154/30–163/30秒的薄荷胶囊放大旋正，以及158/30–164/30秒的奶油半圆加速砸落与余震。彗星圆半径58、尾长84→204；胶囊3000×1500、rx750；半圆半径1700。沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、30fps；画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。 通过 index.html 内联 segments 在前 1.233333 秒之后依次重放mg-morph 原片 1.42–8.82 秒，总时长 9.49333 秒。形变片的换景从主体在色域节点的位置出发，以扩张圆形与速度相关羽化边缘接管全屏。沿用同区间原片音轨，声音默认关闭。 按 index.html 内联 segments 在原有 8.63333 秒之后重放mg-hanazi 原片 3.57–4.43 秒，总时长 9.49333 秒。综艺片用带滚动糖果条纹的不透明斜带扫过全屏，遮住前镜并露出下一镜。画面与音轨沿用同一映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **气泡预备**：144/30–150/30=4.800–5.000秒；sx乘1+.12*an，sy乘1-.18*an；上提段145/30=4.833秒起。\n- **彗星气泡**：150/30–160/30=5.000–5.333秒；圆半径58；k=exp(lerp(log(1.12),log(34),E.ioQ(u1)))；尾长84→204；旋转175*E.outC(u1)。\n- **薄荷胶囊**：154/30–163/30=5.133–5.433秒；3000×1500、rx750；k=exp(lerp(log(.03),0,E.ioQ(u2)))；rot=25*(1-E.outB(u2,1.6))。\n- **奶油半圆**：158/30–164/30=5.267–5.467秒；半径1700；y=-110-2300*(1-E.inQ(u3))+40*kick(tc,slam,3.5,.4)；sy=1-.06*kick；rot=7*(1-u3)。\n- **总时长**：9.49333s\n- **主体扩张成色域**：L43: const EB = bez(0.42, 0, 0.12, 1);；L428: const FEATHER = 0.4 * 0.5 / FPS;；L430: function circleReg(t, t0, t1, o, r0 = 40, ease = EB) { if (t < t0) return null; if (t >= t1) return 'full';\n- **追加原片区间**：mg-hanazi 原片 3.57–4.43 秒；const BW = 1900, bar = 90, dv = 8;\nconst c = lerp(2400, -2400, E.inOutSine(u));\ntranslate(540 960) rotate(-20)\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/shape-wipe-transition/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/shape-wipe-transition)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/shared-cue-sheet.md","title":"画音共用节拍表","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 画音共用节拍表\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 引用五个来源案例的原作、字体、素材与成品音轨，以 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 依次重放密集节点段。保持1920×1080、30fps；画面调用原作 renderAt(t)，音轨使用同一时刻映射。扁平矢量保留180、195、210、225帧四个图标落点；包豪斯保留120BPM与6–8秒的级联；像素片保留6.4秒开箱、6.8秒接物和7.2秒片名。说明层使用中文显示当前 cue 名，声音默认关闭。 总时长12.892秒；末尾依次追加逐帧手绘5.3–9.075秒、线条艺术1.883–5.100秒，原有三段保持。逐帧手绘沿用同一film/cues.json的旋转、爆炸和逐笔书写时刻；线条艺术同时共享笔尖速度与转角数据，中文节点显示停笔和续笔。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **画面时间基准**：1920×1080、30fps；原作帧号除以30换算为秒。\n- **扁平矢量落点**：180、195、210、225帧；6、6.5、7、7.5秒。\n- **包豪斯级联**：120BPM；R1=6、R2=6.5、R3=7.2、R4=7.5秒，8秒定格。\n- **像素开箱节点**：6秒震箱；6.2、6.3秒箱盖跳动；6.4秒开箱；6.8秒接物；7.2秒片名。\n- **逐帧手绘节点**：120BPM、24fps；6.5秒爆炸，7.25–8.5秒每0.125秒一笔。\n- **线条路径数据**：速度差分dt=1/600；按120Hz采样，CORN[i]>0.05且TD[i]-lastT>0.05时导出转角。\n- **总时长**：12.892秒；保留原三段，末尾追加逐帧手绘和线条艺术。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / cues`：设置来源片段与中文节点名称，画面和原音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/shared-cue-sheet/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/shared-cue-sheet)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/smear-frame-strike.md","title":"拖影帧与多重残像","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 拖影帧与多重残像\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 重放原片0–1.45秒，全长1.45秒。保留后撤蓄力、f9扫掠四边形拖影和f10三重中间姿态，火柴头拖长back=L*1.1、r=27，残像u=0.25+k*0.25。保留点火闪光与STICK=262的翻转抛起，按RT数组减速旋转，落地以0.14、-0.07、0.025弧度衰减摆动。沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、24fps，画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **火柴尺度**：STICK=262；BUTT=[1150,742]。\n- **扫掠拖影**：f===9；扫掠四边形[B0,H0,H1,B1]；火柴头back=L*1.1，r=27。\n- **多重残像**：f===10；k=0..2；u=0.25+k*0.25。\n- **抛转减速**：RT=[0,0.115,0.23,0.34,0.45,0.555,0.655,0.745,0.83,0.9,0.955,0.99,1]。\n- **落定摆动**：s.r=k<3?[0.14,-0.07,0.025][k]:0；s.bend=k<3?[7,-4,1.5][k]:0。\n- **重放时长**：原片0–1.45秒，巧思总时长1.45秒；动作结束后保留0.2秒。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/smear-frame-strike/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/smear-frame-strike)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/snip-rattle-pop-lid.md","title":"剪盖蓄势爆开","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 剪盖蓄势爆开\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-collage 原片 1.96–5.04 秒；总时长 3.08 秒。剪线印章到达 → 剪刀逐段打开剪口，头盖三次抖动后悬停，再弹起并回落到纸钉铰链，同时迸出碎纸和 BANG。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：const BANGP = [[1000, 430, 0.8, 0.9], [1262, 292, 1.25, 0.7], [1500, 172, 1.0, 0.1], [1528, 156, 1.0, 0.05], [1716, 40, 1.06, 0.8], [2010, -110, 1.1, 1.2]];\nconst LIDF = [[-70, 10, -230, 1.3], [-200, -30, -660, 1.8], [-300, -70, -700, 1.8], [-385, -40, -300, 1.4]];。使用 1920×1080 横屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-collage 原片 1.96–5.04 秒；1 倍速，总时长 3.08 秒。\n- **剪盖蓄势爆开**：const BANGP = [[1000, 430, 0.8, 0.9], [1262, 292, 1.25, 0.7], [1500, 172, 1.0, 0.1], [1528, 156, 1.0, 0.05], [1716, 40, 1.06, 0.8], [2010, -110, 1.1, 1.2]];\nconst LIDF = [[-70, 10, -230, 1.3], [-200, -30, -660, 1.8], [-300, -70, -700, 1.8], [-385, -40, -300, 1.4]];\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/snip-rattle-pop-lid/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/snip-rattle-pop-lid)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/soft-bed-letter-bounce.md","title":"软床触地回弹","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 软床触地回弹\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-3d-render 原片 0.05–3.2 秒；总时长 3.15 秒。字母到达软床 → 接触力驱动下陷、反弹与延迟挤压，落点声音读取同一碰撞事件。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：dt = 1 / 2400.0\nws, zs, beta = 2 * np.pi * 3.3, 0.14, 0.56\nFALL_Z = {'s': 1.8, 'o': 2.9, 'f': 2.9, 't': 2.9}。使用 1920×1080 横屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-3d-render 原片 0.05–3.2 秒；1 倍速，总时长 3.15 秒。\n- **软字触地回弹**：dt = 1 / 2400.0\nws, zs, beta = 2 * np.pi * 3.3, 0.14, 0.56\nFALL_Z = {'s': 1.8, 'o': 2.9, 'f': 2.9, 't': 2.9}\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/soft-bed-letter-bounce/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/soft-bed-letter-bounce)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/spark-stroke-handletter.md","title":"火星逐笔写字","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 火星逐笔写字\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 重放原片158/24−0.2至9.075秒，全长2.6916666666666664秒。保留22个火团圆形在0、0.32、0.6、0.82、1的阶梯进度下迁移到rx=520、ry=262的花边徽章；黄色核心以[0,0.55,1]进度和[1,0.45,0.2]尺寸接到第一笔。沿用S=352、gap=18的手绘字形，火星沿E.out2(p)控制的中心线前缀逐笔书写；笔画节点为7.25至8.5秒、间隔0.125秒。保留标题影块、徽章和字面的回弹落定、HAND MADE与中文标语入场。沿用原作字体、纹理和同区间成品音轨，保持1920×1080、24fps，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **徽章构成**：C0=[862,614]；BADGE={x:960,y:464,rx:520,ry:262}；N=22；sk=0.14*hs(k,7)。\n- **四张聚合**：morphP(t)=t<6.99?0:t<7.07?0.32:t<7.15?0.6:t<7.24?0.82:1。\n- **核心点笔**：e=[0,0.55,1][stp]；R=min(q.r*0.8,240)*[1,0.45,0.2][stp]。\n- **逐笔书写**：TITLE={cx:960,cy:440,S:352,gap:18}；prefix(full,E.out2(p)*0.999+0.001*p)；strokes=[7.25,7.375,7.5,7.625,7.75,7.875,8,8.125,8.25,8.375,8.5]。\n- **回弹落定**：settle=K(t1,[[8.5,0],[8.583,1.25,out2],[8.667,0.9],[8.75,1.0]])；标题缩放1+K(t1,[[8.5,0],[8.54,0.05,out2],[8.625,-0.02],[8.75,0.008],[8.875,0]])。\n- **重放时长**：原片158/24−0.2至9.075秒，巧思总时长2.6916666666666664秒。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/spark-stroke-handletter/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/spark-stroke-handletter)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/specular-sweep-glint.md","title":"斜向扫光与星芒","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 斜向扫光与星芒\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-synthwave 原片 4.75–5.85 秒；mg-synthwave 原片 7.925–9.8 秒；mg-liquid 原片 6.9–8 秒；总时长 4.075 秒。窄高光带沿倾斜坐标扫过字标表面；镀铬字在指定字角同步绽出旋转星芒，厚液字保留液面上的窄高斯亮带。参数保持原作数值：    float b1 = (x - uGlint) / .09, b2 = (x - uGlint + .22) / .03;\n    float band = exp(-b1*b1) * .75 + exp(-b2*b2) * .45;\n  const gs = (tc, x, y, dur, r) => { const k = (t - (tc - dur / 2)) / dur; if (k > 0 && k < 1) glints.push({ x, y, r: r * Math.sin(Math.PI * k), a: Math.sin(Math.PI * k), rot: k * .8 }); };\n  gs(CUES.glint_star, TITLE_LEFT + TB.tw / TS * .085, TITLE_TOP + 6, .5, 150);\n    S.key = { x: -0.78 + 0.06 * Math.sin(t * 0.6) + 0.30 * kd, y: -0.95 + 0.12 * kd,\n      glint: glint1 ? lerp(-900, 1700, inOut(inv(cues.glint - 0.1, cues.glint + 0.75, t))) : lerp(-300, 1900, inOut(g2)),\n  float gb = (p.x*0.8 - p.y*0.6) - uKey.z;\n  col += vec3(1.0,0.95,0.98)*uKey.w*exp(-gb*gb/(2.0*34.0*34.0))*ss(0.35,0.75,side)*(1.0-ss(0.9,1.0,side))*1.1;\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-synthwave 原片 4.75–5.85 秒；mg-synthwave 原片 7.925–9.8 秒；mg-liquid 原片 6.9–8 秒；1 倍速，总时长 4.075 秒。\n- **镀铬斜扫星芒参数**：    float b1 = (x - uGlint) / .09, b2 = (x - uGlint + .22) / .03;\n    float band = exp(-b1*b1) * .75 + exp(-b2*b2) * .45;\n  const gs = (tc, x, y, dur, r) => { const k = (t - (tc - dur / 2)) / dur; if (k > 0 && k < 1) glints.push({ x, y, r: r * Math.sin(Math.PI * k), a: Math.sin(Math.PI * k), rot: k * .8 }); };\n  gs(CUES.glint_star, TITLE_LEFT + TB.tw / TS * .085, TITLE_TOP + 6, .5, 150);\n- **厚液斜向扫光参数**：    S.key = { x: -0.78 + 0.06 * Math.sin(t * 0.6) + 0.30 * kd, y: -0.95 + 0.12 * kd,\n      glint: glint1 ? lerp(-900, 1700, inOut(inv(cues.glint - 0.1, cues.glint + 0.75, t))) : lerp(-300, 1900, inOut(g2)),\n  float gb = (p.x*0.8 - p.y*0.6) - uKey.z;\n  col += vec3(1.0,0.95,0.98)*uKey.w*exp(-gb*gb/(2.0*34.0*34.0))*ss(0.35,0.75,side)*(1.0-ss(0.9,1.0,side))*1.1;\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/specular-sweep-glint/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/specular-sweep-glint)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/split-compare-stamp.md","title":"分屏对比与时间戳盖章","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 分屏对比与时间戳盖章\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n旧明信片与今日实景在横屏左右、竖屏上下对比，分割线划过后盖上时间戳。复用地图巡礼的 drawCompare、mountScene、sceneCanvas、paintScene 与对应 CSS。drawCompare 的两侧插画、分割线、边框与时间戳印章。片段：caseT 29→33.4；时长 6.133s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定底图与屏幕锚点，声音由 score.json 挂接。 按 index.html 内联 segments 在原有 4.8 秒之后重放mg-hanazi 原片 8.167–9.5 秒，总时长 6.133 秒。综艺片的认证印章从 2.5 倍缩到落点，旋转回弹并带动相框镜震。画面与音轨沿用同一映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：6.133s\n- **声音 voice**：whoosh、stamp、sub\n- **追加原片区间**：mg-hanazi 原片 8.167–9.5 秒；s = lerp(2.5, 1, E.inQuad(k)); o = clamp(k * 2.2);\ns = 1 - .09 * Math.exp(-w * 16) * Math.cos(w * 44);\nkick(t, C.stamp, 14, 10, 13)\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **分屏**：0s\n- **盖章**：1.65s\n- **时长**：4.8s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置分屏、两侧场景、边框与印章。\n- `依赖`：配置舞台、时间轴、预加载、声音、横竖布局、颗粒与暗角。\n- `需要的数据`：设置对比轨道、明信片与照片画布、横竖布局。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：29→33.4\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/split-compare-stamp/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/split-compare-stamp)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/squash-stretch-bounce.md","title":"预备、拉伸与压扁回弹","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 预备、拉伸与压扁回弹\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 依次重放圆点下落弹射与图标接力片段。保留原片的起跳前压缩、飞行速度导向拉伸、触地压扁与回弹：g=2040，R0=74；首次压缩3帧，回跳高78；弹射用 E.outQt；速度拉伸 st=clamp(speed/5200)*.42；接力落地用 kick(t,上一落地,3.5,.4)。沿用原画面、字体与成品音轨，保持1920×1080、30fps；画面和音轨共用同一时刻映射，声音默认关闭。追加mg-cel-boil原片1.05–5.7秒，保留24fps火苗的蹲压、起跳纵向拉伸、落地压扁回弹和HOPS舞步；起跳sy数组为[2.6,1.3,1.18,1.06,1.0,0.95,1.0,1.06,1.12,1.18,1.24,1.26]，落地压缩幅度-0.44，后接0.14、-0.05衰减。四个重放段总时长10.033333333秒。 在原有 7.883333333 秒之后依次重放mg-liquid 原片 0–2.15 秒；全部重放总时长 10.033333333 秒。液态片沿速度拉伸的液滴在触地时压扁回弹，冠状液臂变细断裂，次级液滴延迟飞出。参数沿用：const G = 5000;                              // gravity px/s^2 (droplets, leaps, drips)\n  const svLand = (d, tl) => { const s = 1.3 + (SV_PUD - 1.3) * spring(tl + 1.3 / 30, 6, d.z); return s < SV_PUD ? SV_PUD - (SV_PUD - s) * 0.45 : s; };\n  const TEN_T = 0.27;\n        r: rr(3.5, big ? 8 : 6), u: d.u + rr(-0.05, 0.05), tEmit: d.tLand + 2 / 30 + rr(0, 1 / 30), tGrow: 0.03, owner: di, melt, fy: rr(-36, 30),\n原有段的画面和时序保持原样，新增段沿用同区间原片音轨，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **下落拉伸**：g=2040；a=-0.12；R0=74；k=min(g*(t-a)/1500,1)*.16；sy=1+k，sx=1/(1+k)。\n- **首次触地**：15/30=.500秒；3帧压缩sy=1-.4*sin(πu)、sx=1+.36*sin(πu)；回跳高78。\n- **再次触地**：24/30=.800秒；2.5帧压缩幅.2/.18。\n- **起跳预备**：27/30–31/30=.900–1.033秒；sy*=1-.3*a，sx*=1+.24*a；y=GY-R0*sy。\n- **弧线弹射**：31/30–40/30=1.033–1.333秒；E.outQt；dt=1/240；st=clamp(speed/5200)*.42；sx=1+st，sy=1/(1+st)。\n- **连续接力预备**：a/o=171/173、185/188、200/203帧；an=E.outQ(inv(a,o,t))；sy乘1-.3*an，sx乘1+.2*an。\n- **连续接力落地**：180/30=6.000、195/30=6.500秒；land=kick(t,上一落地,3.5,.4)；sy乘1-.22*land，sx乘1+.2*land；y补偿R_D*(1-sy)。\n- **火苗跳跃形变**：24fps；s.sy=[2.6,1.3,1.18,1.06,1.0,0.95,1.0,1.06,1.12,1.18,1.24,1.26][fi]；s.sx=1/pow(s.sy,0.8)；落地K(t,[[2.5,-0.44],[2.583,0.14,out2],[2.667,-0.05],[2.75,0]])。\n- **火苗连续舞步**：HOPS=[{t0:2.833,t1:3.0,h:120},{t0:3.333,t1:3.5,h:115},{t0:3.75,t1:4.0,h:175,spin:true}]。\n- **重放总时长**：10.033333333 秒\n- **落滴压扁飞溅参数**：const G = 5000;                              // gravity px/s^2 (droplets, leaps, drips)\n  const svLand = (d, tl) => { const s = 1.3 + (SV_PUD - 1.3) * spring(tl + 1.3 / 30, 6, d.z); return s < SV_PUD ? SV_PUD - (SV_PUD - s) * 0.45 : s; };\n  const TEN_T = 0.27;\n        r: rr(3.5, big ? 8 : 6), u: d.u + rr(-0.05, 0.05), tEmit: d.tLand + 2 / 30 + rr(0, 1 / 30), tGrow: 0.03, owner: di, melt, fy: rr(-36, 30),\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/squash-stretch-bounce/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/squash-stretch-bounce)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/staged-extrusion-build.md","title":"分层伸展组装","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 分层伸展组装\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n复用等距 2.5D 来源案例的原作 window.renderAt(t)，依次重放原片1.42–2.57秒土层、1.95–5.45秒楼房、4.325–6.185秒核心塔，时长6.51秒。土层三层分别延迟0/.15/.3秒向下伸展，后续层段的位置由前层当前伸展量计算。楼房基座先落，墙体延后1/30秒以A.spring(tau,14.8,.61,0)长高，roof_lag=.375秒后屋顶落下，细节再延后.05秒弹出，窗光在def.t0+.42秒启亮。核心塔的SH1/SH2/SH3/SHA为2.3/2/1.6/1.2，较细塔段从前段内部升出；按4.625/4.75/5/5.25/5.5/5.75秒组装基座、三段、天线与光环。保留原作模型、材质、字体、逐段上行音与同区间音轨，1920×1080、30fps，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **土层**：soil=1.62；三层延迟0/.15/.3秒；高度1.3/.9/.8；s2.y=-1.3*u，s3.y=-1.3*u-.9*u2。\n- **墙体**：A.spring(tau,14.8,.61,0)；延后1/30秒；roof_lag=.375；lit0=def.t0+.42。\n- **屋顶与细节**：A.drop(tau-rl,.1,.3,0,.025)；A.spring(TGv-b.t0-cues.roof_lag-.05,24,.5,10)。\n- **塔段**：SH1=2.3，SH2=2.0，SH3=1.6，SHA=1.2；A.spring(T-tw.seg1,17,.6,5)；seg2.y=top1-SH2+SH2*s2-.02。\n- **核心节点**：base=4.625，seg1=4.75，seg2=5，seg3=5.25，antenna=5.5，ring=5.75。\n- **时长**：6.51s；原片1.42–2.57、1.95–5.45、4.325–6.185s。\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments`：设置重放原片的起止时刻，画面与音轨使用同一映射。\n- `index.html 内联配置 → markers / reduced`：设置巧思相对时间轴的中文节点与减少动态时刻。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/staged-extrusion-build/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/staged-extrusion-build)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/stepped-hand-placement.md","title":"抽帧手摆抖动","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 抽帧手摆抖动\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-collage 原片 0–10 秒；总时长 10 秒。运动或停留状态变化 → 位置与旋转按 12fps 或 6fps 取样，并用种子抖动保持手摆纸片感。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原画面、字体、素材、时刻映射和同段音轨，声音默认关闭。参数：const K = t => Math.floor(t * 12 + 1e-4);\nconst Q6 = t => Math.floor(t * 6 + 1e-4) / 6;\nconst boil = (moving) => moving ? { amp: 2, fps: 12 } : { amp: 1.1, fps: 6 };。使用 1920×1080 横屏。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-collage 原片 0–10 秒；1 倍速，总时长 10 秒。\n- **抽帧手摆抖动**：const K = t => Math.floor(t * 12 + 1e-4);\nconst Q6 = t => Math.floor(t * 6 + 1e-4) / 6;\nconst boil = (moving) => moving ? { amp: 2, fps: 12 } : { amp: 1.1, fps: 6 };\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/stepped-hand-placement/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/stepped-hand-placement)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/stepped-palette-daynight.md","title":"色板阶梯昼夜","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 色板阶梯昼夜\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n以原作 PIXEL QUEST 的 renderAt(t) 重放色板阶梯昼夜，按 index.html 内联配置 的 segments 以 1 倍速播放原片 0–10 秒，保留原片画面与同一区间音轨。保留 32 色主色板与 128 色槽，1.6、3.2、4.4 秒分别进入午后、金色和日落；每次用 4 帧完成两级 1/3、2/3 配色插值，再取最近主色。80 个星点按 early=R()<0.4 分组，f194 后开始显示并避开水晶光池；星点每 4 帧轮换 [8,31,29,31] 色阶。8.0、8.1、8.2、8.3 秒的夜色半径为 150、110、70、36，以 (d-wv)/12+0.5 和 Bayer 阈值在暮色、中间色与夜色之间切换。继续调用来源代码，声音默认关闭；使用横屏、时间定位、播放暂停与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：0–10 秒，1 倍速\n- **色板结构**：32 色主色板、128 色槽；每次过渡 4 帧，前 2 帧取 1/3、后 2 帧取 2/3，再映射回最近主色\n- **昼夜节点**：1.6 秒午后、3.2 秒金色、4.4 秒日落\n- **星点显现**：80 个星点，early=R()<0.4，大星概率 0.08；f194/30=6.4667 秒起显示，排除水晶光池半径加 3 的区域\n- **星点闪烁**：每 4 帧轮换 [8,31,29,31] 色阶；#ffffff、#b8c2d9、#4a5270、#b8c2d9\n- **夜色径向收拢**：8.0、8.1、8.2、8.3 秒依次取半径 150、110、70、36；边界按 (d-wv)/12+0.5 与 Bayer 阈值切换暮色、中间色、夜色\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/stepped-palette-daynight/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/stepped-palette-daynight)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/sticker-slap-shadow.md","title":"抬高旋转拍贴","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 抬高旋转拍贴\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速重放以下片段：mg-paperclip 原片 0–0.8 秒；mg-paperclip 原片 0.98–2.5 秒；mg-paperclip 原片 5.56–6.8 秒；总时长 8.73 秒。抬高、放大、倾转的贴纸下落，阴影同步收紧，落定后以衰减摆动与挤压回弹消力。直接调用来源案例的 renderAt(t)，保留原作参数、画面、字体与成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。 按 index.html 内联 segments 在原有 3.56 秒之后重放mg-collage 原片 0–1.4 秒；mg-collage 原片 2.05–2.8 秒；mg-collage 原片 5.96–7.54 秒；mg-collage 原片 7.96–9.4 秒，总时长 8.73 秒。拼贴片将照片、文字纸片和刊名放大拍下，离纸阴影随高度塌缩，落地后逐格挤压回定。画面与音轨沿用同一映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-paperclip 原片 0–0.8 秒；mg-paperclip 原片 0.98–2.5 秒；mg-paperclip 原片 5.56–6.8 秒；1 倍速，巧思时长 8.73 秒。\n- **抬高旋转拍贴**：L69: const shadow=(lift,a=.26)=>`drop-shadow(0 ${6+34*lift}px ${10+34*lift}px rgba(22,34,46,${a-0.08*lift}))`;；L71: function slap(t,land,dur=.2,amp=.3){const p=(t-(land-dur))/dur;if(p<0)return{o:0,s:1+amp,r:6,lift:1};；L73: const w=wob(t-land,4.5,10);return{o:1,s:1-.035*w,r:-.8*w,lift:0};}；L188: const sl={y:pre?-420*(1-he):0,r:pre?-14*(1-he):-.8*sq,s:pre?1+.18*(1-he):1,sx:1+.04*sq,sy:1-.05*sq,lift:pre?1-he:0};\n- **追加原片区间**：mg-collage 原片 0–1.4 秒；mg-collage 原片 2.05–2.8 秒；mg-collage 原片 5.96–7.54 秒；mg-collage 原片 7.96–9.4 秒；if (k < 0) { const u = -k / pre; return { s: 1 + 0.38 * u * u + 0.05 * u, lift: u, k }; }\nif (k === 0) return { s: 0.972, lift: 0, k, sq: 1 };\nc.shadowBlur = 5 + lift * 34; c.shadowOffsetX = 3 + lift * 24; c.shadowOffsetY = 5 + lift * 34;\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段和标记；画面与音轨使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/sticker-slap-shadow/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/sticker-slap-shadow)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/striped-sun-rise.md","title":"条纹落日升起","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 条纹落日升起\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-synthwave 原片 0.9–9.8 秒；总时长 8.9 秒。横向镂空条纹的渐变落日从地平线后升起，下半圆条纹按相位卷动且向下加宽。参数保持原作数值：const SUN_D = 1150, SUN_RPX = 250, SUN_R = SUN_RPX / FPX * SUN_D;\n    float ph = w * 8.5 - uSunTime * .55;\n    float gapF = clamp(w * .42, 0., .62) * step(0., w);\n  const sunPx = lerp(-150, 110, rise) + 16 * eInOutSine((ts - 7.2) / 2.8);\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-synthwave 原片 0.9–9.8 秒；1 倍速，总时长 8.9 秒。\n- **条纹落日升起参数**：const SUN_D = 1150, SUN_RPX = 250, SUN_R = SUN_RPX / FPX * SUN_D;\n    float ph = w * 8.5 - uSunTime * .55;\n    float gapF = clamp(w * .42, 0., .62) * step(0., w);\n  const sunPx = lerp(-150, 110, rise) + 16 * eInOutSine((ts - 7.2) / 2.8);\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/striped-sun-rise/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/striped-sun-rise)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/tape-rewind-chrome-slam.md","title":"倒带冲入落版","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 倒带冲入落版\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-synthwave 原片 3.667–5.1 秒；总时长 1.433 秒。磁带画面先倒退两帧并拖慢压暗，主拍时镀铬字标从放大态冲入，闪光、镜震和跑车加速同步释放。参数保持原作数值：  if (fr >= r0 && fr < r1) return (r0 - 1 - (fr - r0)) / FPS;                          // 2 frames backwards\n  if (fr >= FS - 2 && fr < FS) { const k = clamp((t - (S0 - 3 / 30)) / (3 / 30)); sc = lerp(2.2, 1.0, eInQuart(k)); al = fr === FS - 2 ? .6 : 1; }\n  else if (fr >= FS) { sc = 1 - .045 * Math.sin(uS * 24) * Math.exp(-uS * 7.5); al = 1; }\n  const sh = fr >= FS ? 11 * Math.exp(-uS * 8.5) : 0;\n  \"music_gap\": [4.02, 4.2],\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-synthwave 原片 3.667–5.1 秒；1 倍速，总时长 1.433 秒。\n- **倒带冲入落版参数**：  if (fr >= r0 && fr < r1) return (r0 - 1 - (fr - r0)) / FPS;                          // 2 frames backwards\n  if (fr >= FS - 2 && fr < FS) { const k = clamp((t - (S0 - 3 / 30)) / (3 / 30)); sc = lerp(2.2, 1.0, eInQuart(k)); al = fr === FS - 2 ? .6 : 1; }\n  else if (fr >= FS) { sc = 1 - .045 * Math.sin(uS * 24) * Math.exp(-uS * 7.5); al = 1; }\n  const sh = fr >= FS ? 11 * Math.exp(-uS * 8.5) : 0;\n  \"music_gap\": [4.02, 4.2],\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/tape-rewind-chrome-slam/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/tape-rewind-chrome-slam)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/velocity-neon-grid-smear.md","title":"网格速度拖影","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 网格速度拖影\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-synthwave 原片 0–9.867 秒；总时长 9.867 秒。透视霓虹网格随公路速度向镜头推进，横向线条按快门位移展宽并补偿亮度，路侧反光条同步拉长。参数保持原作数值：    vec2 fb = fw + vec2(0., uBlur);                       // transverse lines smeared by this sample's travel (no strobing)\n    float eC = max(1.5 * fw.y / (1.5 * fw.y + uBlur), .12), eG = max(6.8 * fw.y / (6.8 * fw.y + uBlur), .10);   // energy-conserving smear\n  U.uBlur.value = stepped ? 0 : speed(ts) * SHUT / FPS / MBS / 5;\n  postU.uStr.value = stepped ? 1 : 1 + speed(ts) * SHUT / FPS / MBS / CAP_L;\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-synthwave 原片 0–9.867 秒；1 倍速，总时长 9.867 秒。\n- **网格速度拖影参数**：    vec2 fb = fw + vec2(0., uBlur);                       // transverse lines smeared by this sample's travel (no strobing)\n    float eC = max(1.5 * fw.y / (1.5 * fw.y + uBlur), .12), eG = max(6.8 * fw.y / (6.8 * fw.y + uBlur), .10);   // energy-conserving smear\n  U.uBlur.value = stepped ? 0 : speed(ts) * SHUT / FPS / MBS / 5;\n  postU.uStr.value = stepped ? 1 : 1 + speed(ts) * SHUT / FPS / MBS / CAP_L;\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/velocity-neon-grid-smear/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/velocity-neon-grid-smear)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/vertical-title-blur.md","title":"竖排汉字模糊入场 + 英文打字","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 竖排汉字模糊入场 + 英文打字\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n竖排大字从模糊中显影，配副标题与逐字打字；片名、地点、回忆字幕与收尾共用一套入场。复用地图巡礼的 drawIntro、drawLocTitle、drawFlashback、drawOutro、blurIn、typeIn、mountScene、paintScene 与对应 CSS。片名、地点标题、全屏回忆插画与竖排字幕，以及 drawOutro 的 fin.。片段：caseT 3.8→8；caseT 17.9→21.6；caseT 25.5→29.6；caseT 57.9→60；时长 16s。使用横屏 1920×1080 与竖屏 1080×1920 的案例布局；按 config.js 的 segments / markers 重放，使用固定底图与屏幕锚点，声音由 score.json 挂接。 按 index.html 内联 segments 在原有 14.1 秒之后重放mg-3d-render 原片 7.8–9.7 秒，总时长 16 秒。三维片的英文标语逐词上移、去模糊并收字距，横线和中文随后显现。画面与音轨沿用同一映射，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **时长**：16s\n- **声音 voice**：key、tick、bell、shimmer、sub\n- **追加原片区间**：mg-3d-render 原片 7.8–9.7 秒；const u = prog(t, T0 + 0.07 * k, 0.9);\nw.style.filter = `blur(${(1 - e) * 7}px)`;\nw.style.letterSpacing = `${0.26 + (1 - e) * 0.2}em`;\nconst uz = prog(t, T0 + 0.30, 0.9), ez = expoOut(uz);\n\n## 动效 Token\n\n- **片名**：0s\n- **地点标题**：4.2s\n- **回忆竖排字幕**：7.9s\n- **fin.**：12s\n- **时长**：14.1s\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `动效函数`：配置片名、地名、回忆、收尾的模糊与打字入场。\n- `依赖`：配置舞台、时间轴、预加载、声音、横竖布局、颗粒与暗角。\n- `需要的数据`：设置片名、地点、回忆字幕、收尾与横竖布局。\n- `config.js → segments / markers`：3.8→8/17.9→21.6/25.5→29.6/57.9→60\n- `score.json`：调整声音事件，按巧思时间对齐，保留音色参数。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/vertical-title-blur/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/vertical-title-blur)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/vhs-event-row-tear.md","title":"磁带行撕色偏","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 磁带行撕色偏\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n通过 MotionKit.replay 以 1 倍速依次重放mg-synthwave 原片 0.17–9.867 秒；总时长 9.697 秒。故障节点按固定帧种子选择行段错位，叠加色偏与一次垂直跳帧，随后恢复稳定画面。参数保持原作数值：    float gOn = uGlitch * step(.82, h21(vec2(gRow, uGSeed)));\n  let glv = 0, gseed = 0; for (const gt of CUES.glitches) { const g0 = HIT(gt); if (fr >= g0 && fr < g0 + 2) { glv = 1; gseed = gt * 13.7 + fr; } }\n  V.uVSlip.value = fr === HIT(CUES.vslip) ? 12 : fr === FSTOP ? -12 : 0;\n  \"glitches\": [0.37, 0.63, 1.53, 2.47, 3.23, 6.07, 7.77, 9.37],\n直接调用来源案例 renderAt(t)，沿用画面、字体和同区间成品音轨，声音默认关闭。使用 1920×1080 横屏、30fps，支持播放、暂停、时间定位与减少动态偏好。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **原片重放区间**：mg-synthwave 原片 0.17–9.867 秒；1 倍速，总时长 9.697 秒。\n- **磁带行撕色偏参数**：    float gOn = uGlitch * step(.82, h21(vec2(gRow, uGSeed)));\n  let glv = 0, gseed = 0; for (const gt of CUES.glitches) { const g0 = HIT(gt); if (fr >= g0 && fr < g0 + 2) { glv = 1; gseed = gt * 13.7 + fr; } }\n  V.uVSlip.value = fr === HIT(CUES.vslip) ? 12 : fr === FSTOP ? -12 : 0;\n  \"glitches\": [0.37, 0.63, 1.53, 2.47, 3.23, 6.07, 7.77, 9.37],\n\n## 迁移\n\n- `index.html 内联配置 → segments / markers`：调整来源片段与中文节点，画面和声音使用同一时刻映射。\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/vhs-event-row-tear/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/vhs-event-row-tear)\n"},{"path":"prompts/patterns/wave-array.md","title":"阵列选择波浪","group":"巧思 Prompt","content":"# 阵列选择波浪\n\n## 实现 Prompt\n\n从当前archive-os裁出GLB阵列选择机制，保留ArchiveScene及所需模块与选档/切列声音函数，模型和MiSans字形引用../../cases/archive-os/film/app/。保持9×32循环对象池、列距5.2与行距0.62，以及当前材质、光照、相机和含速度归位。每次选择即时emit，最多6次；d = hypot(Δrow, 2.2Δlane)，位移=0.8 · smooth(age/0.2) · exp(−1.15age) · cos((d−8age)·0.58) · exp(−0.5((d−8age)/3.4)²)，保留负值，3.2s后清除，叠加clamp到±0.6世界单位。选中档案以速率4.2临界阻尼升高0.4世界单位。使用案例62.6–77.6s四向输入表；按60Hz事件回放推导render(t)，后退时重建状态，外部seek/play恢复自动驾驶。可调波参数与输入表集中在index.html顶部CONFIG；声音默认关闭，减少动态使用案例reducedMotion预设。 在原有 15 秒之后依次重放mg-liquid 原片 7–9.966666667 秒；全部重放总时长 17.966666667 秒。液态字标的衰减挤压波按字母间0.04秒延迟传播，末滴一拍从右向左返回。参数沿用：  const JELLY_HITS = [[7.2, 0.07, 1], [7.6, 0.035, 1], [8.0, 0.05, 1], [8.4, 0.045, -1], [8.8, 0.03, 1], [9.2, 0.018, 1]];                       // half-time snare 7.2, kicks 7.4 / 8.0 in the drop\n        for (const [tk, ak, dk] of JELLY_HITS) jelly += ak * wob(t - tk - (dk > 0 ? i : 3 - i) * 0.04, 3.4, 0.22);\n        const sxJ = 1 + 0.12 * sq + jelly + breathe, syJ = 1 - 0.08 * sq + breathe - jelly * 0.6;\n原有段的画面和时序保持原样，新增段沿用同区间原片音轨，声音默认关闭。\n\n## 视频生成 Prompt\n\n制作15秒的RHINE LAB GLB档案阵列选择片段，时间对应archive-os的62.6–77.6秒。保留米灰色磨砂档案、真实模型层次、原材质与长焦相机。四向浏览时每次选档即时发出带正负位移的Gaussian/cos波包，波前以每秒8距离单位向外行进，2.2倍列距参与欧氏距离；选中模型升高0.4世界单位，旧模型独立回落。9秒与9.35秒连续切列时叠加余波，最多6次，幅度限制±0.6，3.2秒清除。需要声音时使用案例tick与column原函数。\n\n## 负向约束\n\n不要CSS三面方块，不要7×9有限网格，不要曼哈顿距离，不要按每格70ms延迟的指数sin波，不要只保留最近三次，不要裁掉负波，不要等模型抬起后才发波，不要把世界单位写成px，不要替换模型、材质、字体或声音，不要跨目录引用案例。\n\n## 参数\n\n- **抬起**：与选择脉冲同时开始，临界阻尼速率4.2，目标0.4世界单位\n- **波前**：d−8age推动波包向外传播，0.2秒平滑起振，正负波均保留\n- **叠加**：最多最近6次，3.2秒后清除；合成幅度限制为±0.6世界单位\n- **示例片段**：15秒，案例62.6秒为Demo零点；输入时刻与案例四向浏览帧对齐\n- **总时长**：17.966666667 秒\n- **字标果冻拍波参数**：  const JELLY_HITS = [[7.2, 0.07, 1], [7.6, 0.035, 1], [8.0, 0.05, 1], [8.4, 0.045, -1], [8.8, 0.03, 1], [9.2, 0.018, 1]];                       // half-time snare 7.2, kicks 7.4 / 8.0 in the drop\n        for (const [tk, ak, dk] of JELLY_HITS) jelly += ak * wob(t - tk - (dk > 0 ? i : 3 - i) * 0.04, 3.4, 0.22);\n        const sxJ = 1 + 0.12 * sq + jelly + breathe, syJ = 1 - 0.08 * sq + breathe - jelly * 0.6;\n\n[打开 Demo](../../demos/patterns/wave-array/index.html) · [在库中查看](../../patterns.html#pattern/wave-array)\n"}];
